window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4801,"title":"Chapter 4801: Words Of Love","paragraphs":["The door of the ward opened. A doctor in a white coat strode in with a serious expression, followed by a few intern doctors.","The doctor saw Xia Jinyuan in his military uniform and said in surprise, \"No wonder. I thought that you were more energetic than us when you walked. As it turns out, you’re a soldier too.\"","When he saw Ye Jian in her military uniform, the doctor said, \"You’re so energetic. I can’t even tell that you’re injured.\"","Then, the doctor said sternly to the intern behind him, \"In the future, you’ll also encounter patients who are not very cooperative with doctors. For instance, this patient is not very cooperative with me.","\"The door of the ward can’t be locked. It’s so that if the patient is in danger, the medical staff can come in immediately to save them. If you lock the door, you’ll have privacy, but there’ll also be hidden dangers.\"","After the doctor finished speaking, the intern doctors behind lowered their heads and tried their best not to smile.","Ye Jian’s face was a little hot. Xia Jinyuan accepted the doctor’s criticism seriously and promised that there wouldn’t be a next time. It was just a habit.","\"A soldier is indeed different. Your attitude toward admitting your mistake is so good that I’m embarrassed to continue speaking.\" A smile finally appeared on the serious doctor’s face. Then, he checked Ye Jian’s wounds and changed her dressing.","The task of changing the dressing could actually be handed over to the nurse. Considering that Ye Jian would be leaving the hospital today, the doctor was afraid that the wounds would split open, so he personally changed the dressing.","The wounds were doing very well and didn’t split. Hence, Xia Jinyuan was praised by the doctor. He even smiled at Ye Jian and said, \"Your boyfriend is not bad. He takes good care of you. I won’t have to worry about leaving you in his hands.","\"It’s just that...\" The doctor who was tying the bandage around Ye Jian’s shoulder tilted his head and saw Lieutenant Colonel Xia standing there with a cold expression. The doctor said, \"It’s just that he doesn’t look like someone who knows how to take care of others.\"","Xia Jinyuan’s forehead was twitching. He endured the fact that several intern doctors were watching him. Now, because of the doctor’s words, he took a deep breath. He smiled and said, \"The air conditioner in the ward is a little strong. Are you done? If you are, I’ll help my girlfriend put on her clothes.\"","Ye Jian, who had only put down one side of her sleeve to get her bandages dressed, knew that her boyfriend was being petty again.","There was no gender in the eyes of doctors.","However, she felt a little awkward even with just one sleeve down as she was surrounded by a few young intern doctors. Hence, she cooperated with her petty boyfriend and said that the air conditioner was cold.","The doctor looked at the two of them. When he left, he laughed out loud..","\"The doctor talks too much. It’s worrisome.\" Lieutenant Colonel Xia carefully helped Ye Jian lie down after sending the doctor off. \"Turn your body a little. Don’t press on the wound on your waist. I just took a look. It’s already starting to scab. You can lie down flat and sleep soon.\"","Ye Jian lay on her side. She felt the pillow on her back and leaned over. Her back, which had been tense for more than two hours, relaxed. She let out a long and lazy moan. It was extremely comfortable.","\"In the next few days, you can’t walk around like today. Fortunately, your wounds didn’t split open.\" Xia Jinyuan bent down and tidied the bed. He tried his best to make Ye Jian feel more comfortable. His gaze was gentle as he served her. One could see his cautiousness from his every move.","\"I don’t look like someone who knows how to take care of others? I clearly know how to take care of my girlfriend!\"","In the end, Xia Jinyuan sat by the bed and held Ye Jian’s hand. He snorted like a child, making Ye Jian smile. \"Oh, you. The doctor was just saying it casually. How could you take it to heart? I know how good my man is at taking care of me. It’s better if other people misunderstand!\""]},{"number":4802,"title":"Chapter 4802: Wait","paragraphs":["This sentence made Xia Jinyuan smile. Only in front of the woman he loved would a handsome man with a majestic aura like him be a little childish.","Likewise, Ye Jian would only show her weakness in front of Xia Jinyuan.","Because they were one, there was no need to hide their emotions.","Lieutenant Colonel Xia kissed Ye Jian’s fingers and stared at his girlfriend with his gentle gaze. His gentleness made Ye Jian’s heart pound. \"Why are you always looking at me? You’re not allowed to look.\"","\"That won’t do. Besides you, who else can I look at?\"","The young lieutenant colonel raised his eyebrows and smiled, looking like a lion that had eaten and drunk its fill. He appeared lazy and luxurious. No one could compare to his elegance.","Ye Jian raised her hand slightly and pulled down his cap to cover the pair of black eyes that made her heart pound.","The roguish and elegant Captain Xia was exactly what she liked!","Xia Jinyuan, whose eyes were covered, laughed in a low voice. His little fox was shy again, but the occasional words of love made his heart, which had been tempered by the flames of war, bloom with joy.","He took off his cap and moved closer to her. The two leaned against each other and rubbed their ears against each other.","\"Little fox, my baby, get well quickly. I’m waiting for you to return to the team. Our comrades are also waiting for you to return to the team.\" His deep voice was like wine, intoxicating.","Ye Jian nodded. Her bright eyes were filled with the youth of a lady. She tilted her head slightly and rubbed her soft lips against his handsome face. \"I’ll recuperate well and strive to be discharged from the hospital as soon as possible.\"","From today onward, she was no longer a student of the military school. She was an active soldier who would carry out any order immediately.","She would no longer live in the military school. She would live in the Xueyu unit in the future.","However...","Ye Jian asked, \"Does that mean that I won’t go through an internship?\"","That was a good question.","Xia Jinyuan was stunned for a moment before replying, \"There has never been a case of direct recruitment in the brigade. We have to ask the boss.\"","Due to the special nature of the Xueyu unit, all the special forces soldiers didn’t belong to any military district. However, they all had introductions on their personal resumes. Hence, their resumes would look solid. Even if someone wanted to check, they wouldn’t be able to find any problems.","If Ye Jian went to the Xueyu unit directly, she would’ve only graduated from the military school. She would have no affiliations with another military unit. If someone wanted to investigate, they would notice something amiss and Ye Jian might be exposed.","After being asked by Ye Jian, Xia Jinyuan remembered that Ye Jian couldn’t be directly recruited into the brigade.","Ye Jian didn’t expect this either. She was dumbfounded.","\"Why don’t you ask now? The boss is still in Xiang City.\"","Naturally, they had to ask such a big question immediately!","Major General Yang felt refreshed when he received the call. He laughed in front of the leaders of the provincial military district. After he finished laughing, he signaled that he would be stepping away to answer the call.","\"The military will make arrangements for Little Ye. As for you, scram back to the military unit. Don’t think too much.\"","As the call was on speaker, Ye Jian blinked with a complicated expression.","She thought that she would go over after graduating, but she didn’t expect...","She could only follow the arrangements.","After hanging up, Xia Jinyuan paced back and forth in the ward.","He was worried, but Ye Jian laughed heartlessly.","\"Why are you still laughing? You heartless fellow.\" Xia Jinyuan walked back and forth a few times. After confirming that he couldn’t change anything, he sat down again and flicked Ye Jian’s forehead with his fingers. \"Well, this is is the only way. We’ll just have to wait!\""]},{"number":4803,"title":"Chapter 4803: Value As A Boyfriend","paragraphs":["In the afternoon, Xu Wen, Song Zhiqiu, He Jing, and a few other comrades who would only leave the school tomorrow came to the hospital to visit Ye Jian. At 6:00 pm, Ye Jian’s eyes were slightly red as she sent He Jing, who was leaving tonight, off.","The next day, when Xu Wen left, Ye Jian sent her off through a phone call. It was the same with the other students. She sent them off through phone calls.","Song Zhiqiu sent Xu Wen to the train station. Before the train departed, he hugged Xu Wen tightly and leaned over to her ear. \"You must wait for me!\"","Xu Wen’s eyes were red. She didn’t answer. She just buried her head in his arms and nodded vigorously.","If she waited for him, would he wait for her?","Time would tell!","For the next few days, separations took place. One by one, the former classmates embarked on a long journey. From then on, they would stand at their respective posts and become active soldiers.","From then on, their four years in the military school would become a memory.","Ye Jian definitely needed to be sent to a military unit. However, which military unit she would go to became the topic of debate among the relevant leaders of the military.","The resumes of the Outstanding Students in the military school would be screened by the military first. After the military finished selecting the relevant Outstanding Students, they would be assigned to other military units. Ye Jian’s resume could be said to shine brightly. The more outstanding she was, the more the relevant units would fight for her. The more they fought, the more controversial it would be. In the end, it would be harder to assign her.","The relevant units all wanted Outstanding Students and had their own opinions. Although they wouldn’t go as far as to slap the table and quarrel, they would definitely harbor ulterior motives.","Xia Jinyuan, who had come back to his senses and accepted that Ye Jian still needed to go through an internship, didn’t know that the military had been arguing about this for a few days.","On the fifth day of Ye Jian’s recuperation, the scabs on her face started to fall off. After meticulous care, her pale face, which was caused by excessive blood loss, had regained its color. She was like a red rose stained with morning dew. There was beauty and coldness in her beauty.","Her unintentional smile could make Xia Jinyuan lose his soul every time. It made him secretly scold himself many times that beauty would be the death of him one day.","The military units were still discussing among themselves. Major General Yang, who had been observing for a long time, wanted to slam the table and tell them that no matter how noisy they were, Ye Jian was still his soldier. Meanwhile, Xia Jinyuan was carefully tying the bandages around Ye Jian’s back.","Xia Jinyuan refused to let the nurses change Ye Jian’s dressing. Once again, he became the ’family member’ of the patient who didn’t cooperate with the doctor.","At first, the nurses didn’t agree. Changing the dressing was their responsibility. How could they let the patient’s family change the dressing themselves?","However, Xia Jinyuan was a difficult person to deal with. Even Major General Yang and Commander Xia often found him to be a trouble. If he wanted to do something, he would never give in.","The nurses were stunned for a moment. In the end, they handed over the medicine tray and sat at the side. \"Try it. We’ll watch from the side.\"","Xia Jinyuan said that their military unit was far away and the patient couldn’t stay in the hospital until her wounds had completely recovered. She would definitely be sent back to the military unit. In order to be able to change her dressing, he wanted to learn and try from today onward.","In short, he explained everything. The two nurses looked at each other. They felt that if they didn’t let the young lieutenant colonel change the patient’s dressing today, they would feel deeply guilty.","Ye Jian was dumbfounded when she saw the dedicated nurses taking the initiative to teach Xia Jinyuan."]},{"number":4804,"title":"Chapter 4804: Someone Else’s Boyfriend","paragraphs":["Bandaging wounds and treating injuries were the basic skills of the Xueyu unit’s special forces on the battlefield. Hence, Xia Jinyuan was very fast to pick up the skill, and the nurses praised him.","Ye Jian looked at the man who was unleashing another wave of charisma. She turned her head away silently.","Fortunately, the nurses on the floor all knew that she and Captain Xia were boyfriend and girlfriend. In addition, the nurses were very well-mannered, so they didn’t overstep.","They just said things like, ’Your boyfriend is really good. He’s handsome and obedient. It’s hard to find such a guy,’ ’You’re so lucky to have found such a good boyfriend. He’s many times better than the men outside,’ ’He’s handsome, meticulous, and willing to work without complaint. You have to keep an eye on such a good boyfriend.’ Ye Jian heard such things from the first day to the fifth day.","She would probably have to continue listening to these things for the next four days.","She had been hospitalized for at least five days. She just needed to bear with it!","In the eyes of the nurses, Xia Jinyuan, who had been staying in the hospital to take care of Ye Jian for five days, was the perfect boyfriend. Now, he even changed her bandages personally and was very familiar with it. The young nurse beside him said to Ye Jian, \"What a blessing. He even knows how to change the bandages. He can do it by himself from now on. We don’t have to watch from the side anymore.\"","How could Ye Jian answer?","Naturally, she smiled politely and thanked her.","As for Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who was being all charming, he was tying the bandages seriously. It was as if he didn’t hear what the nurse beside him said. He didn’t interact much with the nurses or talk to them.","If they were to pick on a flaw, it was that the ladies at the nurses’ station felt that Lieutenant Colonel Xia was too cold and didn’t like to interact too much with other women. Even nurses like them kept a distance from him except when they had to ask questions. He was so cold that they didn’t dare to approach him easily.","Just as the bandages were wrapped, Commander Xia’s message arrived. Xia Jinyuan didn’t look at it immediately. He retracted his hand and asked the nurses with a serious expression, \"Is this alright?\"","Of course, it was alright. If not, she wouldn’t have told Ye Jian that the nurses didn’t have to watch over in the future.","After confirming that there were no problems, the nurse gave Ye Jian an anti-inflammatory drip and pushed the medical cart that was filled with IV drips for various wards away. The younger nurse sighed enviously. \"Her boyfriend really dotes on her. This is the first time I’ve seen him. How enviable.\"","\"What’s there to be envious of? Didn’t you see the injuries on her body? In the future, don’t talk about the patient’s private matters in front of the patient. No matter how good a boyfriend is, he’s still someone else’s boyfriend. There’s nothing to be envious of,\" the older nurse replied with a smile. She even had a child now. She only took a few glances at the handsome family member who was accompanying the patient in Ward 28 and never participated in the conversations of her young and unmarried colleagues.","If it weren’t for the fact that her colleague was so envious, she wouldn’t have said anything.","The younger nurse thought for a moment and nodded thoughtfully. \"That’s right. No matter how good he is, he’s someone else’s boyfriend. What does it have to do with me?\"","\"It has nothing to do with you.\"","\"Well, it has a little to do with me. After all, I’m in charge of the patient.\"","The small talk ended as they entered the next ward. Ye Jian, who was staying in Ward 26, read the message on her cell phone and was dumbfounded again. \"They’re fighting over where I should be assigned? That’s impossible.\"","There were so many Outstanding Students, yet they spent a few days fighting over her? Why did it sound unbelievable?"]},{"number":4805,"title":"Chapter 4805: Fight","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan, who was both worried and happy, took back his cell phone. Seeing that Ye Jian didn’t have any self-awareness, he shook his head and laughed. \"Little fox, besides me and the major general, the Nanguang Military District, Linnan Military District, Linchuan Military District, and the navy all know how good you are.\"","The Nanguang Military District was the military district that Ye Jian was sent to previously. The Linnan Military District was where she did her first-year military exercise. Coincidentally, there were leaders from the Linchuan Military District present. The Linchuan Military District was also led by Political Commissar Yan. Commander Dong was the chief of the navy and also Li Jinnian’s direct superior.","They were all acquaintances and knew Ye Jian well.","After Xia Jinyuan reported the military districts, Ye Jian finally realized her popularity. She was a little frightened and happy.","She was afraid that the military districts would fight for her. She didn’t want them to refuse to release her after her internship ended.","As it turned out, she was still being fought over by a few military districts, which proved that her hard work had paid off.","Lieutenant Colonel Xia was not in a good mood as his soldier was being targeted by other military districts.","He gritted his teeth, and his expression turned cold. \"It’s fine if the army’s military districts are fighting for you. After all, we’re all in the same service. But why did the navy join in the fun? I told them earlier that I wouldn’t let you go to the navy. Why are they still being a nuisance?\"","Xia Jinyuan wasn’t worried about the military districts fighting over Ye Jian. Even if they snatched her, Ye Jian would still return to the Xueyu unit in the end.","But the navy was different.","When he was reminded of Commander Dong, Xia Jinyuan immediately thought of a cousin-in-law who he was quite afraid of but could not offend... Demon King Li Jinnian!","Ye Jian thought for a moment and looked at Xia Jinyuan silently. The two of them looked at each other for a while. Ye Jian coughed and looked away.","She could read the thoughts in Captain Xia’s eyes.","Could it be... that her cousin was interfering on purpose?","[Cousin-in-law, other than snatching away your precious cousin, the biggest grudge you might have against me is that I suppressed you during training back then. You wouldn’t hold a grudge until now and think of taking revenge on me, right?]","Xia Jinyuan said in a low voice. His slender fingers quickly flipped through the phone number stored in his phone and found the contact saved as ’Demon King’. Xia Jinyuan first sent a message to his cousin-in-law.","After sending the message, he called his father.","Commander Xia took a look at his phone when Xia Jinyuan called. Then, he stood up and nodded at the generals who wanted to assign Ye Jian to their own military district. He asked them to discuss it first. He would take the call outside.","It was rare for the big shots of the various military districts to gather at the military headquarters. However, this time, they would be going to the desert in Dun City for a drill in August. They gathered at the military headquarters this time because of that, and they happened to be in time for the distribution of the students from the various military schools. The leaders of the various military districts who knew about Ye Jian took the opportunity to ask for her.","However, no one expected that... other than their military district, there were other military districts that had the same intention.","Even the navy was joining in the fun!","Everyone wanted her, and no one wanted to give in. This caused Ye Jian’s path to freeze completely. The Outstanding Students who were supposed to be assigned the earliest became the last and hardest students to be assigned.","The call was connected. Before Xia Jinyuan could say anything, Commander Xia asked Ye Jian to answer the call.","Ye Jian, who was still waiting for the news, looked at the cell phone and whispered, \"Why me?\" Then, she took the cell phone.","Commander Xia was concerned about Ye Jian’s recovery."]},{"number":4806,"title":"Chapter 4806: Surrounded","paragraphs":["Commander Xia was the one who spoke the entire time. Ye Jian listened quietly and only replied occasionally.","However, the occasional replies made Xia Jinyuan’s heart jump. He gestured at the side and moved his lips to signal Ye Jian not to answer.","Every time Ye Jian took the time to listen to Xia Jinyuan’s opinion and answered a little slower, Commander Xia, who was on the other end of the cell phone, would say, \"Little Six is up to no good again.\" It happened two times in a row, and Ye Jian closed her eyes guiltily. She stopped looking at Xia Jinyuan.","Seeing that she had closed her eyes, his handsome face turned gloomy. Xia Jinyuan moved closer to Ye Jian’s ear. His thin lips touched Ye Jian’s ear, and his hot breath rushed into her ear. It was so ticklish that Ye Jian raised her hand to push him away.","\"Don’t agree. Once you agree, there’s no way you can change your mind! Reject him directly!\"","How could Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who was hoping that his girlfriend would join the Xueyu unit soon, not be anxious?","Ye Jian’s first reply was, \"You want me to lead a new team? An entire team of female soldiers?\"","Her second reply was, \"I can overcome the hardships. The main thing is that I don’t have any experience leading a team.\"","Her third reply was, \"What do you mean?\"","Even though Xia Jinyuan didn’t hear what Commander Xia said, he could vaguely guess what it had to do with.","A brand new company that only had female soldiers. And the military wanted Ye Jian to train them!","Ye Jian pushed his head away and replied to Commander Xia, \"Commander, I’m a little nervous about this. I’m mainly inexperienced and afraid that I won’t be able to lead the soldiers well. Can I consider things first?\"","Xia Jinyuan heaved a sigh of relief. It was good that she didn’t agree!","Commander Xia smiled and said, \"I’m merely discussing with you. Of course, you have the right to consider it. Is Little Six nagging at the side again? Don’t spoil him. He can’t wait for you to join his team.","\"As for me, I naturally hope that you can go to the military unit as soon as possible. However, I still have to consider your future development. I can’t ruin the follow-up arrangements because of impatience.\"","Commander Xia had some thoughts about arranging for Ye Jian to lead a brand new company consisting of female soldiers. He and the major general considered it together and agreed that it would be very helpful for Ye Jian’s future development.","Before the call ended, a message was sent to her cell phone. Ye Jian ignored it and listened attentively.","\"As for the time, it can be as short as half a year or as long as a year. The special forces soldiers in Little Six’s team have more than a year of military unit experience. Although you’ve long been accepted by them, you should still add to your personal resume.\"","\"Think about it carefully. Answer me after you think about it. Pass the cell phone to Little Six. I’ll talk to him.\"","Ye Jian replied, \"Wait a moment.\" She immediately passed the phone to Xia Jinyuan, who was already thinking of snatching the cell phone from her.","Xia Jinyuan took the cell phone with his left hand and caressed Ye Jian’s forehead with his right hand. He whispered, \"I’ll go outside. You rest for a while.\" He held the cell phone tightly and walked out of the ward with a cold expression.","Far away in the sea in the south, Li Jinnian came out of the shower. He walked to the desk and picked up the phone that had sent a message five minutes ago.","He pressed the screen of his cell phone and realized that there were no new messages. Li Jinnian entered the message box and saw that the message he sent five minutes ago did not indicate that the transmission had failed. He put down his cell phone.","Ha, he wanted to see how long Xia Jinyuan could remain calm!","Xia Jinyuan had kidnapped his cousin when she was still young, causing his uncle to be afraid that his cousin, who had just returned, would marry into the Xia family immediately. He couldn’t bear to let his uncle go through that, so he naturally had to share the burden.","If he could transfer his cousin to the navy, even if Xia Jinyuan wanted to get married early, was that possible?","Dream on!"]},{"number":4807,"title":"Chapter 4807: Cousin-In-Law","paragraphs":["Even after Li Jinnian changed his clothes and washed his clothes, he didn’t receive a message from Xia Jinyuan on his cell phone. Instead, he received a call from Commander Dong of the navy.","Commander Dong wasn’t participating in the August exercise. He just came to the capital city to report on the progress of the maritime-related construction project. He didn’t know that the leaders of a few military districts were fighting for Ye Jian.","It was not until today when he came to the military again and saw Commander Xia that he knew that besides Commander Xia, the Nanguang Military District, Linnan Military District, and Linchuan Military District were all fighting for Ye Jian.","Li Jinnian pressed the answer button and said his name. Commander Dong looked at Commander Xia, who was still on the phone, and smiled. \"Jinnian, there’s a 99% chance that your plan will fail. Besides our navy, the Nanguang Military District, Linnan Military District, and Linchuan Military District are all fighting for Little Ye. Do you think I should join in the fun?","\"Last time, Little Ye told me clearly that she had no intention of coming to the navy. If she doesn’t agree, I’m sure the military will not assign her to the navy.\"","The Nanguang Military District, Linnan Military District, and Linchuan Military District were all fighting for her?","Li Jinnian hung his navy camouflage jacket up to dry with one hand. A faint smile flashed past his cold eyes. He replied in his usual cold voice, \"The three military districts are all fighting for her. The leaders of the other two military districts might not be satisfied with which military district Ye Jian is assigned to. Sometimes, striking a balance could benefit the others.\"","Commander Dong immediately understood. If Commander Xia weren’t on the phone, he would have laughed out loud. \"That’s right. If the three military districts are fighting for her, our navy might benefit from it.","\"Wait for my news. Whether we succeed or not, I’ll fight for it. It’ll be a pity if such a good talent doesn’t join our navy.\"","\"Yes, I’ll wait for your good news.\"","Li Jinnian waited for Commander Dong to hang up before pacing back to his room from the balcony.","The unit assigned Li Jinnian a single dormitory with a balcony and bathroom. It was not too big, but it was clean and tidy. Even the things on the desk were arranged neatly into a straight line.","Li Jinnian, who was sitting at the desk, opened the drawer and took out a photo frame. The photo in the frame was a family photo.","Old Master Fu, who had white hair and wise eyes, sat at the front. Behind him was Mr. Fu. On Mr. Fu’s left was Li Jinnian, and on his right was Ye Jian. The family of four took their first family photo after the reunion.","Every time he saw the family photo, Li Jinnian’s company’s cold gaze would become exceptionally gentle.","Whether he could get his cousin to come to the navy or not was secondary. The main thing was... he wanted to give Xia Jinyuan more work and give him a headache.","Didn’t Xia Jinyuan say that his cousin would definitely go to the Xueyu unit after graduation?","’Let’s give it a try.’","But he knew that she would definitely go.","Ye Jian was focused on Xia Jinyuan and the Xueyu unit.","However, it was hard to say if it would go according to Xia Jinyuan’s plan.","The phone on the desk vibrated. Li Jinnian placed the photo frame on the desk, where he could see it when he looked up. Then, he picked up the phone at the side.","Narrowing his eyes slightly, he calmly pressed the answer button.","Not bad. The man endured for nearly 20 minutes before calling. He was calmer than he thought.","Xia Jinyuan was now besieged on all sides. He had been hiding his treasure well, so why did he cause a pile of trouble the moment Ye Jian graduated?"]},{"number":4808,"title":"Chapter 4808: Test","paragraphs":["Nanguang, Linnan, Linchuan, and the navy all wanted to snatch her. In the end, they might even ask Ye Jian to train a brand new female soldier company. Xia Jinyuan’s handsome face was so dark that it was as if there was a gray cloud hovering above his head.","The call went through. Without waiting for Li Jinnian to speak, Xia Jinyuan let out a long sigh and said helplessly, \"Demon King, why are you joining in too? Ye Jian has made it clear that she won’t go to the navy.\"","\"In the military unit, personal intentions are invalid. Soldiers only need to obey orders. Whether she joins the navy or not isn’t up to her to decide.\"","Even through the radio waves, Li Jinnian could feel Xia Jinyuan’s helplessness. His thin lips moved slightly, and his indifferent voice made people think that he was unaware of everything.","Xia Jinyuan knew that he was right. Li Jinnian definitely played the biggest role in the navy suddenly wanting Ye Jian to join them.","\"Although she can’t make the decision alone, since she has made it clear, as her cousin, shouldn’t you respect her choice? Now, besides the navy, there are three other military districts that want her. It was supposed to be a good thing, but because of the competition, my father just finished talking to my girlfriend.","\"They talked about how she was in a dilemma and didn’t know what to do.\"","Li Jinnian narrowed his eyes. \"Commander Xia is getting my cousin to choose? Give her the phone. I’ll talk to my cousin.\"","\"Do you think you can talk her into joining the navy? You’re thinking too much. My father won’t let her do that. He plans to let Ye Jian lead a brand new company consisting of female soldiers. He won’t let her join your navy.\"","\"Lead a new company? That won’t benefit our navy, but it won’t benefit you either. I think it’s not bad.\" If Li Jinnian didn’t have a cold temperament, he would have laughed.","As it turned out, he didn’t need to test Xia Jinyuan. Commander Xia, his biological father, was already doing it.","Just like what Uncle Fu said, it was not good for the two of them to be together now. To be truly together meant they could hold on to their hearts and endure loneliness. Even if they were in different places, their hearts would still be together and they would be inseparable.","Ye Jian was too young. She was only 22 years old after graduating from the military school. She wasn’t mature enough. She was good at her work, but her personal emotions were always fluctuating. There were also many variables.","It was better to wait until she was older and knew what she wanted. Only then would her heart be truly settled. Her relationship would be more stable and she would be happier.","While testing Xia Jinyuan, Li Jinnian was also testing Ye Jian.","Xia Jinyuan knew that he couldn’t influence the military’s decision. Even if he was Commander Xia’s biological son, he couldn’t. However, he could still persuade his cousin-in-law, who wanted to give him a hard time, to stop and not join in the fun.","However, he wouldn’t directly express his intention. Even if he spoke about it in a roundabout way, with his cousin-in-law’s intelligence, he would naturally understand.","Li Jinnian knocked on the table with his slender fingers. He thought for a moment before asking, \"Are you with my cousin now? She hasn’t been assigned to a unit after graduation. Is she still staying in the dormitory?\"","One sentence was enough to change the topic.","Xia Jinyuan said, \"She’s in the hospital.\"","\"What happened? How many days has been hospitalized for?\" Li Jinnian’s voice was cold.","\"She was injured on a mission. Today is the fifth day. She’ll be discharged in four days. When she came back, she just happened to graduate and you guys were already fighting over her. Even though she’s hospitalized, she still has a lot on her mind.\" Xia Jinyuan didn’t say how badly Ye Jian was injured. The word ’hospitalized’ was enough for Li Jinnian to know the severity of Ye Jian’s injuries.","There was no need to be hospitalized for minor injuries, only serious injuries.","\"I understand. Take good care of my cousin.\" Li Jinnian pursed his thin lips slightly and frowned. \"I’ll contact you later. I have something to do.\"","Li Jinnian hung up and immediately called Commander Dong."]},{"number":4809,"title":"Chapter 4809: Deep Water Bomb","paragraphs":["Commander Dong, who was moved by Li Jinnian’s words, urged Commander Xia to recall the difficulties of the navy in the past. He sighed and lamented about how difficult it would be in the future. He had to always watch out for danger and work like a cow. Other than lacking military fees and equipment, he also lacked all-rounded personnel.","There were very few female soldiers in the navy. Besides administrative staff, even the company liaison officer was a male soldier.","Commander Dong sighed at the importance of female soldiers. He hoped that Commander Xia would show mercy to them. The navy lacked female soldiers like Ye Jian!","Whether it was the army or the navy, they were all soldiers who served the country together. As long as the military issued a letter of transfer and a transfer order, Ye Jian, who had trained with the maritime combat team before, would definitely be happy to become a navy.","Commander Dong, who talked so much about hardships, chatted until his eyes turned red and tears glinted in them.","At this moment, Li Jinnian called to tell the commander his intention. As Commander Dong gave his speech, he squeezed out the tears in his eyes.","Commander Dong quickly wiped away his tears. He said apologetically to Commander Xia, \"I need to answer an emergency call.\" Then, he turned his body slightly and lowered his voice. \"Why did you change your mind again? I’m complaining to Commander Xia right now. If you keep doing this, Jinnian, I’ll be in a difficult position.\"","In order to win Ye Jian over, he even squeezed out tears!","\"I’m sorry, Commander. Considering that there are no female soldiers in the team, it’s inconvenient for Ye Jian to go out to sea for training with us even if she wants to. She can’t go out to sea with us for training. At the same time, it’ll be a waste of talent. Hence, let’s forget about it.","\"I didn’t think it through and caused you trouble.\"","Commander Dong heard his subordinate’s cold voice and moved his body slightly. He lowered his voice even more. \"Are you stupid? Why are you only thinking about training? Are you not thinking about your own future? Old Master Fu is still waiting for his great-grandchild!\"","...","If he didn’t explain, there would be a huge misunderstanding.","\"Commander, Ye Jian is related to me by blood. She’s my cousin and the old man’s granddaughter.\"","Commander Dong almost threw his phone out. Before he could digest the news, the lieutenant colonel, whom he was most proud of, threw out another shocking news.","\"Commander Xia’s only son, Xia Jinyuan, is my cousin’s boyfriend.\"","Commander Dong’s hand trembled. He quickly ended the call. He needed to catch his breath.","First of all, Ye Jian was Old Master Fu’s granddaughter. As far as he knew, Old Master Fu only had one son, and his job was unknown. Ye Jian was Old Master Fu’s only granddaughter.","Secondly, Ye Jian was the girlfriend of Commander Xia’s only son, Xia Jinyuan. That meant that the Ye Jian he wanted to poach for the navy was Commander Xia’s future daughter-in-law!","Fortunately, he only said that the navy lacked female soldiers like Ye Jian. He didn’t say that he wanted to introduce Ye Jian to his soldiers!","When the two bombs were dropped, Commander Dong immediately gave up on poaching her.","He apologized first and changed the topic. He expressed that he was envious of the army for having female soldiers like Ye Jian. He hoped that the navy would have them too in the future. In short, he didn’t want Ye Jian to serve in the navy.","Commander Xia had never considered letting Ye Jian transfer to the navy. Hence, no matter how much Commander Dong complained earlier, he wasn’t moved.","However, Commander Xia thought that he would have to play along with Commander Dong for more than ten minutes. Then, he would tactfully say that he wouldn’t let her transfer to the navy."]},{"number":4810,"title":"Chapter 4810: Cousins","paragraphs":["Unexpectedly, a phone call made Commander Dong change his mind. Commander Xia, who was still listening, said, \"The sea, land, and air are all in our country. There’s no distinction between these.","\"Although the navy is still in progress and their equipment is indeed behind the army, I believe that things will only get better in the future. More and more female soldiers like Ye Jian will choose to go to the sea and become glorious female soldiers!\"","Commander Dong nodded happily. \"What you said is what I think too. Please forgive me for disturbing you today. It’s getting late. I won’t disturb you anymore.\"","Since there was no hope, there was no need to cause any more trouble. He might as well leave early.","Thinking that there was still a group of generals in the conference room who hadn’t left, Commander Xia didn’t stay any longer. After sending Commander Dong off, he returned to the conference room. The generals from the three military districts looked at Commander Xia.","Far away in Xiang City, Ye Jian was on the phone with her cousin, Li Jinnian. She wasn’t aware of what was taking place in the military because of her.","The cousins hadn’t contacted each other for a long time. However, they were both reserved people. Even if they had endless topics to talk about, they wouldn’t talk for long. They just needed to talk about important things.","Li Jinnian was most concerned about Ye Jian’s injuries. As for how and where she was injured, as a soldier, Li Jinnian restrained himself from asking anything he shouldn’t.","After recuperating for five days, the fine scratches and scabs on Ye Jian’s back started to fall off. Those that were more serious would fall off in a few days.","\"There are two wounds on the back of my waist. The gun wound on my shoulder is slightly more serious. The rest are not a big problem. I’ve been recuperating for five days. Also, Captain Xia is taking good care of me. Cousin, don’t worry. I’m fine.\"","Ye Jian didn’t hide anything. Since her cousin knew from Captain Xia that she was hospitalized after getting injured in a mission, she couldn’t hide anything even if she wanted to. She might as well tell him the truth so that her cousin wouldn’t worry.","Li Jinnian heard Ye Jian’s voice that showed no sign of tiredness. Although he couldn’t see her with his own eyes, he could tell that her condition was not bad from her voice. There was no need to worry too much.","It was not uncommon for special forces soldiers to be hospitalized for injuries. Hospitalization for serious injuries was not unavoidable because of the high professional risk.","Li Jinnian, who had a cold expression on his face, said in a low voice, \"If you’re seriously injured, it’ll leave behind old illnesses. It might even be fatal. I hope you can return safely from every mission without a bullet hole.","\"In solo combat, you have to prioritize your own safety first. Only then can you complete your mission better. I hope you can remember that we don’t even have the right to be seriously injured! That’s because we have to live well and fight the next combat.\"","They didn’t even have the right to be seriously injured... Ye Jian felt like a heavy rock had fallen on her heart. Her gaze turned cold as she humbly accepted his advice. \"Cousin, I understand!\"","\"Yes, take care of yourself. Don’t let those who care about you worry. Also, I heard from Xia Jinyuan that the military is considering having you lead a new company alone. I have a suggestion. If you agree, discuss it with Xia Jinyuan before raising it to the military.","\"Only you have the right to choose. If it were anyone else, the military would only need a transfer order. They wouldn’t give you the right to choose at all.","\"They’re giving you the right to choose because they value you. Cherish yourself and take care of yourself. Don’t let the military down.\"","Although Li Jinnian loved Ye Jian very much, he and Xia Jinyuan were the same kind of people. No matter how much they loved her, they wouldn’t be blinded because of it."]},{"number":4811,"title":"Chapter 4811: Where To","paragraphs":["They were teachers and friends. They would give Ye Jian the advice she needed the most so that she would quickly understand what her best choice was.","She could be pampered appropriately in life, but there was no pampering at work. They had to be strict with her.","Ye Jian told Xia Jinyuan about Li Jinnian’s suggestion. Xia Jinyuan only asked Ye Jian, \"What do you think?\"","Ye Jian, who agreed with her cousin’s suggestion, pondered for a few seconds and replied seriously, \"I think it’s feasible.\"","\"Okay, you can give the military an answer now.\" Xia Jinyuan passed his phone to Ye Jian. \"The generals of Nanguang, Linnan, and Linchuan are all in the military. They’ll get to know your answer immediately.\"","On the fifth day of Ye Jian’s recuperation, there was finally a result.","Xia Jinyuan heaved a sigh of relief. Major General Yang heaved a sigh of relief too. The problem of Ye Jian’s allocation was finally solved. Now, they just needed to wait for her to transfer to the Xueyu unit after her internship. When the dust settled, everyone would be happy.","When G3 and the rest knew that Ye Jian had to go through an internship period, they all said that they had forgotten about it.","It wasn’t that their memories of their internship were bad. It was because Ye Jian had carried out many missions with them, and they had gone through thick and thin together. Every special forces soldier treated Ye Jian as a member of the team.","They completely forgot about the specialness of the Xueyu unit. They only reacted when Xia Jinyuan reminded them.","\"I’m afraid her three-month internship is still uncertain. It’s a brand new female soldier company. Azure Bird is the first chief instructor of this company. I’m afraid they won’t let her go.\"","G3 expressed his worries. He doubted that Ye Jian would only be the chief instructor of the company for three months. What could the female soldiers learn after three months of training?","Xia Jinyuan, who was still having a headache over Ye Jian’s matters, frowned and said, \"You’re right. I’m also worried that she might not be able to return to the team smoothly. Three months is the shortest, and the longest is six months. Six months of internship is normal.\"","\"Are you prepared to face the reality that she might not return after three months?\" G3 asked.","Xia Jinyuan sneered. \"According to the military’s previous arrangements, they wanted Ye Jian to be the company commander of the female soldier company. Once her internship ends, can she still be transferred as she pleases if she’s already the company commander?\"","\"Fortunately, she’s only the chief instructor now!\" G3 heaved a sigh of relief. \"Fortunately, you reacted quickly and only let Azure Bird be the chief instructor. It’ll be more convenient to transfer her.\"","Li Jinnian said that since Commander Xia wanted to make such an arrangement, he probably had other plans. They could agree to it, but Ye Jian couldn’t take on the position of company commander. She could take on the role of the chief instructor, which was equivalent to her going there to guide the new soldiers. After she was done with her stint, she could leave. It could save a lot of unnecessary trouble.","Xia Jinyuan immediately agreed with this good suggestion.","At critical moments, his cousin-in-law was very reliable!","Nine days later, Ye Jian returned to the military school. Xia Jinyuan, who had accompanied Ye Jian for nine days, sent her back to school. He only had 11 days of leave. He could only accompany her until the afternoon of the tenth day at most. He had to take a plane back at night.","On the ninth night, Xia Jinyuan wrote down dozens of reminders for Ye Jian to ensure she had a smooth recovery. On the tenth morning, he handed the paper to Ye Jian.","\"Go through it when you wake up every morning and before you sleep. You can’t forget any of it. When I’m free, I’ll call to investigate.\"","He was very serious. He was not joking.","Ye Jian took it and listened to him. It was all things she needed to pay attention to as she was still injured. After reading everything carefully, she nodded seriously, indicating that she would definitely abide by the things written.","She still needed to recuperate for another two months. During this period, she needed to master all the textbook knowledge of the fourth-year students as she was absent for a semester. Two months later, they would arrange for her to take the cultural and physical fitness exam.","For this, she had to recuperate well. She couldn’t delay the special make-up exam two months later."]},{"number":4812,"title":"Chapter 4812: Escort","paragraphs":["Ye Jian had learned her lesson after being shot. Hence, no matter what Li Jinnian and Xia Jinyuan said, she would remember them and accept their criticism humbly.","The hundreds of kilometers from Myanmar to the Chinese border had made her feel how fragile life was several times.","It wasn’t that she wasn’t afraid that she might not be able to return. It wasn’t that she wasn’t afraid that she would collapse halfway through the journey. It was pure fear and terror that allowed her to understand the importance of health.","Now, she was being criticized by her cousin and boyfriend. They were worried about her and were afraid that she would get hurt again.","Injury was taboo in individual combat. She would remember this lesson and not dare to forget it.","Ye Jian placed Xia Jinyuan’s written list in front of the desk. In the following days, Ye Jian would read it every day and night. Every word would be etched in her heart. She would read it every day and night.","Ye Jian started preparing for the exam nervously. She only had two months to prepare. She needed to memorize all the cultural knowledge in the syllabus of the fourth-year students. Fortunately, the fourth-year students didn’t cover much on cultural knowledge and mainly focused on physical training. Hence, Ye Jian was relatively relaxed.","If she carefully calculated the time for all cultural classes in the second half of the senior year, which was seven hours a day, it would take a full month and a half. Therefore, it wasn’t difficult to compress about five months of cultural classes into two months.","In addition, the teachers of every class were very serious about tutoring Ye Jian. Hence, Ye Jian wasn’t worried about the make-up exam.","Ye Jian was recuperating peacefully in school while working hard for the make-up exam in two months. After Xia Jinyuan returned to the base, he would call Major General Yang every day to talk about ’life’. He would talk until Major General Yang was frustrated. Every time he picked up a call, he had to mentally prepare himself. After a week, Major General Yang didn’t even come back to the office.","When Commander Xia found out about this, he specially went to look for Major General Yang. He patted Major General Yang’s shoulder and sighed. \"It seems that kid is angry. You’ve suffered.\"","Little Ye was injured and awarded a medal in the end. There were no other substantial rewards. How could his protective boy not be angry?","Hence, with his personality, he would definitely cause trouble for the military.","Major General Yang could only smile bitterly. \"He knows that military orders can’t be disobeyed. He doesn’t resist openly, so he can only cause trouble for me secretly.","\"Actually, I can’t say that he’s causing trouble for you. He just wants to chat. Commander, he’s about to talk my ears off. When do you think you can raise Little Ye’s military rank? Even I feel that Little Ye has suffered because of the lieutenant rank, let alone him.\"","That brat needed accurate information. Before he got accurate information, Major General Yang’s ears were at stake.","Commander Xia smiled and replied to the worried Major General Yang with an expression like a father who knew his son best, \"Arrange something for him so that he won’t have the time to chat with you.","\"This kid still needs to be trained. Although his personality is much better than before, he still has sharp edges that need to be dealt with. Only by grinding them down will it benefit his future development.\"","Although Commander Xia had never interfered with any of Xia Jinyuan’s decisions and didn’t seem to be worried about Xia Jinyuan’s future development, he was still a parent. How could he not make plans for his child?","Helping his only son’s future development without violating the rules of the military wouldn’t evoke any criticism."]},{"number":4813,"title":"Chapter 4813: Good Thoughts","paragraphs":["As for Ye Jian’s military rank, Commander Xia didn’t give Major General Yang an accurate reply. He didn’t even reveal his stance.","It was only when Commander Xia contacted Mr. Fu later on that he explained why such arrangements were made.","\"Little Ye is young. She can be a major even though she hasn’t even turned 22. Brother Fu, I’ve checked the information of the three armies. There has never been such a young major.","\"Having outstanding ability is not always a good thing. If you improve too quickly, you’ll be envied and easily plotted against by despicable people. If you improve too slowly, you’ll feel wronged.","\"After thinking about it, there’s only one way to solve the current problem. Let Little Ye lead a brand new female soldier company and place her personal results in a place where even the generals of the three armies can see them. That way, she won’t be criticized for her young age when we want to promote her military rank.","\"It’s taboo for soldiers and politicians to be criticized, especially for children from families like ours. The children are clearly outstanding, but because of their families, their parents have no choice but to suffer grievances.","\"Brother Fu, my son thinks that Little Ye has been wronged. As the commander-in-chief, I think so too. However, we have to look into the distance. It’s worth it to endure the small grievances for the sake of future development.\"","If Commander Xia hadn’t explained it to Mr. Fu, Mr. Fu, who had spent his entire life developing missiles, wouldn’t have thought of this.","All he could think of was whether his daughter would be happy in the future and whether he could really let the Xia family take his precious daughter away.","He was only thinking about his daughter’s happiness.","As for her future development, it was not as important as her happiness.","Since he had an in-law who could pave the way for his daughter’s future, Mr. Fu was very happy. \"Commander, I just hope that Jian will be safe and happy in the future. I don’t dare to have too many requests.","\"Now that you’re protecting her, I’ll thank you on behalf of Jian. I might be treating you too formally like this, but thank you, Commander.","\"I can’t accompany Jian because of my work, and I can’t contact Jian all the time. With you taking care of her, I’m very at ease.","\"As a father, I’ve never thought about Jian’s graduation or her future. Compared to you, I’m a very unqualified father. I owe my children too much.","Deep down, this guidance expert who dedicated his life to the development of missiles for the motherland’s navy, army and air force was filled with guilt.","Since ancient times, loyalty and filial piety had always been a point of conflict. For the sake of the country, countless people like Mr. Fu owed their families, parents, wives, and children.","They had no regrets toward the world and no regrets toward their country, only toward their families.","Commander Xia immediately said, \"Brother Fu, we’re family. I have the responsibility to take care of Jian. As her future father-in-law, I can’t shirk this responsibility.","\"You can’t pay attention to Ye Jian because of your work. As for me, I have the responsibility to take care of Little Ye outside. What you’re doing is a long-term plan. You can’t afford to be distracted because of your children. If you do that, you’ll really be a sinner of the country.","\"Brother Fu, you don’t have to worry about Jian. I treat Jian as my biological daughter. How can I let her suffer grievances?\"","The conversation between the two fathers was for the sake of their children.","However, Commander Xia didn’t tell Mr. Fu about Ye Jian’s injuries. He didn’t want Mr. Fu, who was far away in the hinterland of the northwest, to worry.","Mr. Fu didn’t personally contact Ye Jian either. He understood from Commander Xia that Ye Jian was at ease and had a place to go after graduation. Ye Jian was very satisfied with the arrangements too. In order not to distract Ye Jian, Mr. Fu didn’t contact her."]},{"number":4814,"title":"Chapter 4814: Far Away","paragraphs":["Although the father and daughter had never contacted each other, it was enough for them to know that they were fine through Commander Xia.","Ye Jian learned that Mr. Fu was safe and sound a month later. Commander Xia personally called to care about Ye Jian’s health and studies. At the same time, he talked about Mr. Fu.","After knowing that Mr. Fu was still deep in the hinterland of the northwest and that the brand new female soldier company that she was going to after the makeup exam ended was also in the northwest, Ye Jian’s studies became much more energetic.","Ye Jian wasn’t assigned to the Xueyu unit immediately. Now that she could be very close to her father, she was very happy. As a result, when she spoke to Xia Jinyuan later, Ye Jian couldn’t help but sound excited.","Xia Jinyuan knew why his girlfriend was so happy. He scolded her in a low voice, but he couldn’t help but smile because of his girlfriend’s happiness.","He was happy when she was happy and was sad when she was sad. The two of them could not be happier.","Two months later, before the first-year students of the Chinese Academy of Sciences finished their military training, Ye Jian completed all the make-up exams and passed them.","On the 7th of September, Ye Jian, who had received her graduation certificate, was sent off by Song Zhiqiu and a few other comrades who had successfully passed the postgraduate entrance examination. They were on duty for the entire summer vacation.","There were no planes for the students to take to the assigned units, so Ye Jian had to take a train.","Ye Jian saluted her comrades who were still standing on the platform to send her off. From now on, Ye Jian’s four years in military school would come to an end. She had to bid farewell to her campus life and embark on a new journey.","Song Zhiqiu and the rest stood on the platform until the train was out of sight. Then, they turned around and left.","\"Why was she assigned to the northwest in the end? I thought that she would be assigned to a good unit like the General Administration. She was assigned to the northwest... Sigh, I don’t know if it’s good or bad.\"","Wei Jiaming felt sorry for Ye Jian. The entire class thought that Ye Jian would be assigned to the best unit. Who knew...","Song Zhiqiu looked at his classmates and smiled. \"What’s poison to one might be honey to another. With Ye Jian’s ability, don’t you think that no matter where she’s assigned, she’ll definitely have a bright future?\"","\"That’s right. We’re worried for nothing. Ye Jian is an amazing female soldier. During her studies, she already earned three third-class honors and two second-class honors. At the graduation ceremony, the major general from the military awarded her the medals. I was really shocked. I even felt that my four years in military school was for nothing!\"","Another student who passed in the postgraduate entrance examination sighed with emotion. \"That’s why I believe that even if Ye Jian is assigned to the northwest, she’ll be able to do whatever she wants. No one will be able to stop Ye Jian from developing in the future.\"","Wei Jiaming nodded. \"Indeed. Ye Jian will definitely be able to make a bright future for herself regardless of her circumstances.\"","Ye Jian would naturally be able to carve out a bright future. Moreover, her development would definitely be better than anyone else’s. That was because the northwest was the toughest but was the best at training people.","Song Zhiqiu walked out of the platform and looked toward the west where the train was moving in. He sent his sincere blessings to his comrade.","He was looking forward to meeting Ye Jian again. He believed that at that time, Ye Jian would definitely climb several levels.","In the distance was the blue sky and white clouds. There was a vast and endless world ahead. The rumbling train carried Ye Jian to the northwest. She would reach Dun City in 48 hours and take a car from Dun City to the base.","Similarly, a group of young female soldiers who had been selected after two months boarded the train to the northwest. They would arrive at the base at different times."]},{"number":4815,"title":"Chapter 4815: The Soldiers And Civilians","paragraphs":["Carrying her camouflage bag and backpack, Ye Jian got onto the train in her military uniform. She looked for her bed. In less than 20 steps, Ye Jian attracted the attention of all the passengers in the carriage.","It wasn’t the first time she took a train or received the attention of the passengers. It was just that the passengers this time were more enthusiastic than before. When they saw Ye Jian, their eyes lit up and they smiled. Ye Jian didn’t know what to do.","When she reached the middle, a plainly dressed lady stood up from the bed and stood in the middle of the aisle, blocking Ye Jian’s path.","Ye Jian, who was facing the bed number, thought that she was blocking the woman’s path. She hurriedly smiled embarrassedly and turned to let the woman go over first.","The woman didn’t move. Instead, she stretched her neck and stared at the bus ticket in Ye Jian’s hand. \"Comrade, what’s your bed number?\"","Ye Jian was stunned for a moment. Then, she answered the question.","The woman who asked Ye Jian which bed she was sleeping in saw that Ye Jian’s bed was still a distance away from her, and her happiness decreased a lot. However, when she saw that Ye Jian’s destination was also Dun City, the woman from the northwest instantly became happy. \"Comrade, we’re fated. I’m getting off at Dun City too.","\"I’m Bed 9, and you’re Bed 13. You have to continue walking.\"","Her voice was loud too. She knew where Ye Jian would get off, which meant that half of the passengers in the carriage knew where Ye Jian would get off.","The train started moving. Ye Jian, who hadn’t found her bed, smiled awkwardly and thanked her politely. She quickened her pace.","Her back view looked... a little disheveled.","When she found her bed number, it was a very young man who was sleeping opposite her. He was probably around the same age as Ye Jian. He was around 21 or 22 years old. There was still a hint of shyness in his eyes.","When he saw Ye Jian, the man quickly looked away. He probably felt that his reaction was a little too big, so he quickly looked back and smiled at Ye Jian.","Ye Jian smiled at him naturally. The young man was a little embarrassed. He picked up a magazine on the bed and lowered his head to read it.","After placing the backpack on the luggage rack, she needed to step on the bed. As soon as she leaned over, she woke up the passenger sleeping in the middle berth. The passenger, who was in a daze, narrowed his eyes and looked at Ye Jian before continuing to sleep.","Ye Jian put down her backpack and quickly sat on her bed. She planned to learn from the young boy on the lower berth.","Before Ye Jian could take out her books from her camouflage bag, the woman who blocked Ye Jian’s path earlier walked over with snacks and fruits in her hands.","\"Come, come. Comrade, have some fruits and snacks. Don’t mind these small tokens from me. Look for me after you finish them. I still have some left. Have your fill!\"","Ye Jian’s back stiffened as she looked at the woman who was extremely enthusiastic toward her and stuffed fruits and snacks into her arms.","She had taken the train many times. This was the first time she met such an enthusiastic passenger.","Ye Jian stuffed the snacks and fruits back into the woman’s hands. Her head was hurting. She smiled and said, \"Miss, you’re too polite. Due to the rules, I can’t take these fruits and snacks.\"","\"Is there a rule that bans you from eating fruits and snacks? It’s okay. You’re not outside. The leaders of the military unit won’t know if you eat them. They won’t care.\" As she spoke, she stuffed the snacks and fruits into Ye Jian’s hand once again. \"Take them, take them. Your leaders won’t be able to see it anyway.\""]},{"number":4816,"title":"Chapter 4816: Proud","paragraphs":["Ye Jian was really worried. After pushing her back several times, the woman saw that she really didn’t want them, so she didn’t force Ye Jian anymore. She tucked a lock of hair from her cheek behind her ear. The woman was so enthusiastic that Ye Jian didn’t know what to do. The smile on her face turned a little embarrassed. Even her gaze flickered.","Ye Jian’s heart skipped a beat. She realized that this woman who was so enthusiastic toward her might have something to ask of her.","Ye Jian didn’t take the initiative to ask. The woman whispered, \"Comrade, I won’t beat about the bush. I have something to discuss with you. What do you say?\"","Whether Ye Jian would agree or not, the woman had to say what it was first.","After the woman finished speaking, Ye Jian smiled.","\"I know that my request is a little too much, but there are still more than 40 hours to reach Dun City. We also need to sleep for two nights in the carriage. I don’t feel at ease. Previously, I thought that I would just sleep during the day and stay awake at night. I did that last night, but I couldn’t stay up. In the second half of the night, I fell asleep.","\"When I woke up early in the morning today, I heard that someone had lost something. I was extremely anxious. When I saw you getting into the carriage just now, I felt much more at ease.","\"I’m not the only one. The passengers in the entire carriage are probably the same as me. The young man reading on the opposite side, you agree with me too, right?\"","The young man, who had been reading, suddenly got called out. He raised his head and hummed in panic. He blushed and lowered his head to read again.","Receiving a reply, the woman became energetic again and returned to being magnanimous. \"When we meet soldiers outside, the commoners feel safe. It feels like even if anything happens, we don’t have to worry as the soldiers will resolve the problem for us.","\"Comrade, don’t think that I’m forcing you. I’m really flustered too. I worked hard to earn my money. If I lose it, I’ll lose half of my life.\"","During the 48-hour journey, some passengers lost their wallets and didn’t even know when they lost them. They only realized it when they needed their wallets.","In the past, when Ye Jian took the train to the Nanguang Military District, she encountered passengers who lost their money. Later, she and a few students even fought with the organized gang on the train. They saw with their own eyes how miserable the passengers were when they lost their money. Hence, she could understand this lady’s worry.","\"It’s just a small matter. I’ll remember what you said, Miss. I’ll walk around at night.\"","After receiving Ye Jian’s reply, the woman thanked her profusely before returning to her bed. As she walked past, all the passengers in the compartment knew that the soldier who had just boarded the train would patrol at night. If anything happened, she would attack immediately. All of them had smiles on their faces.","Ye Jian didn’t expect the train attendant to look for her too. She hoped that she could walk around at night.","There were not enough police officers. Every time the attendant saw a soldier getting into the car, she would be very happy.","After leaving Xiang City to the next stop, a young mother with a child specially ran to Ye Jian’s hard berth, wanting to change berths with the young man opposite her.","However, she didn’t succeed because the young man couldn’t walk and rejected her with a red face.","At night, the train attendants started patrolling back and forth. They reminded the passengers to take care of their money to prevent it from being lost. They also told the passengers that it was best to take turns sleeping. If there were any problems, they had to inform the police immediately.","Ye Jian, who was wearing a military uniform, made the passengers in the carriage feel more at ease. Ye Jian would encounter such things as long as she wore a military uniform. As time passed, she had gotten used to it.","She never felt troubled or angry. Instead, she felt extremely proud."]},{"number":4817,"title":"Chapter 4817: Godwife","paragraphs":["She was trusted, relied on, and needed. Despite having graduated from the National Science University, she would never let down the school motto.","It was just a small episode, but it became a beautiful story to the others in the carriage.","At night, just like what she said in the day, Ye Jian woke up from time to time to walk around the carriage. During this time, she even met the police on night duty twice and chatted with them for a short time.","From this, she knew that the longer the line and the more provinces the train crossed, the more thefts would happen.","The pickpockets would keep an eye on their targets during the day so that they could take action at night. At 3:00 am, when everyone was sleeping soundly, they would start moving. They were all working for the same gang. Sometimes, even when the passengers realized what was happening, they didn’t dare to make a sound for fear of retaliation.","Even though the police officers were on duty at night, that didn’t stop the cunning pickpockets. Sometimes, theft would happen the moment the police officers left. It was impossible to guard against them.","There were also many ’seat tyrants’ on the train. Some passengers didn’t have a seat ticket but wanted to sit down. These ’seat tyrants’ took the opportunity to occupy the seats of the passengers who looked honest and rode alone. Then, they sold the seats they occupied to the passengers who didn’t have a seat.","When faced with such a situation, the passengers who were bullied didn’t dare to tell the train staff at all. They didn’t dare to tell the police either. They were afraid of retaliation.","When the civilians were outside, they had the mentality that it was better to avoid trouble. As a result, some shady activities have become an industrial chain, from which people could seek profits.","The policeman told Ye Jian that a moving train was a scene of life. It could see the joys and sorrows of life. He even smiled and said to Ye Jian, \"Where there are people, there’s the world. The military unit is still the best. It’s very disciplined. All soldiers must abide by all the rules and regulations. If they violate them, they’ll be punished directly. It’s many times simpler than outside.\"","Ye Jian didn’t express her opinion.","Where there were people, there was the world. Actually, the military unit was the same.","What Ye Jian didn’t expect was that this matter would bring her closer to the female soldiers of the new company.","While Ye Jian was being stared at by the people on the train, the female soldiers who were also on the train heading to the northwest were equally enthusiastic about Ye Jian. They patrolled back and forth at night and acted as stabilizers in the train.","The next morning, Ye Jian received a call from Xia Jinyuan. Xia Jinyuan then lectured Ye Jian for an hour.","He didn’t say anything else. He just told Ye Jian how to deal with those unconvinced and disobedient soldiers as soon as possible.","\"It’s best to deal with soldiers who are unconvinced. Let the other party know that you’re stronger than them and they’re weaker than you. Punish the disobedient soldier until they understand what military orders are and what obedience is.","\"A soldier who complies in front of others but goes against you behind your back is called a despicable person. When dealing with despicable people, you have to use despicable methods. You have to be more sinister than them and know how to play dirty. After you scheme against them, you have to tell them openly that you’re playing with them. Let them know that their tricks can’t be used on you.","\"As for those wily old foxes who are obedient to you but don’t have any interest in doing anything, don’t think about taking care of them first. You have to find their weaknesses first before giving them a heavy blow. Let those wily old foxes know that being a soldier under you and being lazy is courting death!\"","These were all Xia Jinyuan’s experiences. Some of them were taught by his seniors.","Now, he was telling Ye Jian everything so that she could get used to the new environment and the new military unit as soon as possible. He wanted her to get used to it as soon as possible and achieve results as soon as possible so that she could be transferred back to the brigade."]},{"number":4818,"title":"Chapter 4818: You Still Have Me","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan, who was wholeheartedly planning for Ye Jian, talked for more than two hours on the phone. A few times, the train passed through the tunnel and caused the signal to be cut off. After that, he immediately called back and continued preaching.","Ye Jian listened attentively. If she didn’t have a good memory, she would have taken out her notebook and written down everything.","Xia Jinyuan specially took up a morning to impart his experience to Ye Jian. For this, he even poured three large cups of water in advance and placed them on his desk. He said that this way, he didn’t need to get up to pour water for himself when his mouth was dry. He could drink casually without any delay.","\"In the new company, you’ll be an instructor. It’s very important to give the soldiers a solid first impression. You can’t be too close to them. It’ll make them think that you’re easy to talk to. In the military unit, easy-going superiors will often raise scattered soldiers.","\"You can be strict, but you can’t be rigid. When it’s time to be tough, you have to be tough, especially when it comes to principles, discipline, and rules. There’s no relationship or favor to speak of.","\"There’s no need to cling to your own opinions. We can listen to what needs to be heard, but remember not to let the soldiers lead you by the nose. It’s a huge taboo. You can’t let the soldiers think that you don’t have any opinions. Only good generals have good soldiers!","\"Every soldier has their shortcomings and strengths. When you go over, the first thing you have to do is to understand all the soldiers’ personalities, weaknesses, and strengths! Once the other party tries to provoke your authority as an instructor, you have to attack their shortcomings directly. Once you attack, the instructor will never have any trouble again.","\"During training, you’ll be the instructor of the soldiers. You have to establish your prestige and let them know how to respect you. In life, you’ll become the soldiers’ friend. You have to build trust with them and nurture your relationship with them. You have to let them know that you’re a good instructor and not just strict. If you’re strict in life, you won’t be a good instructor. You’ll be a harsh and petty instructor that the soldiers dislike.","\"Remember, you’re a general and they’re your soldiers. Your relationship can be as good as brothers and sisters. However, you must let the soldiers know that no matter how good your relationship is, you’re still their general. As long as they make mistakes, you’ll punish them mercilessly.","\"Don’t hide your strength like in the past. When it’s time to attack, you have to attack. You have to shock them to make them accept you.","\"There’s no need to be humble. The military sent you to lead the new company because they saw your abilities. If you’re too humble, they might think that you’re hypocritical.","\"I’m not too worried about other things. I’m most worried that you’ll be humble. Remember, don’t be humble in the military unit. Soldiers who don’t want to fight for the first place are not good soldiers!\"","At this moment, the body of the cell phone was already a little hot. Xia Jinyuan only gave up when the battery on the cell phone couldn’t hold on anymore.","After two hours of preaching and teaching, Xia Jinyuan felt that it was time to hang up.","\"When you reach that new place, take good care of yourself. Don’t bear with the grievances alone. You still have me. If you have any grievances, feel free to tell me. Don’t hide them in your heart. It’s not good for your physical and mental health.\"","Hearing this, Ye Jian, who had a serious expression on her face, smiled slightly. She was like a lotus petal stained with morning dew. Instantly, the young man sitting opposite her on the bed blushed as if he was on fire.","\"When have you ever seen me suffer and not say anything? It happened in the past, but it won’t happen now. Not to mention suffering, it’s not my style anymore.\"","In this life, her military career changed Ye Jian’s fate and personality."]},{"number":4819,"title":"Chapter 4819: Image, Captain Xia","paragraphs":["If a person didn’t even know how to fight for themselves, no matter how much they suffered or how difficult it was, they would be asking for it.","One had to know how to fight for what one wanted, how to measure one’s own ability, understand right from wrong, and distinguish between good and evil. Even if one lived an ordinary life, the way one lived would be one’s own and would never be copied.","After she finished speaking, Xia Jinyuan drank three mouthfuls of cold water and finished talking about serious matters. He kicked the ground lazily and rolled the wheels on the chair. It was convenient for him to raise his long legs and place them on the desk.","G3 walked in and saw that the captain, whom the special forces soldiers respected and feared, had lost his image. His legs were placed on the table, and he was shaking them. He looked like a hooligan and bad person. G3 couldn’t help but hold his forehead.","Q King was good at everything, but sometimes, his special combat uniform couldn’t hide his roguish aura!","\"Alright, I’m much more at ease now. After all, I don’t need a punching bag.\" As he spoke, he glanced at G3 and raised his chin slightly, indicating for G3 to place the folder in his hand on his desk.","G3 walked closer and glanced at Xia Jinyuan’s long legs that were on the desk. \"Image, image. The door is open. If you there’s a spot check, as the captain, you’ll be the first to be criticized. Won’t it be embarrassing?\"","He deliberately lowered his voice so that Ye Jian, who was on the other end of the cell phone, wouldn’t hear him.","Why was it definitely Ye Jian? There was no other reason. One look at Xia Jinyuan’s handsome face and he could tell.","Q King of the Xueyu unit had given his heart to Ye Jian.","Glancing at his long legs that were placed on the desk, Xia Jinyuan raised his eyebrows. He put down his legs and placed the phone between his ear and his shoulder. He leaned over and took the fountain pen from his pen holder with one hand while taking the folder from G3 with the other.","\"Don’t be too excited after reading it,\" G3 reminded him.","In response, Xia Jinyuan expressed that the fact that his little fox was not returning to the team immediately after her graduation had extinguished his enthusiasm. Nothing else could make him excited.","Ye Jian’s clean voice entered his ears. It was like the sound of a zither. Xia Jinyuan felt comfortable when he heard it. Even when he opened the folder, he was extremely lazy.","He opened the folder lazily and leisurely. When he glanced through it, he was shocked!","\"Are you entering a tunnel again? The signal isn’t good. We’ve been talking for so long, so your cell phone must be burning. Turn off your cell phone and save some battery. If the battery really runs out, go look for the train attendants and charge your phone in their lounge. The train attendants and police should’ve asked you to patrol at night, right? They’ll agree to charge your phone for you. Don’t be shy. It’s mutually beneficial.","\"Keep your cell phone with you when you reach Dun City. Be careful. I have something urgent to deal with. I’ll contact you later.\"","The rumbling train was passing through villages with farmland on both sides. Ye Jian thought that the cell phone signal was not good, so she smiled and said a few words, \"I’ll take note. There’s no need to worry.\" Then, she hung up.","Ye Jian placed her hot phone on the small table beside her. She looked at the battery. She needed to find a train attendant to charge her phone.","In this era, there were no portable chargers. Charging outlets could only be found in the staff room.","The train rumbled all the way. It passed through several mountains and rivers and brought Ye Jian to the harsh northwest.","Far away in a military base in the north, Xia Jinyuan hung up and immediately called Major General Yang. The first sentence he said was, \"Your compensation this time is very conscientious!\"","Major General Yang frowned angrily. \"What are you saying? If you don’t know how to speak, I’ll immediately replace you with a soldier who can speak!\""]},{"number":4820,"title":"Chapter 4820: A Big Surprise","paragraphs":["Lieutenant Colonel Xia had never been afraid of threats. He replied with a faint smile, \"You can replace me if you want. It depends on whether I’ll let you. Also, do you really want my soldiers to go over?\"","Major General Yang choked on his saliva.","If he continued to face Lieutenant Colonel Xia, Major General Yang deeply suspected that he would live a few years less!","In the past two months, Lieutenant Colonel Xia’s personality was sometimes thunderous and sometimes stormy. He had made the entire brigade of soldiers afraid. Today, he suddenly changed. During lunch, he even smiled. The special forces soldiers sitting around him were so frightened that they buried their heads in their food.","Damn it! Did the demon-like captain come up with some brutal training again?","They had to hurry up and eat their fill. They had to conserve their energy and prepare to receive the attack at any time!","However, this time, the special forces soldiers in the unit were bound to be disappointed. The captain, whom they respected and feared, carried a camouflage bag and a backpack at 5:00 am the next day. He was dressed casually and appeared to his comrades as if he was going on a holiday.","The hinterland in the deepest part of the northwest was also an important place in the country. Even satellites couldn’t detect it. The signal in the sky was completely blocked. In a base in the restricted area for all civil aviation aircraft, a camouflaged Jeep drove out from the khaki hills and headed toward Dun City.","The orderly who was driving waited for the chief engineer in the back seat to change into casual clothes before smiling. \"Chief, don’t be anxious. It’s a seven-hour drive from our base to Dun City. It’s only 5:30 am now. I promise to send you to the train station on time.\"","The chief engineer, Mr. Fu, wiped the sweat off his forehead as he hurriedly changed his clothes. He couldn’t help but smile at the orderly happily. \"I’m in a hurry to fetch my daughter. That’s why I’m a little anxious.","\"There’s no hurry. Let’s drive steadily. My daughter won’t reach Dun City until four in the afternoon. Seven hours is enough.\"","The orderly could tell how happy Engineer Fu was just by listening to his voice. His smile deepened. \"This is the first time you’re picking up your family.\"","\"Yes, it’s my first time picking up my daughter,\" Mr. Fu emphasized his daughter.","After wiping his sweat, the camouflage uniform with military ranks on his epaulet was neatly folded. Mr. Fu smiled until there were crow’s feet at the corners of his eyes. \"I haven’t seen her for hundreds of days. Now, she’s also assigned to our northwest. I can finally take the opportunity to meet her.\"","’Hundreds of days’ was the term used in the base. Even if they hadn’t return home for ten years, they would still say ’hundreds of days’.","The soldiers in the base knew that all the engineers in the base had not returned home for a few years. It was normal for them not to see their families. For soldiers like them, the military unit would specially give them half a month of leave to visit their families every two years.","Sometimes, when they thought about it, their hearts ached for the engineers’ families.","Ye Jian, who had already entered the northwest region, didn’t expect to be pleasantly surprised. There wasn’t just one surprise but two.","Of course, the two surprises were for Ye Jian.","They would come as a shock to Xia Jinyuan.","To Mr. Fu... the sudden appearance of another person was really annoying!","Commander Xia knew that Xia Jinyuan had been invited to be an instructor too. He sat in the office and brewed a pot of tea to calm himself down.","\"Yuan and Little Ye did suffer a little this time. Coincidentally, there’s a shortage of people over there. I thought that I might as well find another way to compensate them.","\"The two of them will go to the same place. One will train the female soldiers while the other will train the male soldiers. They can take care of each other in work and life. Also, with Yuan around, Little Ye will be able to learn faster and she’ll be quicker to yield results. It’s like killing two birds with one stone.\""]},{"number":4821,"title":"Chapter 4821: Calm Down","paragraphs":["Commander Xia drank a few mouthfuls of green tea to calm himself down. He said unhurriedly, \"I chatted with Engineer Fu last night and mentioned that Little Ye will arrive in Dun City around four in the afternoon today. Do you think Engineer Fu and Little Six will meet each other?","\"Will the future father-in-law beat up his future son-in-law? The father and daughter haven’t seen each other for more than two years. They would want to have a long conversation. If the young brat suddenly appears and Engineer Fu beats up Little Six, I’ll be able to understand.","\"I hope Little Six can withstand his future father-in-law’s beating. Even if he gets beaten up, he shouldn’t expect me to step in. Little Six is very tough. In the past, when I wanted to beat him up, Old Master would scold me. If he gets beaten up by his future father-in-law, Old Master can only accept it.\"","Major General Yang took a deep breath and sighed. \"Commander, I can understand why Yuan is so anxious to fight with you every time.","\"In this world, you’re the only one who wants your son to be beaten up by his future in-laws. You’re even happy about it. You’re considered an anomaly among your parents.\"","Commander Xia thought about it and didn’t feel that he was an anomaly among parents.","He waved his hand and smiled nonchalantly. \"Little Six is asking for a beating. After being taught a lesson by his future father-in-law, he won’t dare to bully Little Ye anymore. Once he recalls his future father-in-law’s fists, he’ll be more obedient!","\"He’s been naughty since he was young. If Little Ye can suppress him, I...\" Commander Xia tapped his heart and held his teacup. He smiled casually. \"She’ll be reliable, very reliable!\"","Xia Jinyuan’s shamelessness had left a psychological trauma on Commander Xia. Even though Xia Jinyuan was the leader of a team and had carried out countless missions, in Commander Xia’s heart, no matter how much Xia Jinyuan achieved, he would still be that naughty boy.","As a father, Commander Xia was not an anomaly among parents. It was just that the way he cared about his only son was different. He didn’t let him do what he wanted, nor did he interfere too much. When necessary, he would also stand up to protect his only son.","As for whether Xia Jinyuan would be beaten up by his future father-in-law, Commander Xia was looking forward to it. He asked Major General Yang not to tell Xia Jinyuan what he was about to face.","Whether it was a blessing or a curse, he couldn’t avoid it. He had to face what he had to face. Escaping wouldn’t solve the problem.","Unless he endured it and only met up with Little Ye in the Xueyu unit.","Was that possible?","That was impossible!","So, what difference did it make?","Major General Yang didn’t plan to ruin the fun between the father and son. The father and son didn’t find it tiring or troublesome. They even enjoyed it. Why should he ruin it?","Xia Jinyuan arrived at Dun City Airport around one in the afternoon and went straight to the train station. As compared to Ye Jian who took the 48-hour train, Lieutenant Colonel Xia used his salary to subsidize the plane ticket.","At this moment, Mr. Fu, who came to fetch his daughter, arrived at the train station and treated the orderly to a meal. He went to a clean hotel at the train station and booked two rooms. One was for the orderly to rest, and the other was for himself.","The orderly still needed to drive, so he naturally had to rest well.","As for Mr. Fu, he had stayed up for two consecutive nights. He didn’t want Ye Jian to see the fatigue on his face, so he took the time to rest.","The future father-in-law and son-in-law, who were supposed to meet in advance, missed each other just like that.","During the waiting process, soldiers in military uniforms carried their luggage and backpacks out of the station.","The female soldiers would report to the military depot first. When everyone was there, they would be arranged to go to the company."]},{"number":4822,"title":"Chapter 4822: Among Tens Of Thousands Of People","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan, who had been waiting at the train station, didn’t need to look at the female soldiers carefully. He only needed to take a look to know that his lover wasn’t among the female soldiers.","At four o’clock, the broadcast from the train station sounded. It announced that the train from Wu City was about to arrive at the station and asked the staff to make preparations.","The familiar train number was reported. Although the train hadn’t entered the station, Xia Jinyuan’s gaze was already fixed on the exit. He couldn’t help but smile.","On the other side of the exit, the orderly, who had also changed into casual clothes, said to Mr. Fu, who had rested for three hours and was in good spirits, \"Chief, the train isn’t late.\"","Previously, Mr. Fu was worried that the train would be delayed. Now, he was completely relieved.","Thinking about how he would be seeing his daughter soon, Mr. Fu was so nervous that he clenched his fists. He asked the soldier, \"Are my clothes messy? I have to look energetic.","\"You don’t know this, but my daughter loves to worry. She’s afraid that I’ll collapse from exhaustion. Every time she writes a letter, she reminds me to take care of myself.","\"It’s said that a daughter is her parents’ sweetheart, and it’s true. She should have entered the station by now. It’ll take a few minutes for her to leave the station. But she’s a soldier. Her actions should be faster than others. I wonder if she’ll help others carry their luggage along the way.","\"I have to get closer. I don’t want the luggage on the passengers’ shoulders to block my vision.\"","As he spoke, he really walked into the crowd in front.","There were many pedestrians waiting at the exit of the station. Mr. Fu even spent some effort to apologize countless times as he was scolded by the pedestrians. Finally, he managed to squeeze a little in front.","The orderly followed closely behind, afraid that something would happen to the chief engineer of the base.","On the other side, Xia Jinyuan had already found the best position. He stared at the exit without blinking, afraid that he would miss it.","He was focused on the exit and didn’t notice that his future father-in-law was staring at the exit diagonally opposite him. He was afraid that he would miss Ye Jian.","The train slowly arrived at the station. Ye Jian, who was pestered by the enthusiastic woman, pushed the snacks and apples that the woman handed over again. Then, she put on her backpack under the gratitude of the train attendant and the policeman. She carried her luggage and prepared to get off the train.","It was uncertain if it was because of Ye Jian, but there was no theft in the train in the last 48 hours.","When she got out of the train, the enthusiastic woman even asked Ye Jian to visit her house when she was free. When the train doors opened, Ye Jian ’escaped’.","Mr. Fu hit the nail on the head. An old man around 60 years old was carrying his luggage on a pole. Ye Jian tied the camouflage bag in her hand to her backpack and carried the old man’s luggage out.","The exit station was a little far away. Ye Jian slowed down her footsteps to take care of the old man. As a result, a large number of passengers rushed out of the station but Ye Jian was still far behind.","The old man kept thanking her along the way. She also said that the military soldiers were good and knew how to take care of people.","A large number of passengers walked out. Mr. Fu’s eyes widened as he looked for his daughter among the crowd. The orderly who was taking care of him also looked for her with widened eyes.","Xia Jinyuan was standing by the fence and looking for his lover among the crowd. It was not until more than half of the passengers had surged out that he saw his lover walking out slowly while carrying luggage on her shoulder.","The smile in his eyes deepened. No matter where she went, her lover would always be ready to lend a helping hand.","Ye Jian was getting closer and closer to the exit. Suddenly, she seemed to have sensed something and looked up at the exit.","Amidst the tens of thousands of people, a familiar handsome face entered their vision."]},{"number":4823,"title":"Chapter 4823: Father-In-Law!","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan’s appearance really surprised Ye Jian. She was so surprised that she thought that she was hallucinating. She blinked hard and looked again. She realized that the man standing at the fence was indeed her man. Ye Jian’s heart beat faster.","Captain Xia, why was he in Dun City?","He was even at the train station!","It was obvious that he was here to pick her up!","A smile bloomed from her heart. She had bright eyes and white teeth. She was a beauty. Xia Jinyuan, who had been standing outside for a few hours, saw her smile. All his fatigue was swept away. All the waiting was worth it.","He raised his hand and waved. With a smile on his handsome face, he welcomed the woman he loved with the gentlest gaze.","His little fox was obviously shocked just now. She couldn’t believe that she would meet him at the train station in Dun City.","He would tell her later. The two of them were going in the same direction and military unit. Would she be as excited as him?","She definitely would be!","At that time, when she knew that she couldn’t report to the brigade immediately, the disappointment on her palm-sized face made his heart ache.","Now, although she couldn’t report to the military unit immediately, the two of them were instructors in the same military unit. They could be together every day. If they returned half a year later, they would return half a year later together. He accepted the arrangement!","If he didn’t accept it, the boss in the capital city would be so angry that he would jump up and scold him for not being satisfied.","After confirming that she wasn’t seeing things, Ye Jian’s gaze softened. Although she didn’t keep staring at the man at the fence, every time she chatted with the old man, she would look up involuntarily.","Xia Jinyuan stood at the spot where she could see him and waited for her to walk over.","Her heart was very, very full. With every step she took, her heart got hotter and hotter.","She wanted to walk faster, but the old man couldn’t walk fast. Ye Jian didn’t urge him, and she accompanied the old man slowly out of the station with the crowd.","As more than half of the passengers in front had already left the station, many of the pedestrians outside had dispersed. Mr. Fu, who was standing at the back, walked to the front smoothly. Just as he stood at the entrance of the fence and looked into the station, his eyes lit up.","He saw his daughter!","\"Jian!\"","Mr. Fu raised his voice. The people at the exit were shouting, but Ye Jian’s hearing was sharp. She could vaguely hear him and immediately tilted her head slightly to look at the fence on the other side.","\"Jian!\"","Mr. Fu raised his voice again. This time, Ye Jian smiled until her eyes were as bright as the stars. She actually saw her father whom she hadn’t seen for a long time!","Ever since Ye Jian and Mr. Fu returned to the capital city, they had never seen each other again. Besides the occasional letters, they had never even contacted each other on the phone.","This year, she went to deal with the Burmese drug dealers alone and became an undercover agent. Hence, she couldn’t even write letters.","After returning to the country, she was afraid that Mr. Fu would notice something amiss from her letter, so she planned to report to Mr. Fu that she was safe after she was assigned to the unit. After knowing that she was assigned to the northwest, she wondered if she could go to the base to visit her father if she was on leave. She thought that ordinary people couldn’t enter the base at all. Even if she went over, she probably wouldn’t be able to find him!","All the buildings in Mr. Fu’s base were built underground. Ye Jian wouldn’t be able to find the base if she went over.","The father and daughter looked at each other. Ye Jian was so excited that she called out ’Dad’ several times. On the other side, Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who was happily waiting for his girlfriend to come over obediently... was dumbfounded.","When Mr. Fu called out ’Jian’, Xia Jinyuan, who also had sharp hearing, felt as if he had been struck by lightning.","It was his future father-in-law’s voice?","His future father-in-law, who was most difficult to deal with, was actually here?"]},{"number":4824,"title":"Chapter 4824: Kneeling","paragraphs":["With an expression that said ’I won’t believe it even if you beat me to death’, Lieutenant Colonel Xia twisted his neck mechanically. It was as if there was thick rust on it. Then, he saw his future father-in-law grabbing the fence with both hands and saying happily, \"Jian!\"","There was no mistake!","It was his future father-in-law!","Why was he here too?","Lieutenant Colonel Xia’s expression collapsed. It was impossible for him not to greet them now!","Hence, when Mr. Fu saw the young brat who would snatch his precious daughter away in a few years standing in front of him like a pillar, he found him an eyesore and wanted to chase him away.","When the future son-in-law saw that his future father-in-law was also here, he was anxious. He hoped that his future father-in-law would be magnanimous and not cause any problems.","The future father-in-law was furious when he saw that his future son-in-law was here too. He expressed that he really wanted to chase him away now and regretted not bringing a few more soldiers to chase him away!","\"Hello, Uncle Fu.\"","Although his heart was in turmoil, Xia Jinyuan still maintained his elegance and manners on the surface. He greeted Mr. Fu, who was an elder, with good manners.","No matter how much Mr. Fu felt that the boy in front of him was an eyesore, he had to admit that the boy in front of him was unique among the youths he had seen.","In addition, the young brat was very polite. When he smiled, it revealed his upbringing and his inner qualities. Mr. Fu could only suppress his anger.","However, Mr. Fu couldn’t be nice to a young brat who would snatch his precious daughter away in a few years.","His expression didn’t change. He put on the serious expression he usually had when he was working. He nodded slightly and said in a gentler voice, \"It’s been a long time since we last met. You look much more energetic. Are you on leave? From where did you rush over to pick up Jian?\"","They were both here to pick up Ye Jian. He mainly wanted to see where he came from.","\"I rushed over from the military unit. I’ll be an instructor in the same unit as Ye Jian.\"","If he resisted, the other party would be strict. If he confessed, the other party would be lenient. Instead of hiding it, it was better to tell the truth. Xia Jinyuan replied openly, making Mr. Fu’s heart ache.","\"What’s the arrangement?\" Mr. Fu’s voice turned cold.","Xia Jinyuan’s eyebrows twitched. He maintained his smile and replied calmly, \"I only found out about it at the last minute yesterday. I’ll tell you the details after we get into the car. It has something to do with some unpleasant things that happened on your side some time ago. That’s why such an arrangement was made.\"","\"There’s no need to say anything else. Let’s talk in the car.\"","At the mention of what happened some time ago, there was a sharp look in Mr. Fu’s eyes. If it weren’t for the guard company’s ability, something big would have happened!","It wasn’t an ordinary matter. It was something that concerned the military of the country!","Mr. Fu immediately stopped talking. His expression softened. \"Thank you for coming all the way here.\"","\"It’s no problem. This is my responsibility.\" Xia Jinyuan heaved a sigh of relief secretly and smiled. He had passed the test successfully. His future father-in-law wouldn’t make things difficult for him anymore, right?","\"You and Jian will report to the same unit. Will you go for training together?\" Before Ye Jian came out, Mr. Fu grabbed the chance to probe.","Although the young brat’s character was trustworthy, as Ye Jian’s father, he was still worried.","Xia Jinyuan replied without thinking, \"We won’t be training together as we have different directions in leading the team. But there should be some exchanges and sparring later.\"","If they didn’t train together, they wouldn’t see each other every day. If they didn’t see each other every day, the young brat wouldn’t be able to take advantage of his daughter. Mr. Fu felt at ease."]},{"number":4825,"title":"Chapter 4825: Aggrieved","paragraphs":["Mr. Fu, who was much more relieved, continued, \"You have the same goal. It’s beneficial for your future development if you interact more and spar. You still need to put in more effort and give Jian some pointers. However, you have to be more careful. The unit is different, and the requirements for you are different. If other people notice anything, you’ll be implicated.","\"It’s easy to spark a fire. You have to pay attention to yourself and not commit any big crimes.\"","Mr. Fu was tactful, but who was Xia Jinyuan? He knew exactly what Mr. Fu was referring to.","His future father-in-law was worried that he would make a huge mistake!","He really did entertain such a thought before this!","However, it was still manageable for now!","After being reminded by his future father-in-law, Lieutenant Colonel Xia suppressed his thoughts and replied politely, \"Jian is leading the new team, and I need to produce results immediately. Both of us will be very busy. I’m afraid we won’t even have much time to meet.\"","Hence, Mr. Fu could be rest assured.","Even if something really happened, Xia Jinyuan would be careful!","The pharmacy in front of the train station had all kinds of condoms. As for him, although he was carrying a camouflage backpack, he was wearing casual clothes. It was really convenient for him to buy condoms.","He chose the most expensive, thinnest, and largest condom!","If the condoms didn’t have the chance to play their actual role, they would be good for training.","For example, a sleeve to prevent bullets from entering the water, a sleeve to protect the muzzle, and a gun butt to prevent sand from entering... In short, they could be very useful!","Every special forces soldier in the team had a box and some had extras. After each training session, they could take them out and blow up balloons for fun.","Xia Jinyuan hid his thoughts from his future father-in-law.","Ye Jian had already arrived at the exit. The old man’s children had already come to get him. They thanked Ye Jian several times before leaving with the old man.","Mr. Fu and Xia Jinyuan stood at the side and smiled as they watched the old man and his family leave.","\"Dad!\" Ye Jian turned around and threw herself into Mr. Fu’s arms.","Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who was a step behind Mr. Fu, felt extremely aggrieved. Before he saw his future father-in-law, he had been stretching his arms and waiting to pick up his girlfriend.","But what could he do...","However, no matter how much preparation work he did in the early stages, he couldn’t stop his future father-in-law.","It was not bad to have a handshake.","No, in the eyes of his future father-in-law, holding hands was probably physical contact.","Xia Jinyuan, who felt wronged, watched as his girlfriend threw herself into his future father-in-law’s arms. Then, he looked at his empty arms and sighed secretly.","He hadn’t succeeded yet. He had to work hard!","Mr. Fu patted Ye Jian’s shoulder lightly. Tears flickered in his eyes. \"Good, good, good. You’ve grown taller. You’re much more energetic, but you’ve lost weight. You’re so skinny that my heart aches.\"","\"I’m not skinny. I’m still the same as before.\" In front of Mr. Fu, Ye Jian was just an ordinary child. She let go of all her worries and was so carefree that even her smile was filled with childishness.","Xia Jinyuan, who was standing behind, saw this and the smile on his thin lips deepened.","Although he couldn’t hug his baby immediately, he felt relieved when he saw her carefree smile.","His lover was very happy now.","Mr. Fu still felt that his daughter had lost weight. He squeezed Ye Jian’s shoulders lightly with both hands. His kind eyes were filled with heartache. \"You’re saying that you didn’t lose weight? Your shoulder blades didn’t protrude so much the last time! Your chin wasn’t so sharp either. You’ve grown taller, but your weight is still the same as before.\""]},{"number":4826,"title":"Chapter 4826: Girls Go Out","paragraphs":["Ye Jian thought for a moment and said coquettishly, \"I might have lost a little weight, but I don’t feel it myself. But you’ve lost weight, Dad. Have you been very busy recently? Your eyes are bloodshot. You must have been working all night.\"","\"Hahaha, let’s go to the car and talk.\" Mr. Fu laughed and avoided his daughter’s questions. When the orderly beside him saw this, he turned his head and suppressed his smile.","As it turned out, Engineer Fu, who was especially serious in the base, had such a naughty side too.","He looked at Engineer Fu’s daughter with a smile. Her eyes were very similar to his, but not in other aspects. One look and he could tell that Ye Jian resembled Engineer Fu’s wife.","As for Engineer Fu’s daughter’s luggage, the orderly wanted to take it, but Xia Jinyuan took it immediately.","He couldn’t hug his girlfriend immediately, so he had to at least take his girlfriend’s luggage!","Seeing that his future father-in-law seemed to have forgotten about him, Xia Jinyuan held Ye Jian’s hand. Xia Jinyuan had no choice but to pretend to cough and remind him. Ye Jian winked at Xia Jinyuan playfully.","Mr. Fu had really forgotten!","Hearing the cough, Mr. Fu immediately stopped in his tracks. \"I almost forgot. Little Xia is here too. Say hello,\" he said to the orderly.","Xia Jinyuan, who had been forgotten, smiled and said, \"It’s okay. We can talk in the car.\"","His future father-in-law had forgotten about him, but it was fine as long as his girlfriend still remembered him!","Ye Jian also said, \"That’s right, that’s right. It’s the same if we talk in the car. He’s not an outsider. Don’t be so polite.\" After she finished speaking, she gave Xia Jinyuan a bright smile.","He was not an outsider; he was family!","Mr. Fu glanced at his daughter, who was focused on helping the young brat. Other than giving in, what else could he do?","He had to go along with his daughter’s wishes.","\"Alright. Your unit is a little far away. Don’t waste time outside. Let’s talk in the car.\" Mr. Fu saw that Xia Jinyuan had four bags in his hand and asked the orderly to take two.","Since his girlfriend refused to give him her luggage, Lieutenant Colonel Xia promptly gave his own backpack to the attendant.","Ye Jian pursed her lips and held back her laughter.","Captain Xia was really... very petty.","Mr. Fu didn’t know what to say.","This brat from the Xia family was really... irritating!","As a father, he was happy to see his daughter being doted on and pampered like a treasure. He felt at ease handing his daughter over.","But sometimes, he felt suffocated.","His daughter was dedicated to Xia Jinyuan. No matter how much he wanted to test Xia Jinyuan, he didn’t know where to start.","Finally, there was an opportunity to test Xia Jinyuan, and he even talked to his future in-laws. They all agreed that Ye Jian was still young, so it would be better for them to marry later.","In the end... Heh!","Before he could see the results of the test, the young brat came to the northwest with his luggage and was in the same unit as his daughter!","Mr. Fu was happy but also frustrated. He didn’t look at Xia Jinyuan anymore. He just chatted with Ye Jian.","Xia Jinyuan smiled and glanced at Ye Jian. He took the luggage and walked to the side obediently. He listened to his girlfriend and future father-in-law chatting happily.","\"You can send us to the military depot? That’s great! But I have to talk to the military depot. After all, it was agreed upon that the military depot would send us.\"","Mr. Fu smiled. \"There’s no need. The military depot already knows. Just follow me.\" He turned his head and looked at Xia Jinyuan, who was following closely and maintaining a proper distance. \"Bring him along.\"","Bring Captain Xia along?","Ye Jian leaned back slightly and looked at Xia Jinyuan, who was walking a little behind Mr. Fu. \"Are you specially sending me there?\"","Wasn’t he afraid of being criticized by his boss?"]},{"number":4827,"title":"Chapter 4827: A Patient Hunter","paragraphs":["Mr. Fu immediately heard that Ye Jian didn’t know anything about this. He was even more certain that Xia Jinyuan received the notice last night and didn’t make the arrangements on purpose.","\"Ask him to explain to you when we get to the car. The car is in front. Are you hungry? Do you want to eat something to cushion your hunger first?\"","Ye Jian shook her head and said, \"I’m not hungry.\" She then asked if they would be traveling through the night.","The orderly answered for Mr. Fu and smiled. \"The chief only has two days of leave. He needs to return to the base at 5:00 pm. We have no choice but to travel through the night.","\"Don’t worry, I promise we’ll return to the base safely.\"","It was more than 500 kilometers from Dun City to the unit where she would be reporting to. Daytime in Dun City lasted longer. The sky here at 8:00 pm was about the same as 5:00 pm in Xiang City. There was no need to rush.","They could still rest at the unit tonight, but...","Holding Mr. Fu’s hand, Ye Jian said in a low voice, \"Dad, don’t send me off. I’ll stay at the military depot tonight. You can accompany me at the military depot.\"","\"I’ve never sent you off since you were young. This time, give me a chance. I asked the military depot and they said that you were originally leaving at midnight. In that case, why don’t I send you there in advance?\"","Mr. Fu really wanted to send her off. After finding out the arrangements of the military depot, Mr. Fu wanted to send her off even more.","Ye Jian wanted to persuade him again, but Xia Jinyuan smiled and said, \"Thank you, Uncle Fu.\" As he spoke, he shook his head slightly at Ye Jian, indicating that she shouldn’t reject him.","After Ye Jian went home, Old Master Fu, Mr. Fu, and Demon King Li all felt that their family owed Ye Jian. They tried their best to make up for what they owed her in the past.","Hence, no matter how Ye Jian persuaded him, Mr. Fu wouldn’t change his decision.","Xia Jinyuan’s persuasion made Ye Jian nod and accept it. \"Dad, you only have two days of leave. Thank you for your hard work.\"","\"Silly girl, what work am I doing? I’m sending you off because I’m afraid we won’t see each other again after you leave the northwest.\"","The base’s anti-aircraft missiles were about to enter the experimental stage. It was also the most critical moment. Mr. Fu probably wouldn’t even have a day of rest. All his rest time would be when he closed his eyes and slept.","When they reached the Jeep, Mr. Fu looked at the front passenger seat and said to Xia Jinyuan, who had put down his luggage, \"Sit in front first. I’ll change seats with you later.\"","Although the young brat was an eyesore, he was not an unreasonable elder who liked to make things difficult for his juniors. He still had to give in to the young people.","If he didn’t give it to Xia Jinyuan, his daughter might have a problem with it.","Ye Jian, who was already sitting in the back seat, blushed when she heard that. The shameless Xia Jinyuan replied readily, \"Okay, tell me when the time comes.\"","\"Yes.\" Mr. Fu nodded and got into the car first.","He knew his limits even if he wanted to make things difficult for this young brat.","As for Xia Jinyuan, he naturally knew that dealing with his future father-in-law wasn’t something that could be done in a day. His future father-in-law had a good impression of him. The bad thing was that he took Ye Jian away too early, so his future father-in-law was worried that Ye Jian would get married and have children early.","He understood everything. Because he understood, he knew how to take things slowly.","The elders of both sides had already met. No matter how anxious he was, he wouldn’t be in a hurry. After settling his future father-in-law, he would make Ye Jian his. Everyone would be happy by then. So, he naturally had to patiently take down his future father-in-law.","Xia Jinyuan was a very patient hunter. For Ye Jian, he strived to be perfect so that Ye Jian would marry him happily and without any burden.","He also hoped that his future father-in-law would be at ease and hand his precious daughter to him with a smile.","Only then would the two families be happy!"]},{"number":4828,"title":"Chapter 4828: Brilliant","paragraphs":["It was more than 560 kilometers from Dun City Train Station to the military unit. The highway was nearly 300 kilometers long. The journey was time-consuming. It would take nearly six hours to reach.","Xia Jinyuan, who was sitting in the front passenger seat, listened to the low voices of the father and daughter in the back seat. There was a smile on his handsome face the entire time, and he didn’t show any abnormalities.","The father and daughter had not seen each other for more than two years. It was not easy for them to have some time to meet. They should have a good chat.","Also, didn’t Mr. Fu say that he would get out of the car halfway and stretch his muscles before changing seats? He calculated the time. It was a six-hour drive, so his future father-in-law would occupy three hours. When they changed seats, the sky would already be dark. The inside of the car... Cough, naturally, it would be very dark.","In the dark, he could hold his girlfriend’s hand and hug her waist. How could his future father-in-law see clearly? Most importantly, if he was tired from chatting, his future father-in-law would definitely close his eyes and rest. The next three hours would be Xia Jinyuan’s alone!","Also, tomorrow, his future father-in-law would have to rush back to the base. Meanwhile, he would be able to see Ye Jian every day. Compared to his future father-in-law, he was much luckier.","His future father-in-law and the little fox would only interact for a little more than a month.","It had to be said that Lieutenant Colonel Xia had a good plan.","\"When you’re in the military unit, listen to your seniors’ advice. Don’t be stubborn. Don’t look down on the soldiers in the military unit just because you have a high education level.","\"Your academic qualifications and military ranks are high, but the soldiers are more experienced than you. You must treat them with respect. Of course, when it’s time to be strict, you must be strict. The military unit is still a place of strict discipline. The discipline can’t be messed up.","\"I can’t accompany you for too long. I have to report back to the base before five tomorrow. However, your military unit is in the same direction as my base. I can come and visit you anytime during the holidays in the future.\"","Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who had a good plan in front, couldn’t help but straighten his back.","Same direction?","His future father-in-law’s base was in the same direction as their military unit?","Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who had his back straightened, knew that he had been too optimistic. Extreme joy turned into sorrow!","In other words, in the next half a year, he would have many chances to meet his future father-in-law!","Ye Jian was quite happy. Hearing that, the smile in her eyes spread. \"Really? That’s great! Dad, can I visit you at your base during the holidays?\"","Mr. Fu laughed. \"Hahaha, no. Our base forbids family visits. The families of all the soldiers in the base don’t even know where we are. No family member has ever visited.\"","His daughter wanted to come, but the rules were rules. Even though he was the chief engineer of the base and a major general with a military rank, he couldn’t break the rules.","Ye Jian was disappointed. She said in a low voice, \"It’s so strict. It looks like I can only wait for you to visit me on the holidays.\"","\"Girl, don’t expect too much from me. I’ll be a little busy in the future. I don’t know if I’ll be on leave.\"","In the front row, Xia Jinyuan, who had a straight back and a nervous facial expression, slowly heaved a sigh of relief. He instantly relaxed.","The disappointment on Ye Jian’s face deepened. \"Before I came, I thought that the northwest should be very close to you. And it is very close. But I can’t go over to visit you. It’s useless no matter how close I am.\"","\"Silly girl, I’m already very satisfied that I can send you to the military unit this time.\" Mr. Fu saw that his daughter was a little sad, so he changed the topic. \"You remember what I said just now, right? If you don’t understand anything, you should ask Yuan. He has leadership experience and knows more than you."]},{"number":4829,"title":"Chapter 4829: The Older, The Wiser","paragraphs":["\"The two of you are in the same military unit. It’s very convenient for you to meet and discuss things. Remember not to make a hasty decision when you’re not confident. It’s best to ask Yuan.\"","Yuan...","Xia Jinyuan smiled. His future father-in-law used to call him by his full name!","He turned his head and smiled. \"Uncle Fu, don’t worry. I’ll watch from the side. But it doesn’t matter if she makes small mistakes sometimes. She can learn from her mistakes and solidify her experience. She’ll be more experienced in handling matters that way.\"","Ye Jian smiled and said, \"Dad, don’t worry about me. Yesterday, he lectured me for a few hours. He was afraid that I wouldn’t be able to suppress the soldiers and establish my dignity, so he summarized his many years of experience to me. I know what to do now.\"","\"That’s good. I feel more at ease now that the two of them are supporting each other.\" Mr. Fu nodded. The smile in his eyes deepened. After that, Mr. Fu didn’t talk about what Ye Jian should do when she went to the military unit. He had already reminded her what he needed to do. She had to walk her own path.","The topic changed to military school and life. Xia Jinyuan withdrew and didn’t interrupt.","Although Mr. Fu was chatting with Ye Jian the entire time, he would size up Xia Jinyuan from time to time and secretly observe if he was unhappy.","He realized that his future son-in-law was smiling and listening the entire time. He didn’t interrupt and didn’t look for a new topic to talk about. He was elegant and displayed the bearing of a descendant of an aristocratic family. Mr. Fu’s satisfaction with this son-in-law who would snatch away his precious daughter from him in the future increased a little.","In the entire capital, there was no other young man who was as good as the Xia family.","Most importantly, he was very compatible with his daughter. They were in love with each other and knew each other well.","Xia Jinyuan was an open-minded person and knew filial piety. This was what Mr. Fu was very satisfied with.","Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who was afraid of his future father-in-law, didn’t know that he had made a good impression of himself. He didn’t dare to relax at all. He was well-behaved and honest. Sometimes, when Ye Jian asked him something, Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who had always known how to make his elders happy, would place Ye Jian as the center. He would put Ye Jian first at any time. The gentleness in his eyes when he looked at Ye Jian made Mr. Fu uncomfortable.","In short, in front of his future father-in-law, Lieutenant Colonel Xia’s IQ and EQ soared to new heights.","As for Mr. Fu, he originally planned to chat with Ye Jian for an hour or two. He would get off the car halfway and stretch his muscles before changing his sweats. For some reason, he suddenly chatted with her. The sun was out for a long time here, so it would only get dark at almost 9:00 pm. Mr. Fu’s expression changed secretly. He said to the orderly soldier who was driving seriously, \"Lil Zhang, stop in front.\"","There was a highway stop in front. The orderly, Lil Zhang, replied, \"Yes.\" Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who was admiring the rough terrain of the great Northwest, thought that his future father-in-law needed to get out of the car and move around. In the end, he heard his future father-in-law say to him, \"Sit in the back. When it gets dark, I’ll sit in the back. You or Jian can sit in the front and put down your seat. You can rest.\"","...","Lieutenant Colonel Xia was shocked by his future father-in-law’s sudden actions.","The older, the wiser!","His plan was ruined when his future father-in-law said these few words!","Ye Jian was innocent and didn’t think about anything else. She even said, \"It’s better for you to rest in front. He and I can endure it since we’re still young.\"","Mr. Fu didn’t show his temper because his daughter was innocent. However, as a father, he couldn’t tell his daughter some things. At this moment, Mr. Fu thought of his deceased wife.","If his deceased wife was still around, there was no need for him to hide these matters between a man and a woman."]},{"number":4830,"title":"Chapter 4830: Father-In-Law Is Mighty","paragraphs":["Ye Jian was defenseless against Xia Jinyuan, making Mr. Fu worried.","Mr. Fu said earnestly, \"You have to take care of your health when you’re young. You can’t be casual just because you’re young. The two of you can rest. I’ll sit at the back.\"","Ye Jian didn’t want Mr. Fu to worry too much, so she nodded.","What else could Xia Jinyuan say? His future father-in-law was mighty!","While changing seats, Xia Jinyuan whispered to his girlfriend, \"My future father-in-law is too powerful. I can deal with my father, but I don’t dare to deal with my future father-in-law. My plan was ruined by my future father-in-law.\"","Ye Jian didn’t understand.","It was not until Xia Jinyuan said meaningfully, \"It’s easier to do things in the dark.\" Ye Jian, who was extremely perceptive... instantly understood!","She blushed and glared at the shameless fellow. She was afraid that Mr. Fu would hear them. Her guilty and cute look made Xia Jinyuan’s heart itch. He couldn’t help but smile and rub Ye Jian’s head in front of his future father-in-law.","Mr. Fu turned a blind eye to the intimacy between the young couple.","He had been young once too. When he was young, he had also tried all means to coax his lover.","However, at that time, the world was conservative. He didn’t dare to make any cheap shots, afraid that their comrades would see them.","It was not until they had registered their marriage and confirmed that they were husband and wife that they dared to cross the line.","Ye Jian, who was embarrassed, was afraid that Mr. Fu would see them. She glared at Xia Jinyuan and raised her hand to push his hand away. Xia Jinyuan smiled and quickly retracted his hand. Then, he pinched the tip of Ye Jian’s nose.","\"Move again. Sit in front.\" Ye Jian didn’t do anything. She warned him coquettishly without any threat.","Xia Jinyuan raised his eyebrows. \"Can you bear to?\"","\"What’s there to be reluctant about? I’ll tell my father now that you’d like to remain sitting in front.\"","\"Didn’t you hear Father-in-law’s special arrangements? We can’t let him down.\" Xia Jinyuan was truly worried that Ye Jian would say it, so he stood up and said to Mr. Fu, who was chatting with the orderly soldier at the back, \"Uncle Fu, Jian and I will get in the car first.\"","Mr. Fu turned around and looked at them. \"Go on, go on.\"","Mr. Fu watched as Ye Jian got into the car first. Then, he got into the car with the orderly soldier.","When they got into the car, they stopped talking about Ye Jian. Instead, they talked about what happened in the base some time ago.","\"The other party has some background. Their equipment is all the most advanced overseas. They didn’t manage to find the exact location of the base. They’ve been using an overseas professional photography team as a cover to take photos of the scenery and draw maps. The locals actually don’t know anything. The locals really think that those people were doing free publicity for the local tourists overseas to improve the local economy.","\"If our soldiers hadn’t noticed anything amiss, they might’ve sneaked into the base and exposed the exact location of the base.","\"The incident attracted the attention of the military and shocked the leaders of the Great Hall. They haven’t punished the people who failed in their duties. They have to reinforce the entire defense line first.\"","Thinking about what happened not long ago, the lingering fear in Mr. Fu’s heart hadn’t dissipated.","Who would have thought that foreigners would be keeping an eye on the Northwest? They even invested a lot of manpower, resources, energy, and money to find their country’s secret base!","Xia Jinyuan, who had a serious and cold expression, said in a low voice, \"In recent years, our country’s military power has been rising day by day, and our international status has been getting higher and higher. It has attracted the attention of the Western countries that are very hostile to our country and have discredited our country from time to time.","\"On the surface, they’re pretending to be magnanimous, but in fact, they’re secretly scheming. I’m afraid there’s more than one similar team entering our country. I wonder if the Great Hall has any clear arrangements?\""]},{"number":4831,"title":"Chapter 4831: Tricked","paragraphs":["When they talked about serious matters, Xia Jinyuan’s sitting posture became especially upright. His military aura was cold, making the atmosphere in the car solemn.","Ye Jian restrained her expression and listened attentively. She didn’t participate.","She really didn’t know about this!","\"There were clear arrangements and actions. The Great Hall quickly gave instructions to re-examine the identities of all foreigners who entered the country, especially the teams that focused on journalism and interviews. They’ll also send some foreigners who stayed for too long back to the country.\"","\"We need to act quickly. Before the spies from other countries who have entered our country to spy on us react, we need to grasp their actions and deal with them on the spot if we can.\"","Speaking of this, Xia Jinyuan’s expression was as cold as a machine. It was the most effective and bloody way to solve the problem.","Mr. Fu was probably frightened by his coldness. He was silent for a while before replying, \"It’s sometimes troublesome to deal with it on the spot.\"","\"It’s not troublesome. It depends on how we solve it. Accidents happen every year.\"","Ye Jian stood on Xia Jinyuan’s side and nodded. \"That’s right. No one wants an accident to happen. However, it has already happened. We have no choice but to admit it.\"","\"Shuikou Village is close to the military unit. There are always restless people coming over all year round. Dad, you don’t know this, right? Captain Xia and I know each other because we were secretly photographed together.\"","The topic was very suitable to talk about how the two of them got together. Xia Jinyuan didn’t have time to stop it at all as it was revealed naturally.","Mr. Fu really didn’t know this!","He only knew that it was all thanks to Grandpa Gen that Ye Jian got to know Xia Jinyuan.","As a result, Mr. Fu always thought that Ye Jian knew Xia Jinyuan because of Grandpa Gen.","When he suddenly heard this today, Mr. Fu was stunned for a moment. \"Such a thing happened? Why didn’t I hear the two of you talk about it in the past?\"","Xia Jinyuan held his forehead. His little fox had really dug a grave for him this time!","That year, the little fox was only 14 years old. He had once told his future father-in-law that he had been keeping her in his heart since they first met.","\"Oh, you didn’t know? I thought Captain Xia had mentioned it.\"","She clearly remembered Captain Xia telling her how the two of them knew each other and confessing to Mr. Fu.","Lieutenant Colonel Xia, whose military might had just been revealed, was a little uncertain. He cleared his throat and answered for his girlfriend, \"That year, Jian had an urgent matter and needed to go to the neighboring village. She took the nearest mountain path. Unexpectedly, she met a few suspicious people with camera equipment who were trying to pass through the defense line.","\"We happened to be chasing them. After we met Jian by accident, Jian led us to find a few suspicious people.\"","Mr. Fu’s expression turned thoughtful as if he was recalling something.","Ye Jian tilted her head and asked Xia Jinyuan, \"I never asked how you dealt with them?\"","\"They’re still in prison. Life imprisonment.\"","The crime of espionage was a light sentence of three to ten years in prison. However, the few of them had conclusive evidence and had sent a large number of photos overseas. Since the situation was serious, they were sentenced to life imprisonment.","\"That’s how it should be. It’s equivalent to treason, after all!\" Ye Jian felt that the punishment was fair.","Mr. Fu waited for the two of them to finish speaking before saying in a low voice, \"Does this mean that when my daughter was 14 years old, you, the young brat, already started having designs on her?\"","When Ye Jian suddenly mentioned how the two of them met, Xia Jinyuan had a feeling that he would be tortured by his future father-in-law again.","Since it had already been said, he would be even guiltier if he continued hiding it!","’Yuan’ turned into a ’young brat’. Xia Jinyuan instantly fell from a high place!","Only then did Ye Jian realize that she had caused trouble for her man."]},{"number":4832,"title":"Chapter 4832: Smart Captain Xia","paragraphs":["She, who caused trouble, immediately became well-behaved. She believed that with Captain Xia’s EQ, he would definitely be able to coax her father!","Xia Jinyuan replied seriously, \"The 14-year-old Jian was very skinny and energetic. When facing a group of suspicious people who might hurt people with knives, she was still able to maintain her composure and escape from them. In the end, she calmly led us to catch the suspicious people at the fastest speed. Her performance left a deep impression on all of us. It was hard to forget.\"","Xia Jinyuan spoke with great eloquence when he saw that Ye Jian’s age was being emphasized here. Then, he looked at Mr. Fu kindly for five seconds.","Mr. Fu thought of his deceased wife. He sighed nostalgically. \"She’s the same as her mother. She looks weak, but she’s actually very ambitious and tough.\"","Xia Jinyuan smiled and said, \"Jian’s performance was extraordinary even when she was 14 or 15 years old. Uncle Gen wanted to groom Jian into a soldier. She first helped the military unit to catch spies, and she’s now here to train female soldiers to catch spies. It’s quite a wonder the way fate works.\"","Ye Jian interrupted, \"Yeah, I didn’t expect to be interested in joining the army. I guess I was influenced by you at that time.\"","Mr. Fu had a headache.","His silly daughter was siding with the Xia family’s brat again!","Mr. Fu rubbed his chest and pounded it. He attracted the attention of the soldier. \"Are you feeling unwell? Do you want to lie down and rest for a while?\"","\"It’s okay. Keep driving.\" Mr. Fu, who was feeling suffocated by his daughter, could only pinch his nose and accept it.","Ye Jian heaved a sigh of relief. She finally helped Captain Xia this time.","If Mr. Fu could see through Ye Jian’s thoughts, he would definitely be angry again.","She had always been siding with her man!","It was useless to talk about the past. Seeing that Ye Jian was so nervous, Mr. Fu could only change the topic. \"How did you know that Jian is leading the team and that the team is formed to catch spies?\"","\"Women are more meticulous. Also, when something happened to the base, the military immediately assigned Jian to the Northwest to train female soldiers. When I received the appointment order, the reason was also mentioned. I could guess after thinking about it.\"","Ye Jian couldn’t help but look at him. No wonder the commander-in-chief and Major General Yang couldn’t do anything to him. No one could beat him in terms of agility.","He was always so close to the truth.","It was precisely because Xia Jinyuan gave Major General Yang and Commander Xia a headache that they urgently needed a capable person to suppress Xia Jinyuan. This capable person was Ye Jian.","Soldiers couldn’t fall in love with the military unit, but Xia Jinyuan was a special person. He could only be treated specially.","Mr. Fu couldn’t help but glance sideways. He sighed at how extraordinary the boy from the Xia family was.","Initially, the female soldiers wouldn’t be entering the Northwest for training. Instead, they would be going to the Nanguang Military District. There were two Western women involved in the incident, making the situation complicated. The leaders of the Great Hall immediately called for a meeting. After the meeting ended, the military immediately made a decision.","After transferring all the female soldiers who were supposed to go to the Nanguang Military District to the Northwest, the first female special combat team would be established in the Nanguang Military Districtorthwest!","At the moment, it couldn’t be said that it was a special combat team. They would only know after looking at the training situation six months or a year later.","On the other hand, as the person involved, Ye Jian didn’t know anything. After hearing this, she instantly felt that the responsibility on her shoulders was heavier than before!","No wonder Captain Xia said that if they were disobedient, she should show her true abilities directly. As it turned out, this was the biggest reason!","These female soldiers weren’t supposed to come to the Northwest at first. Now that they suddenly had to come to the Northwest, they probably felt uncomfortable.","They came with brimming emotions. As an instructor, this would pose a problem for her."]},{"number":4833,"title":"Chapter 4833: Good Father","paragraphs":["Ye Jian didn’t know that there was such a story behind her position. Then, she thought about the female soldiers who came from all over the country to the Northwest and would become a Northwestern soldier. Ye Jian, who was carrying a heavy responsibility, had a serious expression on her face. She raised her hand casually and rubbed her forehead.","Her unconscious actions made Xia Jinyuan look over.","Mr. Fu knew how heavy the responsibility his daughter, Ye Jian, had to bear. But to Mr. Fu, it wasn’t difficult to resolve this matter easily and obtain the support of the military and the Great Hall.","Handing the heavy responsibility to Ye Jian proved the military’s trust in her. They believed that she would not let them down.","However, Ye Jian was still young and inexperienced. Sometimes, when she encountered problems, she couldn’t think of a solution immediately. It was very likely that she wouldn’t be able to subdue the entire team and convince the soldiers.","She was capable. The only disadvantage was her lack of experience.","Mr. Fu was about to say something when his gaze slid past Xia Jinyuan’s face. He saw that the young lieutenant colonel was calm and composed. The calmness on his face came from his confidence. It was this confidence that allowed him to be calm and composed. With a slight raise of his hand, he could easily solve what others thought was a difficult problem.","The Xia family’s boy had the confidence that he was the only one in the world who could dominate everything.","In an instant, Mr. Fu understood why the military transferred the Xia family’s son to the Northwest and why he was in the same unit as his daughter, Ye Jian.","It was because his daughter was inexperienced and needed someone to guide her.","For a moment, Mr. Fu sighed.","In order to groom his daughter, the military had put in a lot of effort and arranged everything. That meant that as long as his daughter didn’t make any mistakes and could shoulder the responsibility on her shoulders, her entire military career would be much smoother than his.","However, the heavier the responsibility, the greater the danger.","Mr. Fu’s soft sigh came from the quiet car. There wasn’t much space in the car, and no one spoke. Although Mr. Fu’s sigh was soft, everyone heard it clearly.","When Ye Jian heard this, she knew that she had made Mr. Fu worry. She put aside the heavy rock in her heart and comforted Mr. Fu. \"Dad, I’m not sighing, so you don’t sigh either.","\"We’ll cross the bridge when we reach it. Although I’m inexperienced, I’ll find my way around it. No one will find it easy from the start. There’s always a process.","\"Even Captain Xia faced problems in the past, but in the end, he convinced all the soldiers in the team. I’m just a little worse than Captain Xia. I might take a little more time than Captain Xia, but I’m still confident in myself.\"","Xia Jinyuan smiled brightly. \"Uncle Fu, Jian and I are in the same unit. I think you should’ve thought of the reason why the higher-ups transferred me to the Northwest.","\"So, you don’t have to worry. We’ll solve the problems we might encounter next. She’s inexperienced. Though I can’t say that I’m experienced, I have some experience.","\"If she encounters a problem, the two of us will discuss it and solve it together. We’ve worked together so many times. Jian was the backbone of her class when she was in school. She has definitely accumulated some experience. It’s just that the environment is different now. But certain things will stay the same.\"","Facing the comfort of the juniors, Mr. Fu had mixed feelings.","Since his daughter was wearing a military uniform with heavy responsibilities, he hoped that she would be able to achieve something and not just live on. However, he also hoped that his daughter’s life would be smooth and peaceful.","Alas..."]},{"number":4834,"title":"Chapter 4834: Smart Captain Xia","paragraphs":["Look at the boy from the Xia family. He was willing to chase her all the way to the Northwest. He was concerned about Ye Jian and worried about her. His words were filled with approval and support for Ye Jian. He was more decisive, bolder, and knew Ye Jian better than her own father.","Mr. Fu was anxious that the Xia family’s son would snatch his only daughter away very soon. He also admired the Xia family’s son for his contributions to his daughter. After sighing, Mr. Fu raised his hand and rubbed his temples. He said to the lovers sitting at the back, \"I’m worse than you when it comes to leading troops to war. The two of you can interact and see what you should do next.\"","He looked at Xia Jinyuan. \"The team you’re leading is the guard company in charge of patrolling the base. The guards are all good, but they’re still far from you. You have to train them well. They’re in charge of the guards outside the base as well. If anything happens, they’ll be severely punished.","\"I have a few requests for the two of you. I hope you can remember them.","\"Firstly, you can’t be too close to her. Don’t let anyone speculate about you as that’ll ruin your futures. I believe that you can do this.\"","’You’ referred to Xia Jinyuan. Mr. Fu was looking at Xia Jinyuan without blinking.","Xia Jinyuan, who was leaning against the car window at first, moved to the middle seat. As for his daughter... Alas, she was also sitting in the middle seat. Their shoulders were leaning against each other!","The seats on both sides were empty!","Lieutenant Colonel Xia nodded seriously. \"Uncle Fu, don’t worry. I know my limits.\"","\"The men of the Xia family are loyal and keep their promises. I believe you.\"","Xia Jinyuan secretly squeezed Ye Jian’s little finger. His future father-in-law... was many times harder to deal with than his father. Mr. Fu was too difficult!","If he wasn’t careful, he would suddenly walk into a trap!","Since he couldn’t fight back, he could only accept it.","Mr. Fu waved his hand. \"I know how well you treat Jian. It’s just that sometimes... Forget it, let’s talk about serious matters.\"","When he thought about how his daughter had just returned to his side and had yet to get along well with him but would soon marry someone else, his heart ached.","Xia Jinyuan’s future father-in-law’s unfinished words seemed to be a blessing. Xia Jinyuan’s enlightened heart suddenly opened up again. He finally understood why his future father-in-law would lay out traps for him from time to time.","He was helpless about the sadness his future father-in-law felt. He wanted to have the best of both worlds, but he couldn’t.","He smiled and said, \"You’re still decades away from retirement, and Grandpa Fu is old, so he might not be able to help. As Jian’s boyfriend, it’s my duty to protect her.","\"When you retire in the future, Jian and I will be at a critical moment in our careers. At that time, I’m afraid you’ll need to protect Jian’s and my child.\"","Ye Jian almost choked!","They hadn’t even gotten married but Captain Xia had already thought about what would happen ten years later and who to let take care of their child!","At that time, she wondered if she would be able to take the time to get pregnant and have a child.","She cursed in her heart but didn’t say it out loud.","Her instincts told her that Captain Xia wouldn’t say such things for no reason. He must have other plans.","And this plan...","Ye Jian, who had decided not to drag her man down, looked at Mr. Fu. Then, she saw Mr. Fu’s excited expression. Even his voice trembled as he replied, \"That’s right, that’s right. You’re thinking ahead. I’ll protect Jian now. After I retire, I’ll protect my grandchild. Good, good!\"","It could be seen how excited Mr. Fu was."]},{"number":4835,"title":"Chapter 4835: Clues","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan, who was eloquent, said, \"Then I’ll have to thank you for that first.\"","\"You’ll be calling me ’Dad’ in the future.\" Mr. Fu, who had been won over by his unborn grandchild, finally admitted that he would be Xia Jinyuan’s father-in-law in the future. Xia Jinyuan secretly held Ye Jian’s hand tightly and was overjoyed.","It hadn’t been easy!","In the past, why didn’t he think of the reason why his future father-in-law was so fickle? If he had thought of it earlier, he wouldn’t have been on tenterhooks every time he saw his future father-in-law.","Ye Jian was impressed. Grandchild... This matter that hadn’t happened yet actually magically dispelled her father’s awkwardness toward Captain Xia. She was impressed. She really admired Captain Xia.","\"Dad, you just said that you wanted us to abide by a few things, but you only mentioned one thing.\" If she didn’t say anything, she was afraid that her biological father would ask her to get married and have children immediately!","In the face of his girlfriend who always dragged him down at critical moments, Lieutenant Colonel Xia could only feel helpless. He squeezed her soft yet powerful hand. There was no hurry. He would wait for an opportunity to ’punish’ the disobedient little fox.","Even after being reminded, Mr. Fu was still very happy. He cleared his throat and said the few points that the two of them needed to pay attention to.","The sun was setting outside the car. The Jeep that had entered the desert was bathed in golden sunlight as it drove forward. The scenery by the roadside was endless. There was even a group of wild camels eating and strolling on the left side of the car. The atmosphere in the car was relaxed, and laughter could be heard from time to time.","As an instructor, Ye Jian had to rush to the unit in advance. The 17th and 18th female soldiers had arrived at the military depot in Dun City.","The two female soldiers arrived at the military depot one after another. The 17th female soldier was still registering. The 18th female soldier who arrived carried the same equipment and entered the military depot.","The person who was in charge of receiving all the female soldiers was an officer from the base. When he heard the crisp sound of the women’s voices, he looked up from the form in his hand and smiled. \"Please come in. Come, fill in the two forms together. What a coincidence that the two of you arrived at the same time. You’ll sleep in the same room tonight.\"","The conditions at the military depot were limited. Single rooms didn’t exist. The best accommodation was for four people.","The male soldiers were all in eight-person rooms. The female soldiers had it better, and they could take care of each other.","After the officer finished speaking, the female soldier who was filling in the report said in a cold voice, \"Report, I request to change rooms!\"","The female soldier who was walking stopped in her tracks and smiled coldly. She said to the officer, \"Report, I request to change rooms too.\"","The officer knew that something was wrong. Seeing this, he didn’t ask further. He said calmly, \"The conditions at the military depot are limited. There are no more choices. 16 female soldiers have already arrived, and they never requested to change their rooms. Are you seeking special treatment?\"","He could extend care to the female soldiers, but this was obviously a personal grudge between the two. It was not within his scope of care.","In the future, the two of them would be comrades in the same company. Their personal emotions could not be brought into the company. The more personal emotions they had, the more the military would arrange for the two of them to interact.","The two female soldiers stopped talking at the same time.","They didn’t want to be given special treatment.","The female soldier who was filling in the form quickly filled in the last few lines with a cold expression. She put down her pen and handed it to the officer. The officer handed the key with the room number to the female soldier. \"Third floor. Go in from the left and turn left. You’ll see it.\"","\"Thank you.\" The female soldier took the keys and picked up the camouflage bag by her feet. She turned around and left.","The angle of her turn was a little big. The female soldier who had walked over was about to bend down and put down her camouflage bag when her shoulder was knocked by the other party’s bag. She was caught off guard and fell back."]},{"number":4836,"title":"Chapter 4836: Restricted Area","paragraphs":["It was 10: pm when Ye Jian and the rest entered the military area. The sentinels at the first line of defense saw headlights coming from afar. A total of six sentinels on both sides took their guns and entered combat preparations.","The infrared surveillance cameras hidden on both sides had already scanned the moving vehicle. The image information was inputted, allowing the sentinels to know how many people were in the vehicle.","The car arrived. The sentinel, who was wearing a bulletproof vest, raised his hand and signaled the car to stop by the side to cooperate with their routine inspection.","This was a military area. It was also the first sentry post that all vehicles entering the restricted area had to stop at.","Mr. Fu passed by here during the day.","One sentinel checked their identification documents while another sentinel held a gun and stood guard. Everyone in the car got off, including Mr. Fu, who had the military rank of a major general.","They saluted each other. The sentinel first checked Mr. Fu’s identification document and confirmed that there were no mistakes before handing it back. Then, he saluted to show his respect for the chief.","Mr. Fu took the document and returned the greeting. He smiled and said, \"Thank you for your hard work, comrade.\"","\"Thank you for your concern, Chief. It’s not hard. It’s what I should do!\" the young sentinel replied energetically. His voice was intimidating.","They checked the identification documents of the soldiers, Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian, one by one. Then, they checked the Jeep. After confirming that there were no problems, the sentinel put down his gun. He held his rifle in front of his chest and stood at attention. He turned his body and made way.","The car passed through the first sentry post. Mr. Fu smiled at Ye Jian, who had just woken up before getting out of the car. \"This is a military-controlled area. Outsiders and foreign vehicles can still pass through. Another 40 kilometers is a military restricted area. All foreign vehicles and outsiders are prohibited from entering. The deeper you go, the stricter it is.\"","The base was deep inside. They had to be strict.","Xia Jinyuan smiled and said, \"A few years ago, we entered the Northwest for training. The base you’re at is close to our restricted area. The safe area is 50 kilometers away from the base. Once you enter within 50 kilometers of the base, you might face the risk of being killed directly.\"","\"That’s right. It’s still the same. Although the unit you’re heading to are mainly in charge of guarding and patrolling the base, they’re also prohibited from entering within ten kilometers of the base without any arrangements.\"","Ye Jian sighed. \"That’s why I won’t be able to see you even if you’re only 30 kilometers away from me.\"","\"Hahaha, let’s change the topic.\" Mr. Fu laughed and changed the topic to Xia Jinyuan. \"Do you often change places for training? Where have you gone for training?\"","\"Uncle Fu, you should ask if there are any other places I haven’t been to.\" Xia Jinyuan naturally accepted his future father-in-law’s request for help. Soon, they changed the topic to Ye Jian’s training.","With the headlights on, the Jeep followed the curved road through the rolling desert mountains and continued moving forward.","The stars in the sky were resplendent. A silver river crossed the sky. The Big Dipper, which was like a spoon, had always been in front of the car. From the beginning of time to the present, it had seen countless beacons in the world and experienced the vicissitudes of life.","At the capital city’s international airport, a young lady dressed in dignified and professional clothes was holding the boarding pass for a business trip. She walked hurriedly in her high heels as if she was chasing someone.","In front of the woman was a tall figure. He was at least 1.8 meters tall and was wearing a light gray suit that outlined his excellent figure.","He had broad shoulders, narrow hips, and long legs. His proportions seemed to be blessed by the heavens. Even though the woman didn’t get a look at his face, his back view was enough to make her gaze linger."]},{"number":4837,"title":"Chapter 4837: Pursuit","paragraphs":["He took huge strides. With his long legs, one step was equivalent to two steps for others. Du Jiayi, who was dragging her suitcase, finally had to run.","The sound of high heels was getting closer and closer. Qin Xiu, who was holding his luggage with one hand and talking on his cell phone with the other, was walking faster and faster. \"I’m already out. Park the car outside. Let Lil Liu send my colleague back to her house directly. I don’t know the route, so let her lead the way.","\"Yes, I’m going back to Dan Gui Garden. I won’t wait. Lil Liu will pick her up. Okay, there are still five minutes. Yes... Thank you for your hard work.\"","After ending the call, Qin Xiu, who was striding, turned a deaf ear to the footsteps chasing after him. He walked his way and let the person behind him chase after him.","The passengers who came and went could tell at a glance who the young, beautiful, and exceptionally elegant woman was chasing after someone. A male passenger with tender affection for beautiful women even reminded Qin Xiu kindly, \"Sir, your friend has been chasing after you.\"","\"Thank you for the reminder.\"","He thanked him calmly but didn’t stop walking. He brushed past the unfamiliar male passenger.","Of course, he knew that someone was chasing after him, but he didn’t want her to catch up.","Nearly 18 hours of flying had already given him a headache. If they continued traveling together, he would suffocate!","Du Jiayi, who had been chasing after him, was also stubborn. She gritted her teeth and kept running. She didn’t raise her voice to ask Qin Xiu to stop and wait for her.","She knew that Qin Xiu wouldn’t wait for her even if she opened her mouth. He would only embarrass her.","If he left in a hurry, she would run. She didn’t believe that she wouldn’t catch up!","The air conditioner at the airport was very cold. Even so, Du Jiayi still felt hot sweat on her back and forehead. Seeing that Qin Xiu was walking faster and faster, Du Jiayi, who knew she wouldn’t be able to sit in the same car as him if she kept this up, gritted her teeth and ran barefoot.","There was no sound of high heels. Qin Xiu thought that the other party had retreated. He heaved a sigh of relief and slowed down.","Two minutes later, Qin Xiu suddenly felt that something was wrong. When he wanted to walk hurriedly again, his sleeve was grabbed tightly by a fair and slender hand. Du Jiayi smiled and said, \"Qin Xiu, Aunt has something to tell you.\"","She then handed over the phone.","Qin Xiu frowned subtly as he glanced at the approaching phone. His expression was cold. \"No thanks.\"","He didn’t even want to take the cell phone from her.","Du Jiayi’s expression changed slightly. She placed the phone to her ear and smiled. \"Aunt, Qin Xiu said that he’ll call you. Yes, I’m with him. Huh, have him send me home?\"","She looked at Qin Xiu with her bright eyes and smiled. \"No need, no need. Aunt, we’ve been on the plane for 18 hours. We’re both very tired. There’s no need to send me home.\"","Mrs. Qin said something, but Du Jiayi looked troubled. \"Aunt, do you want to communicate with Qin Xiu? Alright, I’ll do it. Okay. Bye, Aunt.\"","Even after the call ended, she was still grabbing Qin Xiu’s sleeve tightly. She raised her cell phone and frowned slightly. She pretended to be in a dilemma. \"What should I do? Aunt asked you to send me home. If you refuse, Aunt said you should bring me to your house to sleep for the night before sending me home tomorrow.","\"Why don’t...\"","Before she could finish speaking, Qin Xiu interrupted her with a cold expression, \"Miss Du, your actions have caused a lot of trouble in my life. No, it’s more than that. You’re disturbing my life. Please be reserved, Miss Du. Thank you.\"","This sentence was so impactful that Du Jiayi almost couldn’t keep the smile on her face."]},{"number":4838,"title":"Chapter 4838: Crazy","paragraphs":["However, Du Jiayi had heard so many similar words that she was immune to them and turned a deaf ear to them.","Her hand was still holding Qin Xiu’s sleeve tightly. Her beautiful eyes were full of surging waves. She smiled faintly and said, \"Qin Xiu, it’s not because I’m not reserved enough but because the adults are exerting pressure.","\"Also, you’re unmarried and I’m unmarried. You can reject my pursuit, but you can’t stop me from pursuing you. That’s my own freedom.\"","Qin Xiu’s phone beeped. Qin Xiu took out his phone and looked at the caller ID. A cold look flashed past his eyes.","He pressed the answer button with his slender fingers. Mrs. Qin said, \"Xiu, Jiayi returned to the country with you. It’s getting late. As a gentleman, you have two choices—Send Jiayi home or bring Jiayi back to our house.","\"I hope that you’ll choose to bring Jiayi back to our house. It’s tiring to take a flight for more than ten hours. It’s a waste of time. Why don’t you—\"","\"Mom, I’m accompanying Grandpa and Grandma tonight.\"","Qin Xiu ignored Mrs. Qin’s words and spat out a few cold words. Without giving Mrs. Qin a chance to say anything else, he hung up.","His indifferent and cold gaze swept past Du Jiayi, whose facial expression was gradually frozen. \"Miss Du, the ministry has arranged for a chauffeur to send you home.","\"As for my family home, it’s too frivolous for an unmarried woman to stay in an unmarried man’s house.\"","He lowered his gaze and glanced at his cuff that was being gripped by Du Jiayi. Although there were people coming and going around him, Qin Xiu, who had always been a gentleman, couldn’t endure it anymore. He swung his arm and pulled his cuff out of Du Jiayi’s hand.","Seeing that the cuff of his white shirt was wrinkled, Qin Xiu frowned.","He didn’t like to have too much contact with others. Even when he was talking to another person, he would maintain the best distance as taught by diplomatic etiquette and never take a step closer.","Du Jiayi, who entered the Chinese embassy in Molaban a year and a half ago and became a recorder, felt as though she had been struck by lightning. Qin Xiu used to treat her with indifference. Now, he was completely ignoring her.","If it weren’t for work requirements, he wouldn’t have interacted with Du Jiayi even if they were working in the same embassy.","However, because of Mrs. Qin, Qin Xiu would hear Du Jiayi’s name on the phone every few days.","He had already escaped overseas, but Mrs. Qin still refused to let Qin Xiu off. She pressed on step by step until she achieved her wish.","With Mrs. Qin’s support, Du Jiayi was fearless and pressed forward step by step. As a result, the staff at the embassy misunderstood their relationship.","Mrs. Qin’s nagging and Du Jiayi’s relentless pursuit made Qin Xiu furious and helpless.","Qin Xiu retracted his sleeve and strode out.","One and a half years of pressure was enough for him!","Looking at Qin Xiu’s tall back as he left, Du Jiayi, whose eyes flashed with ruthlessness, ran off again. The man in front of her was an obsession she couldn’t let go of. From the first time she saw Qin Xiu, she knew that he was the perfect lover and husband she wanted!","She had to woo him even if she had to spend her entire life. Only she, Du Jiayi, was worthy of Qin Xiu. Only she! Besides her, no one else had the right to stand beside Qin Xiu and become his wife!","Qin Xiu’s wife could only be her!","There was not only a deep obsession in her eyes but also wild possessiveness.","She had no choice but to keep on going. She would continue to chase after him relentlessly, going to the extreme.","Without Mrs. Qin’s support, Du Jiayi, who had always been arrogant, might have let go of her pride after repeatedly hitting a wall."]},{"number":4839,"title":"Chapter 4839: Terrifying","paragraphs":["However, with Mrs. Qin’s support, Du Jiayi, who was extremely possessive, saw hope. That was why her life was like this for the past few years. The more Qin Xiu rejected her, the braver she became.","When she ran outside, the smooth tiled floor hurt her feet. Then, she saw Qin Xiu walking straight to a black sedan. He opened the trunk and put down the luggage. Du Jiayi knew that she couldn’t catch up, so she gritted her teeth. Her eyes were filled with madness.","Qin Xiu didn’t have a girlfriend, nor did he have any scandals. She had seen it clearly in the past year and a half.","He had someone he liked!","There was definitely someone he liked!","As for that person...","The corners of her lips curled up coldly. When the car started moving slowly, Du Jiayi, who was sneering, suddenly rushed to the side of the road and used her body to block the car.","Fortunately, the car was driving slowly and the driver’s reaction was very sharp. He stepped on the brakes, and Qin Xiu, who was sitting in the back seat, was thrown forward.","\"What happened?\" he asked.","The driver, whose back was covered in cold sweat, said, \"A woman suddenly rushed out to block the car.\" He rolled down the window and stuck his head out. He scolded the woman standing in front of the car, \"Are you crazy? Do you want to die? Even if you don’t want to live, don’t harm anyone else!\"","Du Jiayi glanced at the driver who was rude to her. She walked around the front of the car and grabbed the door handle of the back seat with one hand but it would not open. She knocked on the car window with her other hand. \"Qin Xiu, let me ask you a few last questions. After I’m done, I’ll give up pursuing you.\"","The dim street light shone on her face. Her expression turned dark and gloomy. For some reason, it made people’s hearts turn cold. Even her smile was sinister.","Qin Xiu glanced at her and instructed the driver, \"Drive.\"","\"Mr. Qin, you can’t drive. This woman is holding the car door with her hand and even deliberately stuck her foot under the car. If I drive, I’ll break her leg.\"","Damn it, this was the first time he saw such a crazy woman!","The driver whispered, \"Why don’t I get out of the car and pull her away?\"","Outside the car, Du Jiayi’s lips opened and closed. She smiled without any impatience. The honking of a car behind her urged her. It wasn’t just one car. It was a string of cars.","Qin Xiu’s expression turned completely dark. He took a deep breath and suppressed the anger in his heart. His eyes were cold as he opened the car door. \"Get in!\"","\"Thank you.\" Du Jiayi, who had succeeded, cheered for herself in her mind. Mrs. Qin sure had her methods!","Du Jiayi placed the luggage in the front seat and got into the back seat. She brushed the long hair beside her cheek and turned her head. She stared at the man’s face that made her crazy. She clenched her fists secretly.","\"Qin Xiu, I know that you don’t have a girlfriend. Given my good background, I thought I’d have a chance with you, but I kept bumping into walls. If it weren’t for Aunt’s support, I would’ve given up on you due to my pride.","\"I’ve been chasing you for so many years. I’m tired too. I don’t want to chase you anymore. Since we’re back in the country this time, why don’t we be honest and have a chat? After we’re done, I’ll let go completely and stop pestering you.","\"As for Aunt, I’ll personally explain things to her and won’t make things difficult for you. How about it? Do you want to talk?\"","Her voice was light. Qin Xiu, who was sitting at the side, was unmoved. He pursed his lips and ignored her.","Du Jiayi, who thought that she had already humbled herself, almost pierced her palm with her fingernails because of Qin Xiu’s disregard. She sighed softly. \"Don’t you believe me?\""]},{"number":4840,"title":"Chapter 4840: Dilemma","paragraphs":["\"I always mean what I say. I’m just asking for an answer. After that, I’ll get out of the car immediately! You don’t have a girlfriend because you like that military school student called Ye Jian, right?\"","Du Jiayi, who was answering her own questions, stared intently at the man who thought she was invisible. When Ye Jian’s name was mentioned, she focused her gaze on him. She didn’t want to miss any subtle expressions on Qin Xiu’s face.","Qin Xiu’s handsome face didn’t change at all, and she failed. Ye Jian was a stranger’s name to him.","She couldn’t see any changes in Qin Xiu, and her heart sank.","The more it was like this, the more certain she was that... the man she was chasing after liked another woman, and it was the person she hated the most!","Ye Jian!","It was indeed her!","Qin Xiu really liked her!","Mrs. Qin was right. Qin Xiu liked her!","The more expressionless he was, the more it meant that Ye Jian was the woman in his heart. He didn’t want her to know that he was protecting Ye Jian!","At this moment, Du Jiayi’s heart was burning with jealousy. It burned until her organs hurt.","\"Alright. Even if you don’t say it, I know that you like Ye Jian. You’re not saying it because you want to protect her and you’re worried that I’d make things difficult for her. Hmph, Qin Xiu, why do you think so badly of me? She’s just a military school student. I won’t lower my status to make things difficult for her.","\"Even if you don’t admit it, I know. Aunt saw it with her own eyes. Why are you still denying it? I really don’t understand what you’re thinking. Since you like her, why don’t you chase after her?","\"Oh, I understand. Ye Jian has another man by her side, right? That’s right. Commander Xia’s only son, Xia Jinyuan, likes her. My cousin, Li Jinnian, likes her too. I also know that she had a boy called Gao Yiyang who liked her in the past.","\"She’s a beauty who stepped out of the mountains. She’s really charming. So many scions like her. Including you, that’s four. Too many people like her, so Ye Jian probably doesn’t know who to choose.","\"Does she have a boyfriend? If not, I think it might be hard for her to choose someone. Qin Xiu, if you really like her, you should go after her. As long as you pursue Ye Jian, I’ll immediately choose to give up! I mean what I say!\"","In the car, Du Jiayi sighed softly, pondered, and exclaimed. As for Qin Xiu, he simply leaned his head against the backrest and closed his eyes to rest, pretending that no one was around.","Internally, though, he had already sneered several times.","He knew what Du Jiayi was planning.","If he didn’t know who she was, he might have been fooled by her words.","However, he understood this woman’s character.","She thought that the more she spoke, the more indifferent she was. In fact, she cared a lot.","She thought too highly of herself. She wanted to take a step back and figure out if he liked Ye Jian using this approach.","A beauty who stepped out of the mountains?","Who was Ye Jian?","She was Old Master Fu’s granddaughter!","What was the Du family in the Fu family’s eyes?","Qin Xiu, who was resting with his eyes closed, said to the driver, \"Send Miss Du home. Get the address from her.\"","Du Jiayi, who had been talking for a long time but still did not get an answer, was already gritting her teeth in hatred. Seeing this, she could only secretly clench her fists again and stab her palms with her sharp nails to restrain herself.","\"No need. Let me down up ahead.\"","Du Jiayi spoke calmly. She finally retracted her gaze from Qin Xiu’s face and said, \"Qin Xiu, I’ve given up on you. You don’t have to avoid me anymore. There’s no need.\""]},{"number":4841,"title":"Chapter 4841: Cause Trouble","paragraphs":["The car stopped. Du Jiayi pushed open the door and got out. The driver looked at Qin Xiu, who was resting with his eyes closed. Then, he got out of the car and took down luggage on the passenger seat.","From the beginning to the end, Qin Xiu didn’t speak to Du Jiayi at all. He only slowly opened his eyes when the car started moving.","There were ripples in his calm eyes.","Ye Jian...","Du Jiayi was right. The woman he liked was indeed Ye Jian.","Why didn’t he admit it?","Because there was no need!","What did it have to do with other people who he liked?","If he admitted it, it was very likely that he would end up causing trouble for Ye Jian.","No, this matter might have already caused trouble for Ye Jian!","Thinking of this, Qin Xiu pursed his lips into a straight line.","He didn’t expect that one day, his feelings would cause trouble for the woman he liked!","In the car, Qin Xiu’s emotions were fluctuating. Du Jiayi, who was standing on the spot, had already broken several of her fingernails.","Ye Jian, Ye Jian!","Someone from the mountains actually made countless scions fall in love with her. Yet, all of them were clueless!","Were they all blind?","Ye Ying was easily dealt with by her mother, but Ye Jian... She had been fine until now!","The man she liked actually liked a woman who wanted to climb up the social ladder. If it were any other young lady from a prestigious family in the capital, Du Jiayi would’ve relented!","Did Qin Xiu suddenly transfer back to the country because of... Ye Jian?!","That was right!","It was all for Ye Jian!","This b*tch graduated from the military school this year!","Under the streetlamp, Du Jiayi’s face was distorted. She gripped her luggage tightly and gritted her teeth. The viciousness in her eyes was as dark as ink.","She couldn’t wait any longer. She had to act!","Du Jiayi pulled the luggage to the side of the green belt. She first called the driver sent by her family to pick her up from the airport. Then, she dialed another set of numbers right on the heels of that. After the call ended, her cold eyes revealed a cold smile.","The night was getting darker. Even the bustling capital city was gradually calming down. Far away in the Northwest, the desert was so quiet that it was as if the entire universe had fallen asleep.","At 1:00 am, Ye Jian arrived at the base. The sentinel let her in. The company commander, who had been waiting, received a call from the sentinel. He picked up the camouflage jacket that was placed on the back of the office chair and said to the political commissar who was still sleeping on the desk opposite him, \"Old Tang, get up. She’s here!\"","Old Tang, the political commissar of the company, woke up from his dream. \"She’s here? Where is she?\"","\"She just entered the camp. Quick, let’s go get her. The instructor of the male soldiers is still alright, but the instructor of the female soldiers... They sent over the benefactor who saved us from danger.\"","Commissar Tang got up quickly and picked up his camouflage jacket. He didn’t forget to correct the company commander for using the wrong words. \"Wrong. She’s not our benefactor. She’s an instructor. She graduated from the National Science University like me!\"","\"What’s so great about that? You’re 14 years older than her!\" The company commander scoffed. \"I don’t care where she graduated from or how high her education level is. I just hope that she can settle those female soldiers and not leave a mess for me!","\"There’s no introduction to her resume. She’s as mysterious as a secret agent.\"","\"Are you looking down on graduates of the National Science University? Are you looking down on me too?\" Political Commissar Tang, who was half a step behind, raised his hand and pushed the back of the company commander in front of him. The company commander staggered a few times.","\"I’m not looking down on you, but I need to take a look first! I haven’t even seen her. Do you dare to have high hopes?\" The company commander turned around and glared at his partner. There was a hint of worry in his resolute eyes."]},{"number":4842,"title":"Chapter 4842: Night Talk","paragraphs":["The company commander, who was pushed by the political commissar, didn’t dare to walk forward anymore. Alas, the political commissar was easy to bully in the past. He had bullied him many times when he first came. Now, there was no need to talk about it.","The refined scholar had completely become a Northwestern man. Sometimes, he was even more ruthless than him, the company commander.","Well, since he and the new instructor graduated from the same military school, they were considered alumni. The political commissar had full authority to handle any matters. He, as the company commander, should just go meet the instructor first.","Political Commissar Tang, who had reached the door, suddenly returned and picked up the folder on his desk.","The company commander, who was standing and waiting, said seriously, \"Old Tang, I’ll leave all the female soldiers to you. You have to relearn your manners. No matter what, you were a university student back then. And unlike me, you’re more eloquent.","\"Female soldiers are different from male soldiers. I don’t know how to treat them. If I’m not careful, I’m afraid I’ll be punished. You should put in more effort. I’ll get my wife to bring you more local specialties in the future.\"","After coming out of the campsite, the company commander nagged until Political Commissar Tang glared at him a few times. He said angrily, \"What’s your problem? The things you say are so unpleasant to hear. Are you looking down on the students from the National Science University?\"","The company commander was anxious. \"When did I say that I look down on students from the National Science University? I’m so envious! Don’t interrupt me. Just like what we discussed before, I’ll leave the female soldiers to you. Don’t look for me if there’s no big problem. You’re a political commissar. You can handle it.","\"Did you see the headlights? They’re here. Old Tang, we can argue behind closed doors. We can’t embarrass ourselves outside!\"","\"Alright, alright, you’re better at talking than me. Hurry up and fetch her! Your words are hurting my ears.\" Commissar Tang rubbed his ears. When he opened his mouth again, his expression became especially serious. \"Since the military appointed a student who just graduated from military school as the instructor for the female soldiers, it means that she must have something extraordinary about her. I’ve told you countless times not to look down on her just because she just graduated and is a female soldier. This is a huge taboo.","\"Don’t tell me that you don’t look down on her. If you really valued her, you wouldn’t keep mentioning that you give me full authority to handle the female soldier team.","\"Why did you say that it won’t be easy to control the team? If the new female soldiers were capable, would you say that? No! You’d stick close to them. You’d be as strict as you could be!","\"Why didn’t you mention the male instructor who was transferred over at the last minute? Because you don’t despise him? It’s because he came over to train your soldiers. The male instructor from the special forces came over to train your soldiers, and you probably think half a year is too short.","\"Whether it’s a female soldier or a male soldier, it’s all the same. Your attitude toward male soldiers should be the same as your attitude toward female soldiers. We can’t differentiate between us.","\"How long has it been since the incident happened? The military immediately made arrangements to assign the 20 female soldiers who were supposed to be assigned to the Nanguang Military District to the Northwest. If you were a female soldier, what would you think?","\"This is a last-minute adjustment that requires unconditional obedience to the arrangements. Can the 20 female soldiers really remain calm? Honestly, I wouldn’t be able to do it either.","\"The instructor is here, but as the company commander, you don’t plan to care. What do you think the female soldiers will think? What will the female soldiers’ instructor think? She received three third-class honors and two second-class honors during school. Old Zhu, look at how many medals there are in your cabinet.\""]},{"number":4843,"title":"Chapter 4843: Why","paragraphs":["How many medals?","The company commander snorted. \"I have two more than her.\"","\"That’s right. You only have a few more than her after more than ten years in the military. As for her, she had five even before she graduated. Old Zhu, do you still dare to look down on the female instructor?","\"I was assigned here 14 years ago and have been working with you until now. You do look down on the students who just graduated from military school.\"","At the mention of the past, the company commander rubbed his nose unnaturally and straightened his camouflage cap. He smiled and said, \"That’s all in the past. There’s no need to mention it. I’m really not looking down on the female soldiers’ instructor.\"","\"History is repeating itself, so there’s a need to mention it. You don’t look like you’re looking down on her, but you have a lot of questions about the military merits of the female instructor, right?\" Political Commissar Tang strode forward. His expression was so serious that Company Commander Zhu felt a little nervous.","His biggest miscalculation was looking down on the political commissar who had just graduated and was assigned to the Northwest 14 years ago!","At that time, he wasn’t Political Commissar Tang or Old Tang. He was still fair and innocent! Of course... he was bullied!","Unexpectedly, 14 years later, it became the biggest miscalculation. Alas, it was a miscalculation!","As for the big questions about the military merits of the female instructor... Well, he still had some small questions.","For instance, how did she achieve two second-class honors during her studies?","He really wanted to know. He just didn’t know if there was a chance for him to find out.","Political Commissar Tang’s deep voice came from the cold night wind. \"Every student in the military school has to undergo military training. There aren’t many people with good military qualities. You looking down on them is one thing. But they might even look down on you!\"","\"How dare they!\" Company Commander Zhu, who had been silent all this while, was furious. \"How dare they look down on me? Ha, what right do they have?!\"","In the face of the furious company commander, Political Commissar Tang glanced at him. \"Then what right do you have to look down on us?\"","\"Nonsense. When did I look down on you?\"","\"I graduated from the military school too.\"","...","The company commander, who had a mouthful of blood stuck in his throat, sighed resignedly. \"Old Tang, I promise to treat everyone equally! I won’t make any mistakes! Change the topic, change the topic.\"","It was tiring. Were all the political commissars so smart? If he weren’t careful, he would fall into a trap.","Political Commissar Tang smiled in satisfaction like a ’kind father’. The company commander hammered his head several times. He couldn’t live like this anymore!","When Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan got out of the car, they saw a very enthusiastic person. He was so enthusiastic that even Xia Jinyuan, who was used to seeing big scenes, was stunned.","\"He’s so enthusiastic that it’s a little strange. Be careful.\" That kind of enthusiasm was abnormal. Xia Jinyuan’s hair stood on end. He immediately reminded Ye Jian in a low voice, \"Don’t agree to his conditions immediately.\"","Facing the overly enthusiastic company commander, Xia Jinyuan instinctively felt that there must be a problem.","Ye Jian didn’t feel anything. She replied softly, \"You’re thinking too much. Being enthusiastic is better than being cold. I heard from the instructor that we military school students will more or less be looked down on by the veterans when we’re assigned to the base. To be honest, I’m already prepared to be looked down on.","\"I feel more at ease seeing the company commander being so enthusiastic. I’m the instructor assigned by the military to train the new female soldiers. He has no reason to play tricks on me.\"","Xia Jinyuan thought about it and agreed with Ye Jian.","That made sense.","One was the female instructor sent by the military, while the other was the company commander of the female soldiers’ company. Although the two of them were subordinates, their goal was the same. They were working hard to train qualified Northwest female soldiers.","In that case, it was impossible for there to be a trap."]},{"number":4844,"title":"Chapter 4844: Interaction","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan immediately laughed softly. \"Not bad, baby. You thought of the crux of the matter so quickly.\"","Ye Jian smiled and replied, \"Because I’m more pure-hearted than you.\"","Xia Jinyuan wasn’t angry. Instead, his smile deepened.","He thought too much because he knew that there were some unwritten rules in the military unit. In the past, when he just joined the Xueyu unit, the members all wanted to take him down a notch.","Since Ye Jian thought that there was no problem, there was no problem.","It wasn’t necessarily a bad thing to let her face trouble due to these unwritten rules.","Why did they say that veterans looked down on new graduates from the military school?","As the veterans generally felt that the military school students were inferior to them, they were more or less unconvinced.","In order to let the veterans know how powerful the little fox was, it was better for the other party to come up with some hard tricks. It could help convince the veterans in advance.","It would also allow this company commander to acknowledge the little fox as soon as possible. It was impossible that he didn’t have other motives, seeing how enthusiastic he was.","Mr. Fu, who was sitting in the car and didn’t get out, was stunned by the company commander’s enthusiasm. He knew Company Commander Zhu. Every time the base changed its defense, he would be the one coming over. They were old acquaintances.","However, he had never seen him like this before. His smile was so wide that it reached his ears!","Something was wrong.","Mr. Fu placed his hand on the car lock and considered getting out.","Upon seeing this, the orderly told the soldier who was receiving them to wait a moment until Mr. Fu signaled him to leave first.","Sometimes, when the officers and soldiers in Mr. Fu’s base would rest a night at the camp before leaving the next day.","Company Commander Zhu had already shaken hands with Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan. He kept smiling. Ye Jian was worried that his face would cramp from smiling so much.","\"It’s been hard on the two of you after a day of traveling. I’ll get a soldier to bring you to rest now. We’ll meet again tomorrow when the female soldiers arrive.","\"Captain Xia, you have to work hard. Ever since the male soldiers knew that a captain from the special forces would come to train them, they kept asking me about it. They wanted to see you as soon as possible.\"","The company commander looked at the time. It was ten minutes past one in the morning. \"The male soldiers will start their training in four hours. I hope you can observe them and have a basic understanding of the male soldiers’ training in advance, Captain Xia.\"","\"Of course,\" Xia Jinyuan replied with a smile. His military rank was higher than Company Commander Zhu’s, but because the situation was different, he had to listen to Company Commander Zhu’s arrangements.","At the side, Political Commissar Tang heaved a sigh of relief. Although this lieutenant colonel captain came from the special forces, he looked like a captain who cared about principles. It seemed that he wouldn’t use his military rank to solve problems.","The following arrangements would be much smoother and there wouldn’t be any friction.","Company Commander Zhu was a lieutenant like Ye Jian. He had the military rank of a lieutenant, but Xia Jinyuan had two bars and two stars. Political Commissar Tang also had two bars and two stars. This was why Political Commissar Tang could educate Company Commander Zhu.","Political Commissar Tang, who was secretly observing, spoke to Ye Jian. \"I’m 14 years older than you. I haven’t returned to my alma mater since I graduated. It must have changed a lot.\"","Before she came, Ye Jian didn’t know that Political Commissar Tang was also a graduate of the National Science University. Hearing that, she immediately felt close to him. Even her words were less restrained.","On the way to the dormitory, Political Commissar Tang talked about the female soldiers who would arrive tomorrow. All the female soldiers would arrive before 2:00 pm tomorrow. They would arrange accommodation for them and let them rest before they were to gather.","\"This is the roster. All the female soldiers’ names, personalities, and specialties are clearly noted down. You can take the time to understand them. Among them are Gao Xiao and Qiu Tong. The officer at the military depot emphasized that there’s something else to their relationship. They’re at odds with each other. You need to pay more attention to them.\""]},{"number":4845,"title":"Chapter 4845: Not Bad, Not Bad","paragraphs":["Political Commissar Tang’s meticulousness undoubtedly helped Ye Jian adapt to the unfamiliar environment. The two of them asked questions and gave answers. They were from the same alma mater, so although there was an age difference, they were able to chat.","It was only a short distance to the dormitory. Political Commissar Tang was very satisfied, and Ye Jian was the same.","Xia Jinyuan and Company Commander Zhu were chatting too. If not for the fact that Xia Jinyuan would have to wake up and meet the male soldiers in a few hours, Company Commander Zhu would have wanted to continue talking to him.","\"Brother, we’ve found the right person this time. Did you know that two years ago, an instructor came to the company to guide us? He had the aura of an official. It’s just that he lacked some real talent.","\"Our job is to protect the entire base. Yet, he taught and brainwashed my soldiers every day. He even arranged for them to learn a soldier’s song every week!","\"I’m not against them learning soldier songs, but he arranged lessons every day and wrote all the teaching materials in writing. I was so angry that I laughed. The battalion commanders had a headache too. In the end, they thought of a way and finally asked this big shot to leave.\"","It was only a short distance, but Company Commander Zhu and Xia Jinyuan were already calling each other ’Brother’.","As a lieutenant colonel, Xia Jinyuan’s military rank was two levels higher than Company Commander Zhu. At first, Company Commander Zhu thought that Xia Jinyuan wouldn’t be easy to get along with and would put on airs. In the end, when they talked, he didn’t put on any airs at all. Even his training insights were very compatible with the company commander’s.","As a result, the company commander’s initial worry disappeared, and they quickly chatted happily.","In the eyes of Company Commander Zhu, the new lieutenant colonel looked refined and handsome, but he didn’t have the aura of a pretty boy. He gave off the appearance that he could unleash his domineering aura and restrain it at will. One look and you could tell that he had the confidence to do so.","It was to the company commander’s liking.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t stand on ceremony. Although his military rank was higher than Company Commander Zhu, he hadn’t served the military for as long. Hence, to show his respect, Xia Jinyuan still called him ’Company Commander’.","\"He was probably transferred from the general affairs department and needed to train under the company to add to his resume. He was an officer who came here to make plans for the future.","\"He didn’t do any training and only talked to the soldier. If it were me, I would’ve tolerated him for, at most, three months. Three months later, I would’ve asked him to leave immediately.\"","\"Hahaha, that’s right! Three months later, we politely invited him to leave. Before he left, we held a farewell party and thanked him for his three months of hard work.\"","The company commander’s loud laughter came from behind. Under the cold moonlight, it added color to the quiet night.","Ye Jian couldn’t help but smile.","Her Captain Xia was like a fish in water wherever he went. He could quickly integrate into the new environment as quickly as possible.","This was an advantage that was worth learning.","Fifteen minutes later, the political commissar and company commander left together. They were all staying in the same building, but there was a distance between upstairs and downstairs.","Ye Jian and the female soldiers stayed here too. Not far away was the male soldiers’ dormitory.","There was a regiment of soldiers around the base. There were more than 1,800 soldiers guarding the entire base.","Ye Jian’s camp only had a battalion. There were a total of 560 officers. As there had never been a female soldier in the camp, the dormitory arrangement gave the leaders of the camp a headache for a long time. In the end, they simply arranged a dormitory building for the officers, which solved the problem temporarily.","It was just a temporary solution.","Just like what Political Commissar Tang said to Ye Jian, if all 20 female soldiers stayed behind, the regiment would definitely arrange another dormitory.","Although the military didn’t differentiate male and female soldiers, their gender was still different. They had to pay attention to what they needed to."]},{"number":4846,"title":"Chapter 4846: Fight","paragraphs":["As Company Commander Zhu climbed up the stairs, he said to Commissar Tang, \"Captain Xia is quite to my liking. He’s indeed the captain of a special forces team. He’s much better than the guy two years ago who only knew how to talk.","\"I feel that the soldiers under me will lose a few more layers of skin in his hands. How was the situation on your side? It didn’t seem bad.\"","They had already agreed to split the work and work together. They wanted to understand the background of the two new instructors.","Political Commissar Tang smiled and said, \"Just like you, I like her. She’s a very reliable lieutenant. She’s not a bookworm, and she’s much steadier than me in the past.","\"As for her true capabilities, we’ll only know after the training starts. She’s very tight-lipped. We won’t be able to get anything out of her. She looks young, but she doesn’t reveal anything. She’s not simple.\"","Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian, who were washing up, didn’t know that they were being discussed again. Although the two of them were only separated by a wall, they didn’t overstep their boundaries. In a few hours, they would face the heavy responsibility given by the military. They would let go of their love for the time being.","More than half of the 20 female soldiers in the military depot had insomnia. Even when they fell asleep, they couldn’t sleep well. From time to time, they would roll around. When they woke up the next day, almost everyone didn’t sleep well.","The departure time was seven in the morning. Even if they didn’t sleep the entire night, they had to wake up.","The female soldiers were taken to the camp by two military trucks, each carrying ten people.","They stood in two groups. They were all wearing army camouflage uniforms. They carried backpacks and held camouflage bags in their right hands. They got into the trucks one by one.","Gao Xiao and Qiu Tong, who spent the night in the same room, were also in the same truck. Before they reached the camp, the other eight female soldiers in the truck could tell that their relationship was tense.","When they were getting to know each other, the others didn’t ask questions when they saw that the two did not get along. At most, they would intentionally or unintentionally try to avoid letting the two speak at the same time to avoid arguments.","Ye Jian didn’t sleep until 1:40 am, but she woke up early in the morning and went to the training ground to watch the male soldiers train. She also saw her own man appear. In the end, it was a one-on-one, a one-on-two, a one-on-three, and a one-on-five. He won all the battles with overwhelming excellence and won applause from the audience.","When a veteran faced a strong person, the strong opponent would first try to resist. It was a bloodthirstiness that came from his bones. After resisting, he would admit defeat.","After all the fighting, the clean desert camouflage uniform on Xia Jinyuan’s body was already dusty. The company commander, who kept cheering, walked to Xia Jinyuan’s side and shouted at the hundreds of soldiers, \"How is it? Are you impressed with your new instructor?\"","\"Yes!’","\"No!\"","There were those who were convinced and those who were not.","It was just a battle, not a complete victory. Naturally, there were people who were unwilling to accept it.","When the company commander heard a soldier shouting that he was unconvinced, he immediately chuckled. \"Those who are convinced, take three steps back! Those who are unconvinced, stay on the spot! One, two, three!\"","After the command, Ye Jian saw at least a hundred soldiers standing still on the sports ground.","Feeling that she was standing a little far away, Ye Jian hurriedly took a few steps closer.","She wanted to see how the unconvinced soldiers would challenge Captain Xia.","Captain Xia wouldn’t reject them!","Xia Jinyuan, who was scanning the sports ground, saw her from the corner of his eyes. He dusted off the yellow sand on his hands and smiled. \"There’s no hurry. We still have a long way to go.","\"You should know that there’s another instructor other than me, right? You can’t just spar with me. We can’t miss out on her.","\"Is there anyone who wants to spar with the female instructor?\""]},{"number":4847,"title":"Chapter 4847: What Are You Looking At?","paragraphs":["With just one sentence, Xia Jinyuan pushed the atmosphere of the entire sports ground to a higher point. When the veterans who were standing upright heard this, they raised their necks and shouted, \"Yes! Yes! Yes!\"","Good lord, they didn’t just answer once. They shouted repeatedly.","The roar shook the sky. It was so loud that the green veins on their neck were throbbing.","Ye Jian went from a bystander to the person involved. She was invited on stage by Xia Jinyuan and was about to face hundreds of male soldiers.","Xia Jinyuan wiped the sweat off his face and said to the soldiers, whose interest was piqued and enthusiasm was hooked, \"You guys rest first. I have to invite the female soldier instructor.","\"The squad leader of each class will lead the team and rest on the spot for ten minutes. Especially those who want to spar with the female instructor, you must hurry up and rest well. This is my advice to you.\"","The soldiers laughed. They laughed easily without any pressure.","When the company commander saw this, he felt embarrassed.","Sons of b*tches! Had they never seen a female soldier?","In 2003, the Northwest military unit, especially the military unit located in the depths of the desert, was very far away from the rest of civilization. Their forms of entertainment were the various competitions between themselves. It was not surprising that the soldiers were very excited.","The company commander glared at the group of veterans who were all red-eyed when they heard the word ’female’. The company commander shouted at his soldiers, \"If you keep acting like this, where will I put my dignity? All of you, restrain yourselves! Don’t scare the female instructor away.! All of you, line up and receive your punishment!\"","He wasn’t angry. He just had a serious expression on his face.","Even the soldiers in the company knew it. The deputy company commander teased, \"I’m quite interested too. I’ve never seen a female soldier sparring with a male soldier before.\"","Company Commander Zhu glared at his deputy company commander. \"You’re joining in too? Don’t you think it’s noisy enough?\"","\"No, no. I’m just supporting you. I think Political Commissar Tang has something to communicate with you.\" The sharp-eyed deputy company commander saw Political Commissar Tang walking over and immediately raised his voice.","Since the company officer wasn’t around, he could only ask Political Commissar Tang to step in.","The political commissar walked over and looked at Company Commander Zhu’s expression. Then, he looked at the deputy company commander’s expression. He didn’t need to ask to know why Company Commander Zhu’s expression was dark.","\"I think it’s quite good. Let them see the capabilities of the female soldier, Instructor Ye, so that they won’t think that they’re the best.\"","As he said this, Political Commissar Tang glanced at Company Commander Zhu either intentionally or unintentionally. Company Commander Zhu, who wasn’t looking so well, felt his chest hurting.","Why was he looking at him?","Why?","Fine, he was a political commissar, a higher-ranking official. He, as the company commander, would just accept being stared at.","Seeing that the company commander didn’t throw a temper, Political Commissar Tang continued to smile and say, \"It’s time to teach them that there’s always someone better. Otherwise, they’ll be like frogs looking at the sky from a well. They won’t have a wide perspective.\"","Ha, frogs in a well... That definitely included him. They were all the same. The political commissars in the military unit were all the same!","The company commander, who was cursing in his heart, lowered his voice and said, \"Political Commissar, you’re too anxious. The female instructor hasn’t even said anything. Why are we involving her? We shouldn’t embarrass the female instructor.\"","\"If Instructor Ye didn’t have some skills, Captain Xia wouldn’t have done this. He wants to help Instructor Ye establish her might. Of course, we have to go with the flow. This will help with our future work progress.\""]},{"number":4848,"title":"Chapter 4848: Bickering","paragraphs":["Establish her might?","The image that the company commander had in mind wouldn’t help the female instructor establish her might at all. Instead, he could only imagine the male soldiers throwing the female instructor around like a sandbag!","How embarrassing would it be for the female instructor?","\"But you shouldn’t do that!\" The company commander was worried that Ye Jian would be embarrassed in front of the male soldiers. He was a little anxious. \"Also, if she wants to establish her might, these guys shouldn’t be her opponents! The 20 female soldiers will arrive in the afternoon. She should show her might in front of them.\"","Political Commissar Tang looked at the back view of the female soldier, Instructor Ye. His eyes were filled with smiles. \"What are you anxious about? Don’t you see? Captain Xia isn’t anxious, and Instructor Ye isn’t either. It’s obvious that they know what they’re doing.","\"You’re worrying for nothing. Don’t panic. Calm down and take a good look at Instructor Ye’s ability. I believe it’ll be exciting.\"","After he finished speaking, he paused for a moment before adding, \"It’ll be even more exciting than watching Captain Xia because she’s a female instructor.\"","It would definitely be... exciting!","\"Let me put it bluntly. She’s going to be beaten up by the soldiers in our battalion. Old Tang, you’ll explain it to the battalion commanders yourself. Also, Old Sun, inform Old Liang’s deputy captain in advance. Otherwise, if we wait till something really happens, it’ll be too late.\"","There were three companies in the camp and three company commanders—Company Commander Zhu, Company Commander Sun, and Company Commander Liang.","Company Commander Sun had followed the battalion commanders to the base while Company Commander Liang went to the neighboring camp to communicate for a few days. Company Commander Liang wouldn’t be back for another week. Now, the deputy commander was handling company matters.","There were about 120 people in a company.","There was the company commander, the deputy company commander, and the liaison officer in each company.","There were three platoon leaders with no deputies.","There were three classes in each platoon, with a platoon leader but no deputies.","The company commander wasn’t around, so the deputy commander had full authority to handle all the company’s matters. Zhu Zhifan wasn’t just any company commander. If there was an urgent matter, he could still handle it. However, he couldn’t interfere with the company’s matters.","Political Commissar Tang saw that Company Commander Zhu didn’t have any confidence in Ye Jian and was furious. If the soldiers weren’t here, he would have kicked him away.","\"You’re looking down on us again, right? Did you treat what I said last night as nonsense? Let me tell you, I’ll let you be the first to spar with Instructor Ye later.\"","Political Commissar Tang was so angry that he addressed the company commander directly.","Company Commander Zhu’s expression turned completely dark as he replied, \"So be it. I’m not afraid!\"","\"You need to stop looking down on people!\"","\"I’ve never looked down on people!\"","\"Fine, you said it! I’ll f*cking tell Instructor Ye not to show mercy. Hit her up as hard as you can! You look down on the students who graduated from the National Science University, right? I’ll teach you a lesson today!\"","The usually refined political commissar was agitated now.","The deputy commander could only feel helpless. ’Oh, Company Commander Zhu! Why do you insist on arguing with the political commissar and battalion commanders?’","The company commander waited for Political Commissar Tang to leave angrily before turning to the deputy commander. \"Did I anger the political commissar again?\"","\"Yes, you did,\" the deputy commander replied truthfully. He was used to it.","Company Commander Zhu was angry too. He pursed his lips and said, \"Accompany tonight to write a reflective essay. Damn it, as a company commander, I wrote more reflections than my own soldiers in a year. How embarrassing!\"","It was good that he knew. But even if he knew, he would continue to embarrass himself. Hence, there was nothing to be embarrassed about.","The deputy commander could not help but silently think that."]},{"number":4849,"title":"Chapter 4849: Fight Well","paragraphs":["The deputy commander said, \"There’s nothing to be embarrassed about. Everyone in the camp knows about it.\"","As usual, one had to maintain an honest heart and never hide anything. If one had something to say, one should say it.","The company commander glared at him. \"Can you not say it out loud? Save some of my reputation.\"","\"Company Commander, even our officer said that reputation isn’t given by others. It’s earned. If you want an honorable reputation, you have to earn it.\" The deputy commander sighed heavily and expressed his opinion. He kindly reminded the company commander of the entire regiment, \"Be prepared to fight with the female soldier. If you’re careless, you’ll suffer a serious setback as the result of a careless mistake. Don’t lose to the female soldier.","\"If you really lose, it’ll probably become a hot topic in our camp for the next five years. It won’t be just a little embarrassing by then. You’ll lose all your dignity.","\"I have to remind you that Political Commissar Tang is right about one thing. Since Captain Xia isn’t worried, it means that he’s very confident in the female instructor. That’s why he dares to challenge the male soldiers on behalf of the female instructor.\"","The confident Company Commander Zhu was continuously attacked by Political Commissar Tang and the deputy commander. His self-confidence, which was as strong as a city wall, wavered a little.","However, the famous company commander of the regiment would never lower his head and admit defeat easily. He had never been afraid!","After thinking for a moment, he said, \"Let me warm up first.\"","If he really lost, he would lose all his dignity!","He wouldn’t fight a battle he wasn’t confident in. He needed to be stable before seeking victory.","The deputy commander watched as the company commander warmed up. Then, he looked at the other three companies. Political Commissar Tang gathered the first company and the second company together and said something.","On the other hand, Xia Jinyuan smiled at Ye Jian and said, \"No matter how happy you are watching from the sidelines, it’s better to go on stage personally. Ever since you recuperated, you haven’t competed seriously, right? The opportunity is here. Hurry up.\"","That was true.","After coming out of the hospital, Ye Jian went back to school to revise and take the makeup exams. Besides the morning run with the new students, she hadn’t done anything else. Even the training was put aside.","At first, she didn’t have any thoughts about it. Now that Xia Jinyuan mentioned it, Ye Jian felt her hands itching. \"Okay, I’ll warm up first and see if I’m rusty.\"","Fighting wasn’t Ye Jian’s strongest forte, but her skills weren’t bad either.","That year, when she went to the Xueyu unit for training, Xia Jinyuan arranged for her to fight with the special forces soldiers before she could even put down her company luggage. After a few rounds, she lost gloriously.","It had been a long time since she last did such a thing. She had been resting for a few months, so she had to prepare.","Hence, Ye Jian continued, \"I’ll warm up first. If I really lose, the military will be very disappointed in me.","\"That’s why I specially gave them ten minutes of rest. Move around and stretch your muscles. I’ll help you.\" Xia Jinyuan volunteered, so Ye Jian didn’t reject him.","Stretching was easy. Just bend your legs to the left and right, stretch your shoulders and back, put your feet together, raise your arms high and straighten your body, then sit down with your legs in an ’eight’ shape, and press your body down between your legs...","Five minutes later, all the muscles and bones in her body relaxed, and she entered the zone.","She hadn’t reached her optimal state yet. She needed to enter her optimal state and compete. She needed to stir up the atmosphere and circulate the hot blood in her entire body. Only when adrenaline was secreted and her heart was pumping could she enter her optimal state.","The deputy commanders of the first and second companies had already reminded the soldiers in their company that any of them could step out to fight, but they couldn’t embarrass the female instructor.","Of course, if the female instructor was really strong, the soldiers didn’t have to give in just because the instructor was a woman. They would still fight when they needed to."]},{"number":4850,"title":"Chapter 4850: Seizing The Timing","paragraphs":["The deputy commanders reminded the soldiers the same thing—it depended on the situation.","Xia Jinyuan was different. He asked Ye Jian to hit them ruthlessly without showing any mercy. She shouldn’t even think about holding back. Establishing her prestige wasn’t a joke. It was to prevent rumors from spreading in the future.","Why was a student who had just graduated from the military school able to take on such a huge responsibility? Was there something going on? Was it possible that someone else did the actual work and she was the one taking credit?","There would definitely be doubts like those. In that case, what they needed to do was to put an end to all doubts.","Even if there were doubts and people came to the camp to enquire, everyone—even the soldiers from the cooking team—should know that Ye Jian was able to take on such a heavy responsibility because of her capabilities!","Xia Jinyuan put in a lot of effort for Ye Jian’s future development.","Of course, Major General Yang was also hard at work.","Ye Jian was capable. From the age of 14, she was groomed as a talent. Now, it was time for her to show her skills and serve the country.","After Ye Jian finished warming up, Commissar Tang walked over and happily told Ye Jian that the company commander of the third company would take the lead. \"Don’t underestimate Zhu Ganggang because he’s short. He’s agile, and his iron hands can bend steel bars the size of mineral water caps.\"","The company commander of the third company was named Zhu Ganggang?","What a strange name!","Ye Jian treated the nickname given to Company Commander Zhu by the camp as his real name.","Commissar Tang continued to brief Ye Jian about Company Commander Zhu’s weakness. Poor Company Commander Zhu, who was still warming up, didn’t know that Commissar Tang had sold him out.","The deputy commander of the third company saw that Commissar Tang was still talking to the female instructor in a low voice and didn’t have any intention of stopping. His heart skipped a beat as he walked toward Company Commander Zhu.","His instincts told him that Commissar Tang was doing something that was detrimental to the company commander.","At critical moments, as the deputy commander, he had to stand beside the company commander. He could not waver.","Commissar Tang told Ye Jian carefully, \"His upper body is very strong. His entire body is filled with muscles. It’s as hard as a rock. Also, he likes to take off his clothes and fight. Don’t be embarrassed when you see him do that later.","\"Let me tell you another thing. Once he takes off his clothes and starts sweating, his skin will be slippery. It’ll be very difficult to catch him. Find an opportunity to cover your palms with sand from time to time. It’ll help you.","\"Don’t show mercy. He looks down on our National Science University! Ha, to tell you the truth, when I was assigned here, he dared to give me a hard time even though he was just a squad leader. I’ve been suppressing my anger for 14 years. Little Ye, I’ll rely on you to stand up for me.\"","Of course, the last sentence was a joke.","Although the temperature in the highlands was low, the sun was strong enough. Even though it was early in the morning, Ye Jian’s forehead started to sweat. Her palms were wet too.","Xia Jinyuan, who was also listening attentively, understood Commissar Tang’s intention. He was trying his best to take care of Ye Jian.","It sounded like he was telling Ye Jian the company commander’s weaknesses in advance, but in fact, he was letting Ye Jian know how powerful he was.","It was not easy to raise one’s position and military rank in the military unit. Company Commander Zhu went from an ordinary soldier to a squad leader and then to a company commander. His personal ability was definitely extraordinary.","After ten minutes of rest, the three companies and hundreds of soldiers gathered in their teams. Only then did Commissar Tang end his reminder.","Xia Jinyuan smiled at Ye Jian and said, \"Fight well. Defeat Company Commander Zhu, who’s a tough nut to crack, and you’ll become famous in one battle. You’ll be able to establish your might from then on.\""]},{"number":4851,"title":"Chapter 4851: Get Called Out","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan used a serious and cold expression to tell Ye Jian his attitude toward this matter.","Ye Jian nodded solemnly and replied, \"I’ll work hard to defeat Company Commander Zhu.\"","Now, she really couldn’t consider taking care of Company Commander Zhu’s reputation. She relaxed again. \"The company commander’s name is Zhu Ganggang. What an odd name.\"","Xia Jinyuan couldn’t help but laugh. \"That’s the nickname the regiment gave Company Commander Zhu. Did you take it seriously? Azure Bird, you have to learn to distinguish between truth and lies.\"","Ye Jian was speechless.","How would she know that Commissar Tang would mention Company Commander Zhu’s nickname in front of her? \"Didn’t you say that nicknames are prohibited?\"","\"It’s not a big deal. It’s not insulting so it’s alright. At that time, the veterans in the team gave me the nickname ’Softie.’ Later, I used my fists and intelligence to tell them who was the softie.\"","Xia Jinyuan glanced at the front. \"Your battle has started. Go up and introduce yourself first.\"","He wasn’t worried that Ye Jian would have stage fright. He knew that the woman he loved would become stronger when she met a strong opponent. She would be brave and never flinch.","Ye Jian walked over with standard steps. She walked to Commissar Tang’s side and saluted all the soldiers present. \"Hello, everyone. I’m the instructor of the female soldier class, Ye Jian. Nice to meet you.\"","In the blue sky where there were no white clouds, the female soldier instructor, Ye Jian, stood in front of the hundreds of male soldiers. She seemed to have been imbued with the restrained might of the desert that had been around for thousands of years. She was not afraid at all.","Ye Jian chose Xia Jinyuan’s method of establishing her dominance. It was a round-robin battle. There were five soldiers, including Company Commander Zhu.","The soldiers standing upright were all shocked. Although they didn’t show it on their faces, their hearts were churning.","She was doing the same thing as Captain Xia!","How could she be the same as Captain Xia?","One was the captain of the special forces, while the other... had just graduated from the military school.","Company Commander Zhu clicked his tongue. She was very bold and courageous! She actually dared to learn from Captain Xia, who was from the special forces.","He wanted to persuade her, but Xia Jinyuan said, \"The female instructor was the first to issue a challenge. Do we male soldiers have the guts to accept it?\"","The company commander widened his eyes. He suddenly felt that this Captain Xia was similar to Commissar Tang.","The male soldiers replied in unison, \"Yes, yes, yes!\"","Xia Jinyuan shouted. \"Captain Zhu, it’s up to you now!\"","Before he could say anything, Ye Jian smiled and said, \"Company Commander Zhu, let’s not stand on ceremony and start fighting. How about that?\"","Company commander Zhu, who had prepared a few words in advance, paused for a moment and nodded. \"Okay!\"","How could he not agree?","He had to agree. If not, Commissar Tang, who was waiting to watch a good show, would definitely call him out!","All the soldiers sat down cross-legged on the spot and applauded warmly to show how eager they were to watch.","Just like what Commissar Tang said, the company commander took off his clothes the moment he took the stage. However, he was a little reserved this time. He was wearing a singlet inside. \"Start the countdown.\"","Xia Jinyuan immediately shouted, \"One, two, three, start!\"","The moment he said that, they started. The two of them attacked at almost the same speed. They clenched their fists tightly and shouted at each other.","The company commander retracted his strength until Ye Jian, who was clearly rushing over, suddenly swayed. Her movements were so fast that shadows appeared in front of him. He took a heavy punch to the right side of his waist."]},{"number":4852,"title":"Chapter 4852: Fight","paragraphs":["...","The entire venue was silent for at least three seconds. The soldiers expressed their feelings at this moment with confusion.","Commissar Tang widened his eyes. He didn’t see wrongly just now. The female soldier, Instructor Ye, punched Company Commander Zhu!","How fierce!","The company commander was even more confused.","Did she hit him?","He was actually punched!","\"Way to go!\"","The silent training ground was filled with the cheers of the political commissar. With that, the soldiers from the three companies also started to follow.","Company Commander Zhu’s expression was tense as he listened to the cheers. He felt aggrieved and wanted to vomit blood.","The political commissar in their camp didn’t want to see him doing well. The more unlucky he was, the happier the political commissar would be.","Clenching his fists, the company commander fought again.","With one punch, Company Commander Zhu’s contempt was completely wiped out. The soldiers cheered with Commissar Tang. As for him, it hurt!","The place where he was punched was quite painful. The punch let him know that the female instructor in front of him wasn’t putting on appearances. It also let him know that the female soldier was very strong.","Company Commander Zhu attacked again with a sharp wind. The air seemed to be distorted by his iron fist.","Commissar Tang had said that Company Commander Zhu’s iron fists were quite powerful. Ye Jian looked at his two attacks and saw that he was indeed using his fists as the vanguard. She focused her attention on his iron fists and used her lower body to attack. Her arms were for defense, and her legs were for offense.","Then, she saw Company Commander Zhu clenching his fists. The muscles on his arms were bulging. Ye Jian mainly attacked his elbows and shoulders.","Ye Jian quickly retreated and dodged the company commander’s punches. After dodging several times, Ye Jian kicked Company Commander Zhu’s lower body at lightning speed, kicking his thigh.","This was also a weak spot. After being kicked, people would be unable to raise their legs for a long time. Their mobility would be hindered.","The moves of the Xueyu unit were either killing moves or heavy blows to the weaker parts of the human body. They would first hinder the enemy’s movements and then find an opportunity to kill them.","Company Commander Zhu was flabbergasted. He had already realized that the female instructor he thought was ordinary wasn’t an ordinary instructor.","Her moves were the same as Captain Xia’s. They were all killing moves and filled with killing intent. She didn’t look like a student who had just graduated from military school.","As a soldier who guarded this special territory, Company Commander Zhu’s hands had been stained with blood before. He had killed before. That was why he was getting more and more frightened as he fought. His gaze became more and more serious.","The female soldier, Instructor Ye, had definitely killed before! He was 100% sure of it.","Company Commander Zhu had no choice but to retreat quickly when his knee was hit. The excruciating pain overwhelmed him. Amidst another round of cheers, Company Commander Zhu took a few steps back. He then stood still to stretch his left leg.","Ye Jian retracted her long legs and clenched her fists. She didn’t give the company commander a chance to rest and adjust. Her speed was so fast that a small whirlwind was formed on the ground. The wind swept up yellow dust as she attacked head-on with a mighty and fierce aura.","In close combat, it was taboo for one’s body to be captured and heavily injured. When Company Commander Zhu saw this, the first thing he thought of was not to attack but to defend.","He used his iron fists to defend.","Although Ye Jian was attacking, Company Commander Zhu’s iron fists were not easy to deal with. Even though he was defending, she would still suffer. After a few rounds, her arms hurt too.","She couldn’t continue like this. If this continued, she suspected that she wouldn’t be able to raise her arms tomorrow. She needed to knock Company Commander Zhu to the ground as soon as possible."]},{"number":4853,"title":"Chapter 4853: Heroes From Our Generation","paragraphs":["To win the battle, one had to knock the other party to the ground.","The company commander had the same thought. He was already frightened. He knew that he had underestimated the female soldier, Instructor Ye. Now... he couldn’t say anything!","Xia Jinyuan, who was watching from the side, had a faint smile on his thin lips. He stood at the side like a pine tree under the moon. Occasionally, when he saw Ye Jian making a move, he would narrow his eyes. No one knew what he was thinking.","The instructors of the first, second, and third companies had already walked over. They were in charge of the various training exercises. They had been soldiers for more than five years and were strict and didn’t like to smile. When new recruits came, the first person they were most afraid of would definitely be their instructor.","Xia Jinyuan was now the instructor of three companies, so he naturally became the chief instructor of the entire camp. If there were any questions, they would naturally look for him.","Just now, Xia Jinyuan sparred with the three instructors of the company. Ye Jian learned how to fight from the Xueyu unit, so their moves were naturally similar. The instructors in charge of training detected something and came over to confirm their guesses.","Facing the guesses of the three instructors, Xia Jinyuan smiled and said, \"You didn’t see wrongly. She’s indeed a soldier I brought up. She’s also a special forces soldier. If not, why would I let her fight with the soldiers?","\"If she goes on stage, the three of you...\" Xia Jinyuan smiled, and the facial expressions on his face tensed up instantly. \"The three of you are really not her match. Even I can’t get the upper hand with her. The same goes for the soldiers under me.\"","The three instructors looked at each other.","\"Why can she become the instructor of the female soldiers? It’s because of her ability.\" Xia Jinyuan felt proud when he said this.","The skinny girl in the past had worked hard to become a strong person who could fight against evil step by step. He contributed to it too. How could he not be proud?","The instructor of the third company looked at the female soldier instructor who had the upper hand. His Adam’s apple moved slightly as he whispered, \"Doesn’t that mean that our company commander will definitely lose?\"","\"From the looks of it, there’s a high chance that he’ll lose.\" Xia Jinyuan’s answer left some dignity for the company commander.","There was a high chance that he would lose. What he meant to say was that he would definitely lose.","The three instructors held their breaths. Company Commander Zhu had fought the entire regiment with his iron fists. The three of them were no match for him. They didn’t expect that he would lose to the female instructor.","Before the female instructor went on stage, the deputy commander specially reminded them to wait and see. It was obvious that they were suspicious of the female soldier instructor’s ability.","In the end, they didn’t have the right to act depending on the situation. Only the female instructor did!","Instantly, the three instructors felt their faces burning.","The close combat had already reached a high point. Both parties kicked out so hard that their bodies bumped against each other. The company commander took a few steps back like a drunkard.","The female instructor’s reaction made all the soldiers cheer.","She didn’t retreat. She flipped over lightly and knelt on one knee like a tiger. She placed one hand on her bent knee and the other on the ground.","During the fight, the training cap that Ye Jian was wearing fell to the side. Her hair was short, and there was sweat on her face. Her exquisite eyes were as cold as a sword. She was clearly beautiful, but her beauty was completely ignored. It was suppressed by the viciousness in her black eyes.","Everyone, including Commissar Tang, shifted their gaze from Ye Jian to Company Commander Zhu, who was panting heavily.","Company Commander Zhu... was going to lose!"]},{"number":4854,"title":"Chapter 4854: Blind","paragraphs":["They didn’t communicate, but the same thought flashed past all their minds.","Xia Jinyuan said coldly, \"Countdown.\"","Entering the countdown meant the end was near.","The three instructors clenched their fists tightly and broke out in a cold sweat for the company commander.","They could tell that the female soldier, Instructor Ye, was very capable. They believed that Company Commander Zhu, who was fighting, could tell too. If he really lost to the female instructor, he would feel a little embarrassed. However, with Instructor Ye’s capabilities, there was nothing embarrassing about it.","It ended very quickly. Company Commander Zhu’s iron fists couldn’t do anything to Ye Jian, who was from the special forces. His wrist was tightly restrained by Ye Jian. Her fist hit Company Commander Zhu’s armpit fiercely. With a low shout, Ye Jian twisted the iron palm in her hand toward Company Commander Zhu’s back.","When she twisted his arm back, the pain made Company Commander Zhu’s expression change. Large drops of sweat dripped down.","He didn’t give up resisting. He used his other hand to hit Ye Jian and hooked his leg tightly around Ye Jian’s left calf.","\"Good!! Good!! Instructor Ye, all the best! Company Commander, all the best!\"","The exchange was really exciting. The soldiers watching couldn’t help but clap and cheer again.","The company commander praised Ye Jian’s ferocity.","Neither of them tripped the other immediately. Although Ye Jian’s left calf was hooked by Company Commander Zhu, whose back was bent because of her pressure, her slender legs seemed to be rooted to the ground. No matter how Company Commander Zhu hooked her legs, they didn’t move.","Ye Jian blocked the iron fist of Company Commander Zhu’s with another hand. With a sharp look in her eyes, Ye Jian used her elbow to hit Company Commander Zhu’s neck. If it were a real killing scene, Ye Jian would’ve used her elbow to hit the enemy’s head.","After all, it was a competition. They could employ winning strategies, but they could not disable their opponents.","Therefore, every time Ye Jian attacked, she avoided the fatal points, which were the weak points that would hinder one’s mobility and increase one’s sense of pain.","Before Company Commander Zhu could exclaim in his heart, his vision turned black. He lost the strength in his arm. Ye Jian seized the opportunity and pressed down on Company Commander Zhu’s leg with one leg, hitting it hard in the knee.","The instructors of the three companies heard Captain Xia smiling and saying, \"It’s over.\" Company Commander Zhu, who was not tall and had muscles as hard as rocks, was knocked down by the female soldier.","The impact of falling was huge. Company Commander Zhu, who fell to the ground, made dust rise all around him. He was like a huge mountain that had collapsed. Even when he fell, his aura was majestic.","The main reason was that Ye Jian’s aura was majestic when she knocked down the company commander. The soldiers watching couldn’t help but shiver.","The female instructor was amazing!","She looked thin and weak. Her arms and neck were so thin that they could grab them with one hand. They didn’t expect her body to contain so much strength.","Before they went on stage, they were skeptical about the female instructor’s ability. After she went on stage, they cheered for Instructor Ye the entire time.","As it turned out, female soldiers could be so powerful too!","\"Company Commander! Company Commander!\"","\"Instructor Ye, Instructor Ye!\"","The applause was louder and fiercer than before. The applause came wave after wave. Most of them were cheering for the female soldier, Instructor Ye.","The military unit was a place that advocated the strong. The strong would be recognized by the soldiers faster.","Company Commander Zhu, who was covered in yellow dust, choked on it and coughed as he got up.","He patted the dust off his hands. He didn’t feel embarrassed because he lost. Instead, he laughed. \"Instructor Ye, I need to apologize to you. I used to think that you were average. I was blind! I sincerely apologize to you. Please forgive me.\""]},{"number":4855,"title":"Chapter 4855: Enough","paragraphs":["He was frank and took the initiative to apologize for his contempt in the past. He was a great man!","Ye Jian raised her arms that were hurting slightly. She smiled and said, \"Company Commander Zhu, your iron fists are impressive. It’s all thanks to Commissar Tang’s reminder. If not, I would’ve suffered greatly under your iron fists.\"","It seemed like an ordinary sentence, but it actually spared the company commander’s reputation.","As the company commander, there were more than a hundred soldiers below him. He had to retain his reputation.","Company Commander Zhu was a straightforward person. If he lost, he lost. There was no excuse to speak of. \"No matter how powerful my iron fists are, they can’t be compared to your fist techniques. You’re really impressive!\"","\"Commissar Tang reminded me that since you were sent to be the instructor of the female soldiers, you must have something special about you. He told me not to judge people by their looks. As for me, although I didn’t have any objections, I still secretly harbored some. I was afraid that you were a delicate military school student who couldn’t take hardships and couldn’t do anything big.","\"Commissar Tang was so angry that he glared at me. He pointed at my nose and reprimanded me. He said that I would definitely suffer in your hands as I was asking for trouble.\"","Picking up the training jacket that he had taken off, Company Commander Zhu, who admitted that he had lost, also won the applause of the soldiers.","After putting on his clothes, the company commander smiled at the other four male soldiers and said, \"Come, come, come. The four of you can line up and get beaten up. I was the first to test the danger. Now that I’ve done just that, I’ll leave. As for the four of you, do as you see fit.\"","Who would do it?!","Forget it!","The four male soldiers rejected in their hearts. However, they were men. They would not admit defeat just because the female soldier, Instructor Ye, was strong.","Even if he was beaten black and blue, he had to do it!","Charge!","The male soldiers were prepared to be beaten up. They went on stage bravely with an expression that said that they would endure it. Company Commander Zhu wiped his sweat away and walked to Xia Jinyuan’s side. He sighed and said, \"Captain Xia, did you hide it from me? On account of being beaten up, can you tell me the truth?\"","The company commander felt even more ashamed now. It was only right for him to lose. There was nothing to be embarrassed about.","\"She’s a female soldier from the special forces, and she’s your soldier. Even you, the captain, have suffered in her hands before. Captain Xia, if you had told me earlier, I wouldn’t have asked for trouble!\"","Captain Xia smiled at Company Commander Zhu, whose face was covered in sweat. He didn’t say anything.","The company commander narrowed his eyes and let out a long hum. He understood!","The company commander, who understood, felt bitter. \"Captain Xia, I thought you were a kind person. I didn’t expect you to dig a deep pit for me and wait for me to jump.\"","\"Company Commander Zhu, I didn’t expect you to go on stage personally either.\"","\"I didn’t expect instructor Ye to be the same kind of person as you.\"","\"If not, why would the military send her over? Sometimes, the training of a female soldier is even more tiring than that of a male soldier. It takes more effort.\" Xia Jinyuan smiled as he looked at the figure sparring with the male soldiers. His gaze was focused, and he didn’t spare a glance for others.","Company Commander Zhu, who had hit a wall, finally recognized the truth.","Commissar Tang wasn’t on the sports ground. He didn’t even see the exciting scene of Ye Jian knocking down Company Commander Zhu. The clerk came to tell him that the officer who was in charge of receiving the female soldiers into the barracks had called, so Commissar Tang went back to the office to answer the call.","When he came out after answering the call, Ye Jian was already fighting three people at the same time. When he knew that Company Commander Zhu had been knocked down by Ye Jian, Commissar Tang gloated and felt that it was a pity that he didn’t see Company Commander Zhu make a fool of himself."]},{"number":4856,"title":"Chapter 4856: Happy","paragraphs":["Commissar Tang specially walked up to Company Commander Zhu and said a few sarcastic words. It made Company Commander Zhu so angry that he was out of breath. He asked why the political commissar was so petty.","Commissar Tang laughed and said, \"The humiliation of 14 years has been washed away. I’m just so happy!\"","Facing the political commissar who made fun of him from time to time, Company Commander Zhu, who was only a lieutenant, could only pinch his nose and admit it.","His military rank was low. He had to admit it even if he didn’t want to.","Commissar Tang felt that after this lesson, Company Commander Zhu wouldn’t dare to underestimate female soldiers anymore. Even after the 20 female soldiers arrived, Company Commander Zhu wouldn’t dare to underestimate them.","As for the company commanders of the first and second companies , they wouldn’t make the same mistake.","At this moment, the female soldiers had been on the move for more than two hours. If everything went smoothly, they would be able to reach before two in the afternoon. Ye Jian was having a good fight with the male soldiers. The female soldiers who came to the camp were also chatting enthusiastically in the trucks.","This was the first time the female soldiers from all over the world came to the Northwest. They were first attracted by the magnificent scenery that was engraved with the vicissitudes of time. In the beginning, they would exclaim from time to time.","After sitting for more than two hours, the scenery was still the same. They felt a little bored now. After some self-introductions, they started to have some topics to talk about.","First, they talked about their former military units. Then, they talked about why they came to the Northwest for no reason.","After chatting, everyone realized that they were all supposed to go to the Nanguang Military District. For some reason, they came to the northwest.","\"A transfer is impossible. We’ll be northwestern female soldiers in the future. It’ll be even harder to go home than before.\"","\"That’s right. I don’t even dare to tell my family. I’m afraid that they’ll worry.\"","\"I’m from Nanguang. I’m getting farther and farther away from Nanguang.\"","\"I’m from Yun Province. It’s farther away.\"","\"I’m a northerner from the Desert River. Who’s farther away than me?\"","\"I’m from the north too. I can see North Korea from the mountain.\" This was the woman who came recently. She came from the northernmost part of the country and then went to the northwest.","Six to seven hours of driving was enough for the female soldiers in the same truck to get to know each other. They were all from different military units and had been informed to come to the northwest at the last minute. In addition, they were all female soldiers who had passed the selection. They had many common topics to talk about. Some of them felt like old friends at first sight, while others were only polite.","At around 2:00 pm, the sun shone on the yellow sand until it was covered with a layer of faint white light. The 20 female soldiers, whose hips hurt from the bumpy journey, finally arrived at the camp.","The sentinel checked the identification documents of the soldiers and officers of the trucks. He then let them in.","At 2:15 pm, the female soldiers alighted and formed a group. Then, the soldiers from the camp led them into the camp on foot. The person receiving the female soldiers was a squad leader from the male soldiers’ class.","Facing the 20 female soldiers, the squad leader maintained a serious expression and brought the female soldiers to a three-story dormitory building. He first arranged the rooms for the 20 female soldiers.","The conditions were limited, so each form would sleep five people. There would be a total of four rooms.","He also told the female soldiers that their instructor had been waiting for a long time. They would return to the dormitory to rest first. The instructor might come to the dormitory to look for them directly or they might gather immediately.","After he finished speaking, the squad leader looked at the 20 female soldiers meaningfully. It was 2:20 pm now. There were still ten minutes before the afternoon exercise. It was up to them if they wanted to gather.","Until now, the 20 female soldiers didn’t know if the instructor training them was male or female. They didn’t ask either. They subconsciously thought that it was a male instructor.","The bugle sounded. The 20 female soldiers reacted quickly. They didn’t need to be reminded and ran out as quickly as possible.","They were all female soldiers. It was a conditioned reflex for them to gather when they heard the bugle. They didn’t turn a deaf ear despite the change in the environment."]},{"number":4857,"title":"Chapter 4857: Confidence","paragraphs":["The female soldiers who had been selected weren’t just for show. In the past, they were able to compete with the male soldiers in their military units. Their skills, speed, and reaction speed were all quite good. If not, they wouldn’t have been selected.","Even if the officer told them that they could rest after entering the camp and wait for the instructor to appear, they wouldn’t be able to ignore the obedience that had been planted in their bones and souls.","The female soldiers from the five dorm rooms rushed out of the dormitory as soon as the bugle sounded. They packed up and set off.","Even Gao Xiao and Qiu Tong, who didn’t like each other, didn’t make things difficult for each other when they heard the bugle. They ran out of the dormitory at the same time.","No one asked where they were gathering, nor did they ask if anyone would appear later. The 20 female soldiers, who were already used to obeying, moved agilely and ran with the male soldiers.","At first, the male soldiers in the camp didn’t notice the female soldiers immediately. Who would run while observing who was running around them?","No one paid attention, so no one noticed.","However, Ye Jian noticed it.","When she came out of the political commissar’s office and returned to the dormitory building, she saw several female soldiers who obviously stood out from the male soldiers. They were slender and ran with the male soldiers.","From the time the bugle sounded to the moment she saw the female soldiers, it had only been ten seconds.","\"Captain Xia, I’m more confident in them than before.\" Ye Jian saw several slender figures running out. She smiled and said to the man beside her, \"Half a year! Although time is a little tight, I think I can train them well.\"","She couldn’t stay in the northwest for a long time, and she couldn’t always lead the female soldiers. Hence, she could only lead the female soldiers for half a year. From then on, she would embark on the path of becoming a female special forces soldier.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t notice the female soldiers immediately. He only noticed them after Ye Jian raised her hand and pointed at them. He took a look and retracted his gaze calmly. \"If they’re smart, you’ll be much more relaxed. From what I can see now, their military qualities are not bad. However, we can’t confirm it immediately. Time will tell. Whether they’re good or bad still needs to be verified.\"","In his eyes, no matter how powerful a female soldier was, she couldn’t be as powerful as the female soldier in front of him.","Ye Jian glanced at him and said with a faint smile, \"Captain Xia, do you not have confidence in me?\"","She seemed to have misunderstood!","His desire to live made Lieutenant Colonel Xia immediately explain seriously, \"I always take the attitude of a bystander to things that I’m not responsible for. I’m just saying that you’ll know whether they’re good or bad after training them.","\"I’m very confident in you. I don’t know them, so I don’t have much confidence in them. But I believe that they’ll definitely improve under your training!\"","Ye Jian nodded in satisfaction. \"That’s more like it.\"","Seeing that all the female soldiers had run out and were running toward the direction where the male soldiers gathered, Ye Jian said, \"I wanted to go to the dorm rooms to familiarize myself with them, but that won’t do now. They’re all there. As their instructor, I have to go too.\"","Xia Jinyuan agreed, but he smiled and asked, \"Do you know where they’ll gather?\"","\"I’ll definitely know if I run with them, right?\" Ye Jian glanced at Xia Jinyuan, who wanted to see her make a fool of herself. She tapped her head. \"Captain Xia, I make sure to train my brain every day.\""]},{"number":4858,"title":"Chapter 4858: Military Quality","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan couldn’t help but laugh. He had an extremely handsome face. His bright smile was like the setting sun on the horizon. It had a charm that made people’s gaze linger on it.","Ye Jian quickly looked away. \"You can cross the sports ground. I’ll leave first.\"","Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who didn’t know that he had unintentionally blinded his girlfriend with lust, reminded her again, \"Remember everything I said before. Since there are a few troublesome people in the class and also those with military ranks, you can’t underestimate them just because they look young. You must establish your might immediately!\"","Xia Jinyuan was still worried that Ye Jian wouldn’t be able to establish her dominance.","It wasn’t that Xia Jinyuan was thinking too much, and it wasn’t that he didn’t have confidence in Ye Jian. It was all because he had suffered before. The Xueyu unit’s first impression of him was that he was a pretty boy. Although he only used a week to subdue them, he still couldn’t accept it.","He didn’t want Ye Jian, who had been working hard and had stepped on many thorns on this journey, to encounter the same problems. That was why he kept reminding her.","Among the 20 female soldiers, besides the high-ranking soldiers and the sergeants who had served for more than three years, there were also female soldiers with the military ranks of first lieutenant and second lieutenant.","Gao Xiao and Qiu Tong were lieutenants. The two of them belonged to the same military unit. Their personal grudges happened in the same military unit.","Remembering Xia Jinyuan’s advice, Ye Jian took a shortcut and ran to the sports ground at her fastest speed.","The northwest was vast and sparsely populated. Naturally, the camp was very big. The gathering point of the male soldiers in the three companies was not bad either.","It depended on where the female soldiers would choose to gather.","The 20 female soldiers didn’t know the gathering point, so they didn’t run too far apart. Three minutes was enough for them to discuss quickly. In the end, they agreed that they would run to the largest training ground and the emptiest spot.","As for whether the instructor would find them or not, it was not within their consideration.","She didn’t appear immediately and didn’t tell them where to gather. This was her negligence as their instructor.","The female soldiers had always been more active than the male soldiers. They had many thoughts and were naturally calculative. Moreover, they were a little angry about coming to the northwest. They more or less had some personal emotions.","However, they were a group of qualified soldiers with good military qualities who would definitely obey orders. Even if they brought some personal emotions into it, they wouldn’t cause trouble.","Ye Jian didn’t think too much about it. Instead, she was very satisfied with the female soldiers’ reactions.","Looking at the direction the female soldiers ran in, Ye Jian knew that they were going to the sports ground. The sports ground in the afternoon was Captain Xia’s home ground. He had to choose a group of elites from the field. There wouldn’t be many people, only 20 male soldiers.","In the words of the company commander, there weren’t too many of them. It was just enough to accompany the female soldiers for practice.","It was impossible for Xia Jinyuan to train with the 500 soldiers in the camp every day, so he chose 20 elites.","However, the company commander couldn’t make the decision on this matter. Although the political commissar agreed, he couldn’t make the decision either. They had to wait for the battalion commanders to come back.","Commissar Tang said that it wouldn’t be a problem. They would choose first and wait for the battalion commanders to come back before making a decision.","Hence, the 500 soldiers gathered at the sports ground in the afternoon. And within a day, 20 elites were selected.","The three companies’ deputy companies had already recommended candidates. There were more than 20 elites. To be fair, the soldiers had to fight among themselves and the winner would make it to the ranks."]},{"number":4859,"title":"Chapter 4859: Panic","paragraphs":["Three minutes later, besides the sentinels and patrolling soldiers, the soldiers from the cooking team were already lined up.","When the 20 female soldiers saw this, they immediately stood at the leftmost position and lined up with the male soldiers.","When the male soldiers lining up on the left saw this, their bodies tensed up slightly. Their backs straightened, and their expressions became more serious. They stared straight ahead without blinking, not daring to look at their sides at all.","Why were the female soldiers standing beside them?","Why were they standing so close to each other?","Why didn’t they rest? Why did they go out with them?","’Instructor Ye, why aren’t you taking your soldiers away?’","The male soldiers were quite nervous. If Company Commander Zhu knew about this, he would definitely kick them and call them ’cowards’.","The soldiers of the second company were lined up on the left. When the deputy commander of the second company realized that there was suddenly an extra line beside his soldiers, he almost cursed on the spot.","He thought that his soldiers were muddle-headed and his heart skipped a few beats.","The deputy commander of the second company quickly ran to Company Commander Zhu to report this matter.","When the company commander heard this, he waved his hand and said disapprovingly, \"Then let them watch. With instructor Ye watching over them, they won’t be able to do anything.\"","Instructor Ye knocked down five male soldiers in a row. Company Commander Zhu respected her!","That was right. Ye Jian had a glorious image in the company commander’s heart!","The deputy commander of the second company got anxious. \"But they can’t stand beside my company! Have them change locations!\"","\"Why do they need to change? If it’s not the left, it’s the right. They’ve already chosen the left. Why do they need to change?\" The company commander’s expression darkened.","Why did they have to change? The deputy commander couldn’t explain it. Anyway, it just didn’t feel good!","It was impossible to change, especially since the company commander respected Instructor Ye. It was even more impossible for him to agree to the second company’s unreasonable request.","What else could the deputy commander of the second company do? There was nothing he could do!","He went back to his company and walked past the line of soldiers who were as straight as birch trees. \"Today is the selection of people. Our soldiers will all go on stage later. Don’t embarrass me!","\"Do you see the female soldiers at the side? They’re not simple. They’re all soldiers chosen by their original military units. Don’t let the female soldiers look down on you! Be careful! Whoever embarrasses me has to be mentally prepared!\"","This was the first time a group of female soldiers came to the camp. It wasn’t only the company commander who felt as though he was facing a powerful enemy, even the male soldiers felt the same way.","The female soldiers were calmer than the male soldiers. They were used to being watched in the military unit. Now that they were here, they were just being watched in a different place. There was nothing to be afraid of.","It was just that the sun was exceptionally bright. It was so hot that it hurt.","Although the temperature in the northwest in September was low, the sun was shining brightly because of the high sea level. Although the temperature was low, the sun was a big threat.","Once they reached a shady place, it was especially comfortable.","The female soldiers who were facing the sun had the valiant and heroic bearing of a female soldier. They were like a green scenery in the desert, refreshing.","Commissar Tang smiled and said to Xia Jinyuan, \"It looks like we have to consider taking in more female soldiers in the future. Female soldiers are not worse than male soldiers. Instructor Ye is the best example.\"","Who said that women were inferior to men? When women were powerful, they were definitely fighter jets!","Xia Jinyuan smiled and said, \"In the future, when the policy is relaxed, there’ll definitely be more and more female soldiers. The requirements for female soldiers are high now, and the situation is problematic. Only when things develop slowly in the future will there be more female soldiers in the military unit.\"","There were very few female soldiers everywhere. Sometimes, there were only a few female soldiers in a city or a county. Sometimes, these slots might not even land in the hands of the commoners. The local armed forces would allocate the slots directly."]},{"number":4860,"title":"Chapter 4860: Status","paragraphs":["Perhaps thinking of something, the smile on Commissar Tang’s face disappeared a little. Then, he sighed softly. \"Situational and policy issues account for the majority, but local issues also exist.","\"This is the reason why Company Commander Zhu doesn’t have much hope for female soldiers.\"","There were some things that Commissar Tang couldn’t say directly. He could only gloss over them.","Xia Jinyuan understood why Commissar Tang was sighing.","\"At that time, I strongly opposed Ye Jian leading a female soldier class.\" His calm words let Commissar Tang know that he understood the reason for his sigh.","The two of them looked at each other and smiled. They didn’t continue chatting.","Female soldiers these days all had certain connections and were backed by their families.","It was good that everyone understood in their hearts, so they didn’t say it out loud. Sometimes, they had to pretend to be unaware.","The topic turned to the selection of 20 elite male soldiers. The battalion commander who went to the base was about to return.","Mr. Fu, who left the camp in the morning and had returned to the base, was chatting with the battalion commander who was preparing to return to the camp. He also mentioned his daughter, Ye Jian.","The battalion commander’s surname was Tian. He had known Mr. Fu for ten years. Although one was a lieutenant colonel and the other was a major general, the two of them had been good friends for many years. Naturally, the battalion commander had some understanding of his good friend’s personal situation.","Until he got into the car, Battalion Commander Tian hadn’t realized that his good friend had a biological daughter. His biological daughter was the instructor of the female soldier class who was transferred to his camp.","Damn it!","This huge piece of news almost choked him to death!","In order to see Ye Jian as soon as possible, Battalion Commander Tian jumped into the car and urged the automobile soldiers to drive faster. Company Commander Sun, who came with him, jumped in fright and thought that something big had happened in the camp. He hurriedly asked what was wrong.","\"For various reasons, I haven’t publicized the fact that I’ve acknowledged my biological daughter. Old Tian, I’m only telling you today because my daughter is in your camp and you’re a fierce person. I’m worried that my daughter will be scolded by you, so I can only tell you in advance. The only people in the base who know are the service staff who went out with me.\"","Thus, Battalion commander Tian didn’t tell Company Commander Sun that he was rushing back to meet his friend’s daughter who appeared out of nowhere and almost shocked him to death. He only replied that the female soldiers were there and that they should return to the military unit as soon as possible.","Not many people in the camp thought highly of the female soldiers’ arrival. Company Commander Sun, who was born and raised in the northwest, said in a low voice, \"If we go back early, I’ll have to discipline the male soldiers in the company.\"","They wouldn’t make a mistake. At most, they would sneak a few glances at the female soldiers when they came over.","Ye Jian, the person that Battalion Commander Tian had been thinking about, was standing at the back of the line of female soldiers. Every time she walked past a female soldier, she would size them up and recall their names.","She had seen the roster and the personal information of the 20 female soldiers. She had already memorized their names and photos. She was just matching their faces now. There was no other meaning.","When she walked past Gao Xiao and Qiu Tong, Ye Jian didn’t walk past them directly. Instead, she paused for a few seconds before walking away.","The female soldiers were already wondering why a lieutenant walked past them.","They couldn’t see her badge from the corners of their eyes. They only saw her armband and epaulet. They didn’t know if she was a civilian. No female soldier thought that the lieutenant who walked past them was their instructor.","This was a female soldier who looked slender and delicate but was many times more ruthless than male soldiers. She was also an instructor that they remembered clearly even after retiring."]},{"number":4861,"title":"Chapter 4861: Not A Simple Person","paragraphs":["Although the female soldiers didn’t know the identity and position of the lieutenant who passed through them, they were all smart people. Since she was able to walk freely in their line, she must have a certain status. Even though they were muttering in their hearts, they didn’t size her up directly. They allowed the lieutenant to pass by them. They looked ahead and stood tall. They weren’t inferior to the male soldiers at all.","The scenery of the desert was very simple. Everything in sight was yellow. Even the ground under their feet was yellow. A group of beautiful female soldiers in their prime stood in the training ground. They became the most beautiful scenery in the entire camp.","The company commander took a few glances and whispered to Xia Jinyuan, \"Do you think they can all persevere? Does Instructor Ye have any experience leading a team? They’re all full of energy. None of them are easy to deal with. I’m afraid Instructor Ye will suffer in their hands.","\"You have to keep a close eye on them when the time comes. If you find anyone dishonest, warn them directly. You have to teach them a lesson.\"","The company commander didn’t take it to heart that he lost to Ye Jian. Instead, he thought of taking care of Ye Jian.","Xia Jinyuan looked in the direction of the female soldiers and saw Ye Jian at first glance. He could feel her calmness even from a certain distance. It was obvious that she wasn’t flustered despite it being her first time leading a team.","\"With Instructor Ye’s ability, she should be able to handle it. If she can’t even subdue the company soldiers, she might as well give up his position as soon as possible. She shouldn’t delay the female soldiers’ training progress. If that’s the case, we have to report to the military for a replacement.\"","Xia Jinyuan was not joking.","If he realized that Ye Jian couldn’t make the female soldiers obey her orders, he wouldn’t pursue the female soldiers. Instead, he would pursue the instructor for failing to meet her responsibility.","If she couldn’t even lead the soldiers properly, that meant she was useless!","Why keep an incompetent person?","No matter how much Xia Jinyuan loved Ye Jian, he was loyal to the country and wouldn’t cover up for her.","Company Commander Zhu was so frightened by the coldness in Xia Jinyuan’s tone that his eyelids twitched a few times. \"You’re really not biased. You can even do such a thing.\"","\"Of course. A personal relationship is a personal relationship. I can’t turn a blind eye because of the depth of our personal relationship. I need to be strict with the soldiers.","\"I dare say that I’m sure Instructor Ye doesn’t need much help. The female soldiers will obey her orders. Even if she needs my help, it should just be a matter of the difficulty of the training.\"","Xia Jinyuan had always been confident in Ye Jian.","Seeing that he was so sure, the company commander’s eyes flickered slightly. He asked casually, \"Do you and Instructor Ye already know each other? It looks like you have a good relationship.\"","\"Yes, the elders of our families know each other.\"","Hearing this, Company Commander Zhu was enlightened.","No wonder he understood Instructor Ye so well!","He almost misunderstood.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t want to discuss his relationship with Ye Jian. He knew that Company Commander Zhu wasn’t as simple and rash as he looked.","He changed the topic to the camp and asked when the battalion commander would be returning to the camp.","The company commander replied, \"At around 4:00 pm or 5:00 pm. He’ll definitely come back to the camp to chat with you. Don’t worry, he looks like a fierce man, but he’s a good person.\"","He didn’t pay attention to Ye Jian anymore. He naturally talked about Battalion Commander Tian.","Ye Jian, who walked from the female soldier at the very back to the front of the line, turned around. Her cold face was facing the female soldiers who were as tall as any male soldier.","Her gaze swept past the serious faces of the female soldiers. There was a very faint smile on that stunning face. It was like a gorgeous flower wrapped in crystalline ice crystals in the vast snow. It attracted people’s attention instantly."]},{"number":4862,"title":"Chapter 4862: Appearance","paragraphs":["The female soldiers standing at the front could see Ye Jian’s face clearly. They couldn’t help but gasp.","This lieutenant’s face was too good-looking. Her facial features were like a painting. No, no painting could be so vibrant.","The sun shone brightly in the northwest, and the ultraviolet rays were so strong that one’s skin would turn red. Why was this lieutenant, who was so good-looking that even women were stunned by her, still so fair and tender? Under the sunlight, it felt like she was wrapped around a soft halo.","This didn’t make sense!","Did she just come here like them?","That wasn’t right. From her actions, she didn’t look like she had just arrived.","Before Ye Jian could speak, the female soldiers below were all guessing. She didn’t introduce herself either. Next was Xia Jinyuan’s selection. She couldn’t steal the limelight.","The female soldiers sized up her, and Ye Jian looked back at them. Her gaze was sharp and cold. It was a warning.","She wasn’t warning them because she was being sized up. It was because Commissar Tang was talking and the female soldiers were distracted.","Gao Xiao was caught off guard by Ye Jian’s gaze. Ye Jian’s sharp gaze swept past her until her heart trembled violently. In an instant, she didn’t dare to be distracted anymore.","Despite being obedient, they complained in their hearts. They wanted to know who the lieutenant with the scary gaze was.","There were two second lieutenants and a first lieutenant among the female soldiers. The first lieutenant was in the second platoon in her original military unit. The two second lieutenants were outstanding soldiers who graduated from school this year. The three of them were more experienced, so they were the three female soldiers who were the most wary of Ye Jian’s identity.","They were female soldiers, and the lieutenant standing in front of them was a female soldier too. It was very likely... that she was the instructor in charge of training. As this thought flashed past their minds, the three of them looked forward and didn’t dare to size up Ye Jian.","Ye Jian only retracted her gaze after catching three female soldiers.","The three female soldiers who were caught by her still had lingering fear. They didn’t expect to be caught by the lieutenant after taking a few glances. It was so fast that they didn’t even have time to retract their gaze.","No one dared to size up Ye Jian anymore. In addition, Ye Jian had been standing in front of the line. The female soldiers vaguely guessed something, so they didn’t dare to act rashly.","Ye Jian, who had her back facing them, naturally felt that they were no longer sizing her up from the corner of her eyes. Her dark eyes, which were as clear as water, calmly looked at Commissar Tang, who was talking in front of her. Even though Xia Jinyuan was standing in front and she only needed to move her gaze slightly to see him, Ye Jian didn’t look over at all.","The selection of the 20 male soldiers started very quickly. After Commissar Tang finished speaking, Xia Jinyuan, as the instructor, stood at the front.","His handsome appearance amazed the female soldiers. This lieutenant colonel’s skin was fair and handsome. They couldn’t tell that he wasn’t a soldier from the northwest.","When he wore the military uniform, he looked like a soldier. When he changed out of the military uniform, he looked noble. He was so handsome that there were no flaws in his facial features.","Gao Xiao sneered and glanced at Qiu Tong, who was standing on her left.","She wondered if the lieutenant colonel had a girlfriend. Heh, it didn’t matter if he did. If a woman like Qiu Tong had her eyes on him, even if he had a girlfriend, she would pester him until they broke up.","It had happened before.","She glanced at Qiu Tong from the corner of her eyes. Seeing that Qiu Tong’s expression was normal, she sneered again.","’Keep on pretending, then! Let’s see how long this can last!’","Qiu Tong knew that Gao Xiao, who was on her right, was staring at her coldly. She frowned subtly and moved her lips, muttering, \"Are you looking for death?\""]},{"number":4863,"title":"Chapter 4863: Accept The Challenge","paragraphs":["\"Scram!\" Gao Xiao replied with a smile. She didn’t dare to be distracted anymore.","The other female soldiers didn’t move. They looked at the instructor in front of them.","Only the eight female soldiers in front knew what the instructor looked like. The female soldiers behind only heard his voice and didn’t see him.","The capable male soldiers from the three companies who wanted to fight for the 20 slots had already formed a line and walked to the front. There were 46 of them in total. They were all powerful male soldiers in the company.","Nine of them were the male soldiers who challenged Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian in the morning and lost.","If nothing went wrong, the nine of them would definitely be selected.","Xia Jinyuan had fought with five of them before and was quite satisfied with their stamina. Ye Jian was also quite satisfied with the stamina of the other four male soldiers. She felt that they had a high chance of becoming one of the 20 elites.","However, Xia Jinyuan’s selection requirements were strict. Not only did he want good combat skills, but he also wanted them to pass in comprehensive physical fitness. Hence, his selection was equivalent to a fitness competition. Besides the obstacle course, there were other competitions as well. Company Commander Zhu said to Commissar Tang privately, \"The special forces are indeed different. If he stays for a few more years, the overall standard of our entire battalion will definitely be raised a few levels.\"","Commissar Tang laughed at the company commander for being too greedy.","Captain Xia came very suddenly. The regiment didn’t receive any news about it at all. When they found out, it had already been confirmed that he would come to their guard company. It was even more sudden than setting up a female combat team in the northwest.","It was necessary for a female combat team to be established. This was also the trend. Captain Xia came here to give their guard company some training, but it felt like there was something else going on.","As for what the secret was, they didn’t manage to come up with anything even after speculating about it.","The 46 male soldiers lined up and stepped out. Suddenly, the company commander opened his mouth and said, \"Instructor Ye, do you want to compete with us?\"","His question was so sudden that Commissar Tang was stunned for a moment. He reacted quickly and said even more eloquently, \"Company Commander, you just lost in the morning. Are you looking for trouble now?\"","Ye Jian didn’t agree immediately. She turned and faced the female soldiers. Her gaze slid past their faces. She smiled and said, \"Let me introduce myself. I’m your instructor, Ye Jian. Nice to meet you.\"","The female soldiers were more or less surprised when her identity was revealed.","She was really their instructor. She was young and beautiful. She looked like... an ordinary instructor.","\"It’s my first day in the camp. I haven’t familiarized myself with the environment, but I’ve already been issued a challenge. Do you have the confidence to compete with the male soldiers? If you do, I’ll accept the challenge immediately. One person can’t represent our female soldier class. We’ll only accept the challenge if everyone agrees. Do you agree?\"","Under the influence of Xia Jinyuan, Ye Jian, who had the aura of a soldier, didn’t lose her aura even when she smiled.","She left the choice of whether to compete or not to the female soldiers. The female soldiers looked at the male soldiers in front of them and wanted to agree. However, the main point was... their instructor said everyone had to agree before they could accept the challenge.","\"I’ll count to three. Answer after three.\"","Ye Jian glanced at the female soldiers one by one. Just as she shouted ’three’, 21 voices shouted in unison.","\"Yes!\"","Although their voices were not as loud as the male soldiers, they were still sonorous and full of fighting spirit.","Ye Jian smiled and said to Company Commander Zhu, \"Company Commander Zhu, we accept the challenge.\"","The company commander laughed and said, \"Women are not inferior to men. Instructor Ye, your soldiers are very confident.\" He waved his hand and asked the male soldiers in a deep voice, \"What about you? Do you have the confidence?\""]},{"number":4864,"title":"Chapter 4864: One Against Five","paragraphs":["\"Yes!\" Yes! \"Yes!\"","Their voices were as loud as the morning bugle as they resounded through the training ground. It was astonishing.","\"Okay!\" The company commander was very satisfied with the aura of the male soldiers. At this moment, the more imposing his soldiers were, the happier he was.","They couldn’t give in just because the other party were female soldiers. The sparring during training was also a battle. How could they give in?","Because of Ye Jian, Company Commander Zhu completely put away his contempt for the female soldiers. He didn’t dare to instruct the male soldiers to act according to the situation like in the morning.","The male soldiers were fierce, but the female soldiers didn’t have stage fright.","Ye Jian said to the female soldiers, \"Let’s teach them a lesson and let them know how powerful we female soldiers are.\"","As soon as she finished speaking, a female soldier asked, \"Instructor Ye, what about you? Are you competing with the male soldiers? I hope that you can lead the way so that we can get familiar with each other.\"","After she finished speaking, Ye Jian saw several female soldiers nodding in agreement.","Since Ye Jian needed to establish her dominance, she naturally couldn’t miss out on this.","She nodded and said calmly, \"Of course. I need to understand you, so you naturally need to understand me. After understanding each other, you can adjust your mentality and face the next training.\"","The cold voice was like an invisible physical wall that pressed toward the 20 female soldiers. The majestic military might it carried made the 20 female soldiers’ hearts turn cold. Even their expressions became more restrained.","\"Let me remind you, I only like to win. I don’t like to lose. There’s no second place in the military unit. There’ll only be first place. Do you understand?\"","The female soldiers straightened their backs and raised their heads. They replied in unison, \"Understood!\"","The male soldiers were elated. The three companies in the camp often competed. Even if it was a tug-of-war, a victor had to be decided. The losing party’s battalion commander would scold the company commander, the company commander would scold the deputy commander, the deputy commander would scold the platoon leader, the platoon leader would scold the squad leader, and the squad leader would scold the soldiers.","If they lost to the female soldiers today, they would probably be beaten up instead of scolded.","There was no need for others to do anything. They would be so ashamed that they would beat themselves up.","Seeing that the female soldiers were confident, the company commander said to Xia Jinyuan, \"Captain Xia, if we lose, you don’t have to be polite. Just teach us a lesson!\"","If the male soldiers lost to the female soldiers, the battalion commanders would be so angry they would spit out blood.","Xia Jinyuan thought for a moment and replied uncertainly, \"The female soldiers have been selected. Their comprehensive military qualities are very strong. The male soldiers might not be able to gain an upper hand. The odds of winning is 50%.\"","Hearing this, Company Commander Zhu’s heart skipped a beat. \"It can’t be. Do you have so little confidence in the male soldiers in our battalion? Captain Xia, the ten of us did lose to you and Instructor Ye this morning, but our situation is different. You and Instructor Ye are from the special forces. One is equivalent to five!\"","\"It’s not that I don’t have confidence. It’s just that I haven’t seen the strength of the female soldiers. How can I be sure? What if there’s another female soldier like Instructor Ye?\" Xia Jinyuan pointed at the female soldiers, his expression a little serious. \"You heard the female soldiers’ answers just now. They weren’t short of breath even when asked to compete with male soldiers. It can be seen that they were famous in their original military units. If not, they wouldn’t have had the confidence to answer.\"","The company commander was silent for a moment before saying in a low voice, \"I have confidence in the soldiers in our camp!\"","Xia Jinyuan smiled and said, \"I’m confident that the male soldiers will win too. And Instructor Ye is also confident that the female soldiers will win. It depends on who wins and who loses.\""]},{"number":4865,"title":"Chapter 4865: Take Them Down","paragraphs":["The battle between male soldiers was already exciting enough. Now that the male soldiers would be fighting the female soldiers, their fighting spirit was completely stimulated. Everyone would fight with their lives on the line.","Before Battalion Commander Tian could get out of the car, he heard a roar that shook the ground from the direction of the training ground. The car stopped, and Battalion Commander Tian quickly jumped out of the car. The door closed with a bang and went over to ask the sentinel.","It was 5:00 pm, and the sentinel had just changed shifts. He knew everything that was happening on the training ground. He raised his gun and tried his best to control his excited expression as he reported everything clearly.","Battalion Commander Tian was dumbfounded.","After Instructor Ye from the female soldier class defeated Company Commander Zhu in the morning, she knocked down four male soldiers consecutively. Battalion commander Tian couldn’t help but cover his face when he heard this. He was flustered!","Then, he heard that the new instructor, Xia Jinyuan, wanted to choose 20 male soldiers for training. Coincidentally, the female soldiers were here too. The company commander of the third company suggested competing with the female soldiers. In the end...","When Battalion Commander Tian heard about it, it hurt even more!","The soldiers under Instructor Ye included two second lieutenants and one first lieutenant. The moment they went on stage, they would be sure to take the male soldiers down a notch. As for Instructor Ye, all the obstacles were nothing to her.","The sentinel was honest. He answered whatever Battalion Commander Tian asked. His answers were very detailed. He told Battalion Commander Tian everything.","At the mention of Ye Jian, who beat up a group of male soldiers the moment she stepped up, the sentinel’s eyes lit up. Battalion Commander Tian was so upset that he wanted to slap the sentinel’s head.","Which company was this idiot from?","He had to be from Zhu Ganggang’s company!","Like company commander, like soldier.","Didn’t this idiot see that his heart was so suffocated that he was about to have a heart attack? He kept saying how powerful the female soldiers were and how powerful Instructor Ye Jian was.","He was boosting other people’s morale and destroying their own prestige!","Thinking about the scene at that time, the sentinel was still very excited.","At this moment, everyone was enthusiastic. The male soldiers clapped until their palms turned red. As for the female soldiers, they kept shouting, \"Instructor Ye, crush them! Instructor Ye, crush them!\"","Male soldiers usually shouted ’beat them’. When they heard the female soldiers shouting like this, the group of men blushed for some reason.","As for Ye Jian and her female soldiers, they didn’t notice anything amiss.","Battalion Commander Tian’s cheeks twitched when he heard that. He gritted his teeth. His words were filled with killing intent. \"Zhu Ganggang, if I don’t skin you alive, my surname won’t be Tian!\"","The sentinel’s truthful report was filled with things like ’the company commander said this’ and ’the company commander did that’. Of course, Battalion Commander Tian would have to go looking for Company Commander Zhu!","Not only did he lose, but he also dragged the soldiers into the water!","It was fine if he was dragged down, but he should at least win!","In the end, he lost!","Battalion Commander Tian, who was about to explode on the spot, placed his hands on his hips and panted heavily as he circled back and forth on the spot. Then, he raised one hand and turned his body toward the training ground. Company Commander Sun, who had a bad feeling, said, \"Go, go. Tell Zhu Ganggang to get over here!","\"Isn’t it embarrassing? Does he still have the face to stay on the sports ground? Go, ask him to get over here!\""]},{"number":4866,"title":"Chapter 4866: Hooligan","paragraphs":["The sentinel blinked. He realized why the battalion commander was angry. He was afraid that he would implicate Company Commander Zhu, so he quickly explained, \"Instructor Ye is from the special forces. The new instructor, Xia Jinyuan, said that the soldiers in their special forces unit have suffered in her hands. She can even take down three special forces soldiers.","\"No special forces soldier in the entire special forces unit can beat her in marksmanship. She’s a sharpshooter. Any gun seems to come alive in her hands. She’ll hit wherever she looks.","\"If you go over now, you should be able to catch up with the vertical shooting competition between the female and male soldiers. It’s not over yet. Instructor Ye shouldn’t have gone on yet.\"","Battalion Commander Tian didn’t know much about Ye Jian’s background either. He only knew that the military sent someone who had just graduated from the military school and had three third-class honors and two second-class honors. After graduating, she was directly given the rank of lieutenant. She didn’t need to go through the military unit for an internship.","She definitely had the ability, but... He didn’t expect her to be a special forces soldier.","Battalion Commander Tian, who had just returned to the camp, was puzzled.","Didn’t she just graduate?","How did she become a special forces soldier again?","As a special forces soldier, she was able to defeat other male soldiers from the special forces. It was not in vain that Zhu Ganggang lost to her.","Battalion Commander Tian’s expression finally improved. He didn’t stay any longer. Afraid that there wouldn’t be enough time, he hurriedly jumped into the car and shouted for Company Commander Sun to get in.","After getting into the car, Battalion Commander Tian slapped his thigh. He was angry just now and forgot that Instructor Ye from the female soldier class was the daughter of his friend! She was the reason why he rushed back!","\"Drive faster!\" After instructing the soldier to accelerate, Battalion Commander Tian couldn’t hold it in anymore. He was even more anxious to see Ye Jian.","At this moment, the 20 male soldiers who were selected had all completed the vertical shooting. They released the safety on their guns. The last male soldier who completed the direct shooting stood beside Xia Jinyuan. \"Report, completed the vertical shooting!\"","Xia Jinyuan looked at the stopwatch time. It took a total of 16 minutes for 20 male soldiers to complete the vertical shooting. That meant that every soldier took less than a minute to complete the shooting.","Their results were not very good, but they were not bad.","Seeing that the female soldiers were ready, Xia Jinyuan went over. Ye Jian was standing at the side and holding a stopwatch. He smiled and said, \"16 minutes. The results aren’t bad. Do you feel pressured?\"","\"16 minutes and 9 seconds. Even if we beat you for one second, we will still win.\" Ye Jian wouldn’t admit defeat. The female soldiers in the previous competitions had both won and lost, which made her more confident in the 20 female soldiers.","Xia Jinyuan liked Ye Jian’s unyielding spirit. Every time he saw it, he found it interesting. \"Sure, I’ll wait for you to beat me!\"","After he finished speaking, Xia Jinyuan seemed to have thought of something. He lowered his deep voice and said, \"In the future, just say ’beat them.’ Don’t say that ’crush them.’ It will cause misunderstandings.\"","Misunderstanding? What kind of misunderstanding?","Ye Jian looked at him in confusion.","Xia Jinyuan cleared his throat and said a few more words in a low voice. Ye Jian’s face turned red. She glared at him and moved her footsteps to distance herself from him.","Hooligan!","Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who was called a hooligan through her gaze, felt helpless. He had kindly reminded her. How did she become a hooligan?","His words were rough, but his logic was not.","\"Ready...\"","As the company whistle blew, Ye Jian raised her head and looked up without blinking. She gave a thumbs-up to the female soldier who was shooting at the first vertical drop.","The female soldier, who was ready, gave her instructor a thumbs-up calmly."]},{"number":4867,"title":"Chapter 4867: Who Is Afraid Of Who","paragraphs":["\"Begin!\"","The deputy commander lowered his hand. The female soldier pulled the rope tightly and quickly buckled the safety catch. She turned her back to the outside and faced the wall. She squatted slightly with her hips and kicked her feet. Her entire body started sliding down quickly.","Since it was a vertical shooting, she had to shoot during the slide down. Moreover, the number of shooting targets would be different. The first round of shooting might be on the fifth floor, the next round might be on the fourth floor, or they would need to complete the shooting as soon as they slid.","This depended on one’s reaction speed and agility.","Bang... Bang... Bang... The female soldier holding the pistol completed her target shooting as she slid down. After landing, Ye Jian looked at the time. Fortunately, it didn’t take more than a minute.","The male soldiers watching below held their breaths. The female soldiers were indeed very strong.","The company commander took off his clothes for training out of habit. He raised his hand and touched the back of his head. The female soldiers who were selected were indeed different. They completely broke his opinion of the female soldiers.","The female soldiers didn’t just answer phone calls and write documents. When confronted with powerful female soldiers, the male soldiers would blush with shame.","The first female soldier came down and followed the second female soldier down. Third, fourth... Although some female soldiers were delayed due to the shooting, everything went smoothly. There were no mistakes.","When Battalion Commander Tian arrived, no one noticed him. When he saw the female soldiers landing from the sky one after another and shooting nimbly, most of the anger in Battalion Commander Tian’s heart dissipated.","Commissar Tang, who brought him over, smiled and asked, \"How is it? Satisfied? If Zhu Ganggang hadn’t asked the female soldiers to compete, I wouldn’t have known that they were so powerful.","\"After Instructor Ye leaves, they will definitely be able to carry the heavy responsibility given to them.\"","\"Do you mean that Zhu Zhongguo did it on purpose?\" Battalion Commander Tian asked without looking away. \"Why do I feel that he’s the one who caused all this?\"","Zhu Zhongguo was the company commander’s real name.","\"He did it on purpose. He wanted to understand the strength of the female soldiers in advance so that he could have a better understanding of them. After all, these female soldiers are all his soldiers now. As the company commander, how could he not understand them?\"","That was true. Zhu Zhongguo looked rash, but he knew what he was doing. Sometimes, when he tried to get information out of people, he would look naive and stupid. But if one was not careful, one would fall into his trap.","However, the new Lieutenant Colonel Xia was a smart person. No matter how Zhu Zhongguo tried to get information out of him, Xia Jinyuan never fell for it.","The anger in Battalion Commander Tian’s heart dissipated completely. He narrowed his eyes and said slowly, \"Zhu Zhongguo’s plan is good. Once the female instructor leaves, he’ll be able to take over as the company commander based on his understanding of the female soldiers. There won’t be a transition period.","\"You suggested it back then because Zhu Zhongguo was the most suitable among the three companies, right?\"","Commissar Tang smiled. \"If he weren’t suitable, as a battalion commander, you wouldn’t have agreed to it either, right?\"","The two old partners smiled at each other. It was fine as long as everyone understood.","\"Who’s Instructor Ye? Point her out to me.\" The anger in Battalion Commander Tian’s heart had already disappeared. Instead, he felt more at ease. Battalion Commander Tian, who had placed the female soldiers in the company commander’s camp, had some free time. He looked over and could only see the soldiers’ backs. He couldn’t see who his good friend’s daughter was.","Commissar Tang told his old partner, \"The person with Zhu Zhongguo is Lieutenant Xia. One meter away from him is Lieutenant Ye. Both of them are very young. In the morning, the two of them defeated ten soldiers of our battalion, including Zhu Zhongguo. The younger generation will surpass us.\""]},{"number":4868,"title":"Chapter 4868: Provocation From Her Boyfriend","paragraphs":["\"Will she join in?\" Battalion Commander Tian asked again. \"I really want to see the skills of a female special forces soldier.\"","He wanted to see how powerful his good friend’s biological daughter was and if she resembled her father.","\"Of course. She’s the new instructor. The soldiers below her are so powerful. As their instructor, if she doesn’t show her skills, the female soldiers won’t listen to her.\"","\"That’s right. It’ll almost be her turn. There are only three female soldiers in front.\"","There were still three female soldiers who hadn’t finished. Battalion Commander Tian was staring at them without blinking.","Xia Jinyuan walked to Ye Jian, who was standing aside and scolding him with her gaze. He said in a low voice, \"This is just a reminder. Battalion Commander Tian is watching from behind.","\"Don’t turn around. The company commander said that Battalion Commander Tian likes to observe secretly. Just let him watch.\"","Ye Jian glanced at him. \"You shouldn’t have told me, then. At least I wouldn’t feel burdened.\"","Xia Jinyuan gave a meaningful smile. Didn’t she see that he did it on purpose?","Ye Jian snorted softly. Of course, she could tell!","Other boyfriends would try their best to protect their girlfriends. As for her boyfriend, he would try his best to let her protect him.","Her position was special. She couldn’t hide under his wings and be protected.","Xia Jinyuan smiled again. This time, his eyes were filled with gentleness.","Ye Jian quickly looked away. Her ears were red. \"Mind your actions. Don’t stare at me.\"","\"No one saw it.\" Xia Jinyuan laughed softly. He saw that even his girlfriend’s ears were red. They were so delicate that they looked almost transparent. He curled his fingers and felt his hands itching.","It was better to stay away. That way, he could control himself.","\"14 minutes and 19 seconds. Instructor Ye, are you sure you can beat us?\" Xia Jinyuan took two steps back and smiled. He was teasing Ye Jian.","Other people’s boyfriends coaxed their girlfriends, but Lieutenant Colonel Xia was unparalleled in the world. He specialized in going against his girlfriend.","As his girlfriend, Ye Jian had her own personality too. She didn’t alienate him because of this. Instead, she became braver. She would return his provocations.","The two of them broke the inherent love and affection between them and would climb to the peak hand in hand.","\"Let’s wait and see, Captain Xia!\" After saying that, Ye Jian stuffed the stopwatch in her hand into his hand and climbed the vertical ladder with the last female soldier.","The hand ladders were vertical and formed a ’U’ shape. They climbed while holding the rungs tightly. Those who were afraid of heights would feel their legs turning weak just by looking at them.","As for the soldiers who were training, not only did they need to climb up bare-handed, but they also needed to be fast enough.","The female soldiers were the same.","The female soldier in front of Ye Jian was a lieutenant who was promoted from an outstanding soldier. She was a fearless woman. She said, \"Instructor, I’ll try my best to climb as fast as possible.\" Then, she climbed up like a monkey.","Ye Jian was amused when she saw this and followed closely behind.","Halfway through the climb, the lieutenant even turned her head to take a look. She realized that her instructor was just a step away from her. She pursed her lips and revealed a faint smile. Her actions became faster.","As she climbed, she told Ye Jian, \"I’m from Xiang Province. My hometown is filled with mountains and trees. When I was young, I loved to climb trees. I could climb trees that were more than ten meters tall. My parents teased me for resembling a monkey.\"","Ye Jian felt more at ease. \"The male soldiers took 16 minutes and 19 seconds. Before I left, we were at 14 minutes and 19 seconds. Yang Zhen, whether we can beat the male soldiers or not depends on us.\"","Yang Zhen had the military rank of first lieutenant. She used to be a paratrooper in the army, but she had never really parachuted before. That was why she entered the northwest."]},{"number":4869,"title":"Chapter 4869: Instant Kill","paragraphs":["She remembered what Ye Jian said. After she climbed up, she descended at the fastest speed. She was the female soldier who descended the fastest among the 19 female soldiers. From the moment she kicked her legs and descended, everyone’s eyes lit up, including Xia Jinyuan’s.","She was fast and stable. Her shooting speed was also extremely fast. The entire process was extremely fast. She was obviously better than the 19 female soldiers in front.","Ye Jian’s eyes were brighter than anyone else’s. What agility and speed!","The female soldiers who were selected were indeed different. No wonder Commander Xia said that there would be a surprise waiting for her.","Wasn’t this a surprise?","After completing the vertical shooting, Yang Zhen half-knelt on the ground and retracted the rope. On the other side, Battalion Commander Tian kept cheering.","The company commander seemed to have just realized that the battalion commander was back. He pretended to be startled and widened his eyes. \"Battalion Commander, when did you return to the camp? Why didn’t you make any sound? I was so frightened when you suddenly opened your mouth.\"","It was so obvious that he was pretending, but Battalion Commander Tian didn’t want to expose him. \"You’re so busy. How could I disturb you? Did your soul fly away from fright?\"","\"Battalion Commander, I’m a materialist. Don’t spread feudal superstitions. When the political commissar hears this, he’ll nag you again.\"","Battalion Commander Tian sneered. \"Ha, I have to thank you for your reminder.\"","\"You’re welcome. You’re a battalion commander. It’s what I should do.\" Company Commander Zhu chuckled. How silly!","\"Stop pretending!\" Battalion Commander Tian raised his leg and kicked him. \"If you continue pretending, I’ll have you go back to your hometown!\"","\"It’s been 15 minutes and 47 seconds.\" The moment Commissar Tang opened his mouth, the battalion commander and company commander stopped talking.","Ye Jian only had 21 seconds.","21 seconds. The company commander clenched his fists tightly. Would it work? Would it work?","Battalion Commander Tian and Commissar Tang kept an eye on her too. Twenty-one seconds... Could she really do it?","The fastest soldier in the camp needed 38 seconds to complete the descent!","The main thing was shooting. If there was no shooting, she could complete it in 20 seconds.","Xia Jinyuan glanced at the screen. The color in his deep and dark eyes deepened. There were still 21 seconds left... ’Come on, Azure Bird, you can do it!’","At the most crucial moment, the surrounding soldiers didn’t dare to disturb them anymore. Yang Zhen silently cheered Ye Jian on.","The female soldiers were even more nervous. They raised their heads and stared at their instructor.","Ye Jian fastened the safety lock. After taking a deep breath, she kicked her slender legs. The people below were dumbfounded and cursed.","She held the pistol with one hand and pulled the rope tightly with the other. Her speed was like a free fall. She descended and fired.","When she was descending, only her shadow could be seen. Only when she stopped firing could she be seen. There were a total of four shots. If one were to allocate three seconds for shooting time, it would take 12 seconds to complete. With the descent time, it would be more than 20 seconds.","Everyone was sweating because of Ye Jian’s speed. They were worried that she would fall. Only Xia Jinyuan’s handsome face was calm. There was even a faint smile on his thin lips.","They were worried that Ye Jian would fall because she was too anxious. In Xia Jinyuan’s eyes, he saw his comrade, Azure Bird.","He knew that she could do it.","With unlimited potential, she could definitely do it.","Swoosh!","The shadow quickly slid down until it suddenly stopped. Ye Jian’s figure finally materialized. She placed her feet firmly on the ground and retracted her pistol handsomely. Then, she half-kneeled and retracted the rope. Xia Jinyuan and Commissar Tang pressed the stopwatch at the same time.","The female soldiers took 16 minutes and seven seconds!"]},{"number":4870,"title":"Chapter 4870: Are You Fine?","paragraphs":["The air was a little quiet. Ye Jian, who was so quiet that she retracted the rope and was about to leave, stood rooted to the ground. She glanced at the soldiers who were staring at her silently, then at Xia Jinyuan, who had been standing at the same spot.","She blinked, and it was so quiet that it was frightening. She needed Captain Xia’s help.","Xia Jinyuan smiled as he looked over. This time, he didn’t speak immediately. He just smiled and looked over with pride in his eyes.","He was proud of her wonderful performance!","The pearl that was covered in dust had already begun to shine. The hardships she had gone through had become achievements that could let her shine brightly. She had put in so much effort, and it was finally time for her to shine.","He had always known that his woman would eventually shine brightly. Now, wherever she was, there would definitely be legends about her!","\"I’m proud of you.\" Xia Jinyuan’s thin lips moved slightly.","Ye Jian didn’t hear his voice, but she understood what he said from reading his lips.","Her smile was like a bright crescent moon that parted the clouds. The smile in Xia Jinyuan’s eyes deepened.","The two of them interacted silently. On the other side, Commissar Tang stared at the stopwatch with widened eyes. He shook the stopwatch in his hand in disbelief. Was it broken?","16 minutes and 7 seconds. The female soldiers used a total of 16 minutes and 7 seconds!","They were two seconds faster than the male soldiers!","When did Ye Jian jump?","She only jumped after 15 minutes and 51 seconds!","In other words, she took a total of... 16 seconds to land!","She completed the shooting in 16 seconds and landed vertically!","How was that possible?!","The excited battalion commander didn’t notice the change in Commissar Tang’s expression. He asked eagerly, \"How was it? Did they win or lose? How long did she take? Do you remember?\"","After asking repeatedly, he realized that Commissar Tang didn’t hear him at all. He was in a rare daze as he held the stopwatch and didn’t move like a wooden man.","\"What’s wrong?\"","Unable to hide his excitement, Battalion Commander Tian reached out and took the stopwatch. Commissar Tang came back to his senses and handed it over.","The stopwatch showed that the time was 16 minutes and 7 seconds. Battalion Commander Tian stared at it for a few seconds before saying to the political commissar, \"The female soldiers won. The male soldiers lost.\"","At this moment, there was no need to confirm it. The female soldiers won.","\"Yes, the female soldiers won. Instructor Ye used 16 seconds to complete the vertical shooting landing. The fastest soldier in my battalion... completed it in 38 seconds.\"","Political Commissar Tang was too shocked. He swallowed his saliva and said, \"Sixteen seconds. Old Tian, I didn’t see wrongly. She’s 22 seconds faster than the soldiers in my battalion! It’s more than double.\"","Battalion Commander Tian widened his eyes. He didn’t dare to believe it either. \"Who else recorded the time? Show me the stopwatch!\"","He knew that she was fast. He could tell from the speed of her descent. He couldn’t believe it when he saw how fast she was.","\"Yes, the new instructor, Captain Xia, has a stopwatch. Zhu Zhongguo is beside him.\" Commissar Tang didn’t believe it either. Hence, he strode forward with Battalion Commander Tian.","In front, when the company commander heard the number Xia Jinyuan reported to him in a low voice, he was shocked. Then, he widened his eyes and took the stopwatch from Xia Jinyuan’s hand. When he looked at it, his hands trembled.","It was true!","Sixteen minutes and seven seconds, two seconds faster than the male soldiers.","The 18 female soldiers completed the vertical shooting and landed. There was obviously not enough time. In the end, the first lieutenant from the army paratroopers appeared and shortened the time. Then, Instructor Ye appeared right on the heels of that. It was even more amazing... It twisted the outcome of the battle!","Eyes wide, Company Commander Zhu lowered his voice and asked, \"Brother, is your stopwatch broken?\""]},{"number":4871,"title":"Chapter 4871: Idiot","paragraphs":["Sixteen minutes and seven seconds!","Two seconds faster than the male soldiers!","They turned the male soldiers’ victory into a loss!","Company Commander Zhu couldn’t accept it for a while.","\"It’s not broken. I’m sure.\" Xia Jinyuan smiled. \"The applause is enough to show how outstanding she is.\"","Thunderous applause sounded. The soldiers who lost and the surrounding soldiers applauded for the female soldiers.","Xia Jinyuan continued to ’attack’ the company commander with his words. \"Instructor Ye used 16 seconds. Among all the soldiers, she used the shortest time. Also, I’m sure that her shooting accuracy is 100%.\"","Company Commander Zhu’s sturdy body swayed after being ’attacked’ consecutively. His blood pressure soared. \"The fastest time our soldier took to complete the descent is 38 seconds!\"","So? Xia Jinyuan raised his eyebrows and remained silent.","Company Commander Zhu, who was being stared at, raised his hand and slapped his forehead heavily. \"I must’ve been crazy today!\"","As he spoke, he suddenly glanced at Commissar Tang and Battalion Commander Tian who were striding over from the corner of his eyes. The company commander swallowed his saliva.","This was going to be huge!","He just wanted to know the background of the female soldiers and their instructor, Instructor Ye. Who knew that he would lose so badly?","At this moment, Battalion Commander Tian’s expression was a little distorted. He looked both happy and angry. Company Commander Zhu really wanted to escape. He was worried that he would be ’beaten up’ by the battalion commander.","The female soldiers, who were still in shock, heard the applause and came back to their senses. They clapped excitedly.","\"Instructor Ye looks young, but I didn’t expect her to be so amazing! She can do everything and suppress everyone in every class. She’s amazing! She’s even more amazing than the instructors in my original military unit.\"","\"The more powerful you are, the stricter your requirements are. We’re happy now, but we should prepare to suffer in the coming days.\"","\"I’m not afraid. Before I came, I was already prepared to suffer when I found out that I was transferred to the northwest!\"","\"My old regimental commander told me that we might become the first female special forces unit. The stricter the instructor, the better. We’ll be able to learn real skills.\"","\"Now, all my worries are gone!\"","\"What were you worried about?\"","\"Hehe, it’s nothing.\"","\"So, did we win or lose? They haven’t reported the time.\"","\"I suspect that we took about the same time. The main thing was that Yang Zhen and Instructor Ye shortened the time. I didn’t expect Yang Zhen to be so powerful too!\"","\"Lieutenant Yang Zhen was a paratrooper. These subjects are not difficult for her.\"","The female soldiers, who had similar personalities and got closer to each other over a day and a night, clapped and chatted secretly. They looked at Ye Jian with eyes so bright that they seemed to have light.","Although Gao Xiao was clapping, she would glance at Qiu Tong from time to time. When she saw Qiu Tong clapping hard, a cold smile appeared on her face.","Qiu Tong only knew how to pretend. Gao Xiao would see how long she could pretend for!","She didn’t believe that no one in the military unit would discover her hypocritical side!","Ye Jian, who didn’t see Battalion Commander Tian, returned to the female soldier class. The female soldiers who were clapping consciously put down their hands and organized their team as quickly as possible.","Before the training started, Ye Jian’s ability was enough to make them stop looking down on her and be afraid.","The first step to establishing her might was to let the soldiers below know how powerful she was. Only then would they be afraid.","As long as the first step was completed, the rest would be much smoother.","The female soldiers stopped clapping, and the male soldiers did the same. However, no one knew who won. They were still cheering and shocked by the female soldiers’ performance."]},{"number":4872,"title":"Chapter 4872: Can’t Be Afraid","paragraphs":["At the crucial moment of the final outcome, Yang Zhen’s rapid descent and nimble shooting made everyone’s eyes light up. The appearance of the instructor, Ye Jian, was shocking.","Yang Zhen was a paratrooper. Falling from a high altitude was one of her training programs. Although she had never officially jumped before, she had a good foundation and could complete it easily. Her reaction to other competition subjects was mediocre.","However, Ye Jian was different.","She was outstanding in every subject. As long as she appeared, she would definitely defeat everyone. Her journey was exciting and shocking.","Looking at the approaching battalion commander and political commissar, Xia Jinyuan raised his stopwatch and prepared to announce the final result.","He was the only one who could remain calm.","Battalion Commander Tian quickly opened his mouth to verify. \"How long did it take?\"","\"Report, the female soldiers won with 16 minutes and 7 seconds,\" Company Commander Zhu replied. Although he lost, he couldn’t lose to the point of cowardice! He still needed to have confidence!","Commissar Tang nodded. \"That’s right.\"","\"How long did Instructor Ye take?\" Battalion Commander Tian asked again.","This time, it was Xia Jinyuan’s turn to answer. \"Report, she took 16 seconds.\"","It was true!","Battalion Commander Tian glared at Company Commander Zhu and smiled at Xia Jinyuan. \"Announce the results and let them know the time difference!\"","\"Yes!\"","Facing the battalion commander with the rank of lieutenant colonel, Xia Jinyuan, who was also a lieutenant colonel, didn’t put himself in the same rank. Instead, he placed himself in a position far lower than that of the battalion commander.","No matter where he went, he had to follow the rules. The soldiers had their own rules. Even though he was a lieutenant colonel, he couldn’t ride on the neck of the battalion commander.","No matter how big or small a taboo was, Xia Jinyuan would never commit it.","Although Battalion Commander Tian didn’t have any thoughts, he smiled when he saw Xia Jinyuan’s military rank on his epaulet.","Old Tang was a good judge of character. This man didn’t kick up a fuss and just focused on getting things done.","He liked him!","Xia Jinyuan raised his stopwatch and announced the results under the anticipation of the male soldiers. \"The female soldiers took 16 minutes and 7 seconds. The female soldiers won. Instructor Ye Jian took 16 seconds to complete the vertical shooting descent.\"","In the end, the male soldiers’ expressions froze. When they heard Ye Jian’s time, they were stunned.","Sixteen seconds!","The vertical shooting was completed in 16 seconds!","Xia Jinyuan smiled and asked the 20 selected male soldiers, \"Did you not expect to lose?\"","The male soldiers’ faces tightened as they lowered their heads.","They lost?","They actually... lost?","They didn’t expect to lose. They thought... they would win, and they would win beautifully.","\"Don’t lower your heads. It’s a good thing that you lost today. Although it’s embarrassing, it’s a wake-up call for you. You’ll know how to catch up during the next training.\"","Xia Jinyuan could accept the result calmly.","The female soldiers were indeed very powerful. However, the male soldiers weren’t bad either. If Ye Jian and Yang Zhen hadn’t performed at the last moment, they would’ve used more than 17 minutes.","Yang Zhen was a specialist who came from a paratrooper background while the other specialized in the comprehensive development of female soldiers. It was not in vain for male soldiers to lose to female soldiers in this subject.","In addition, these female soldiers were outstanding in the military unit. The military was strict with them too. They would get rid of those people who just wanted to come in and collect military merits. Only the female soldiers who were truly capable would not lose to the male soldiers. It would be a joke if they lost in all the competition subjects.","Xia Jinyuan could see the crux of the matter and accept it. However, Company Commander Sun couldn’t accept it. He stood there expressionlessly. Although he didn’t say anything, his aura was terrifying.","The male soldiers lost again!","What pride? It was all gone!"]},{"number":4873,"title":"Chapter 4873: Want To Keep Her","paragraphs":["The three deputy commanders didn’t look good either. The 20 male soldiers came from three companies. They were all top figures in their respective companies. However, they were suppressed by the female soldiers. How could they maintain their dignity?","Even Battalion Commander Tian couldn’t maintain his dignity.","Although Battalion Commander Tian couldn’t maintain his dignity, at least these female soldiers were his soldiers from the moment they entered the camp. He felt a little better.","Moreover, losing once would allow the male soldiers to reflect on themselves. In the future, as the battalion commander, he would strengthen their training. He felt that although the male soldiers lost this time, they had learned their lesson. It was more meaningful.","Seeing that the soldiers were lowering their heads, Battalion Commander Tian said in a low voice, \"Losing isn’t a bad thing. It’ll let you see your shortcomings! In the future, the female soldiers will be your role models! This goes for all the male soldiers!\"","Losing wasn’t a bad thing, but there had to be punishment!","The 20 male soldiers quickly lined up. Battalion Commander Tian pointed outside the camp. \"Run five kilometers lightly! The company commanders will take the lead!\"","The company commanders included Company Commander Zhu, Company Commander Sun, and the three deputy commanders.","Since the company commanders and the deputy commanders were running, how could the platoon leaders and squad leaders below them not run?","Company Commander Zhu ran first. He would rather run five kilometers than stay and face the storm of the battalion commander. After running five kilometers, the anger in the battalion commander’s heart would dissipate a little. Company Commander Zhu would be much safer if he appeared then.","The male soldiers ran five kilometers while Ye Jian asked the female soldiers to disperse and rest. They would have exercise tomorrow morning.","In this short period of time, Ye Jian let Lieutenant Yang Zhen be the squad leader and the two second lieutenants be the deputy squad leaders.","The female soldiers dispersed and left in line. Ye Jian walked toward Battalion Commander Tian, who had been standing at the side and watching.","She stood still and saluted. \"Reporting, Battalion Commander. Female soldier instructor, Ye Jian, reporting!\"","Battalion Commander Tian immediately returned the salute. Then, he smiled and said, \"There’s no need to be so formal. Relax.\" As he spoke, he reached out his hand. \"I’m the battalion commander of the Vanguard Battalion, Tian Guozhi. I’ll need your help in the future!\"","As expected!","The first time they met, he was shocked!","When the results were out, Battalion Commander Tian was shocked by the bullet holes on the targets that Ye Jian shot. He turned his head and said to Commissar Tang, \"We should’ve shown them the target just now.\"","\"It’s already a blow enough. Let’s save it for the next time.\" Commissar Tang sighed and said to Ye Jian, \"What should I do, Little Ye? I want to keep you in the camp for a long time.\"","Xia Jinyuan’s heart skipped a beat. Ye Jian smiled and said, \"Political Commissar, you can only think about it. Don’t act on your thoughts. I’ll feel pressured.\"","In response, Battalion Commander Tian and Commissar Tang laughed heartily.","With Ye Jian’s performance in the past, Battalion Commander Tian valued her from the bottom of his heart. During their conversation, he strongly expressed that he had high hopes for this female combat team. He hoped that with Ye Jian’s lead, the first female combat team, which was only in its embryonic form, would be able to train into a powerful combat team and lay the foundation for becoming the female special forces.","Because there was only half a year left, the training time was quite tight. From the expressions of the female soldiers in today’s competition, Ye Jian rushed out a more targeted training arrangement overnight. From individuals to teams, she listed everyone’s advantages and disadvantages.","At 2:00 am, Ye Jian had listed the advantages and disadvantages of the 20 female soldiers. After formulating a targeted training, she brought the military plan and knocked on Xia Jinyuan’s dormitory door.","Xia Jinyuan, who was stretching, heard the knock on the door. A faint smile appeared on his handsome face that was illuminated by the desk lamp. He looked at the military portable computer that had not been turned off. Xia Jinyuan picked up the glass of water beside him and stood up."]},{"number":4874,"title":"Chapter 4874: Midnight","paragraphs":["The door opened. He lowered his gaze and saw the portable device in Ye Jian’s hand. The smile in his deep eyes deepened.","It seemed that she was doing the same job as him tonight.","Ye Jian was stunned by his speed of opening the door. \"You’re not asleep? Are you busy?\"","\"I wasn’t sleeping. I just came up with the male soldiers’ training plan.\" Xia Jinyuan turned his body and invited her in.","Ye Jian, who was wearing a sports short-sleeved shirt and shorts, walked in. She didn’t realize that the man who closed the door behind her had already glanced at her slender and straight legs.","\"I came up with the female soldiers’ training plan. I want you to take a look and see if there are any areas that need to be modified or if there’s anything wrong.\" As she spoke, Ye Jian saw the portable computer on the desk that had not been turned off. She smiled gently and turned to look at Xia Jinyuan. \"Are you also refining the male soldiers’ training plan?\"","Xia Jinyuan closed the door and locked it. He smiled and nodded. \"We only have half a year. We need to hurry.\"","Seeing that Ye Jian had carried over an empty glass, Xia Jinyuan picked up the hot water bottle in the corner and poured water into his glass.","Amidst the sound of water splashing, Xia Jinyuan’s eyes darkened when he saw her sitting on his single bed.","His little fox was really... unguarded even though they were alone in the middle of the night.","Beside the single seat was the desk. Ye Jian naturally chose to sit on the bed instead of the empty chair in front of the desk.","If she needed to change the content of the training later, she would definitely have to sit on a chair and do it.","That was all Ye Jian thought.","Xia Jinyuan placed the steaming cup in front of the desk and pushed it in front of Ye Jian. He looked at Ye Jian gently. \"Did you encounter any difficulties or uncertainties during the drafting process? Did you make any modifications?\"","He was standing and she was sitting. Ye Jian could only raise her head and reply, \"No, I observed their performance in the afternoon. At that time, I already had a plan in my heart. When I wrote it down at night, I just sorted it out a little. I didn’t have to make multiple revisions.\"","The range of the table lamp was limited. She could only vaguely see his face. Even so, she could still feel his blurry face staring at her with a burning gaze. His eyes were filled with love for her.","Ye Jian, who came with the intention of seeking help, suddenly felt a little unnatural. Her facial expression wasn’t as casual as before. She even looked at him evasively.","Why did she feel like... a sheep entering a tiger’s den?","A strange feeling flashed past her heart. The next moment, a warm and strong hand held her chin. Ye Jian, who was already a little flustered, leaned back instinctively.","She forgot that she was sitting on the bed. As she leaned back, she fell onto the bed naturally.","Realizing that her actions were wrong, she heard a low and pleasant laughter before she could correct them.","\"You want to lie on my bed? Are you sure?\"","He smiled and asked. Ye Jian’s face turned red.","She replied in a panic, \"What do you mean by lying on your bed? It’s all because you scared me.\"","\"When?\"","The man still held her chin with his fingers and rubbed his thumb gently. \"You came to look for me in the middle of the night just to ask about training. Didn’t you have other thoughts?\"","Ye Jian was speechless. \"What other thoughts could I have? Didn’t you say that I could look for you anytime if I had any difficulties?\"","\"At any time doesn’t include the middle of the night. Do you know that men’s bodies are usually the most relaxed in the middle of the night? Once an old boy like me relaxes, I can’t help but think about love. You chose the wrong time.\""]},{"number":4875,"title":"Chapter 4875: Serious Consequences","paragraphs":["Old boy!","Ye Jian, who was shy, wanted to laugh. Old boy, to think that he could say that.","Ye Jian, who had trained in front of him before, didn’t panic this time. Instead, she sighed and said, \"The time I chose is a little wrong. But you didn’t cherish the chance to end your life as an old virgin previously, so you can only wait.\"","She was saying that Xia Jinyuan had ruined his chances to end his life as an old virgin.","Listening to this, his handsome face froze. It was rare for him to be speechless. He remained silent for a few seconds before saying, \"Let bygones be bygones. There’s no need to mention it again. We should cherish the present.\"","Last time, he was completely unprepared. It was not that he did not cherish it!","At the mention of the embarrassing past, Ye Jian relaxed. The faint romance that would make the two of them lose control of their rationality disappeared instantly with the mention of the embarrassing past.","Ye Jian pointed at the portable computer she brought over and raised her eyebrows. \"I didn’t choose the right time tonight. I’ll pay attention in the future. Let’s take a look at my plan first. With you checking it over, I’ll feel at ease.\"","Xia Jinyuan’s heart ached. His reputation was ruined just like that!","He sat back in the chair and didn’t look at her immediately. He then faced Ye Jian and said seriously, \"You have to forget about that matter. You can’t mention it again. I’m afraid that if you mention it too much, I’ll have hidden illnesses, such as infertility. The consequences will be very serious!","\"This concerns our lifelong happiness. You must forget about it!\"","Ye Jian didn’t know what he was talking about for a moment. However, she knew that she had to go along with him now. She nodded seriously. \"Okay, I’ll remember it. For the sake of our happiness, I’ll definitely forget about it.\"","\"Alright.\" Xia Jinyuan took out a pen from his pen holder and used his serious expression to hide his sorrow. He held the pen and wrote the words ’sexual bliss’ on the notebook.","Ye Jian held her forehead. Her Captain Xia was full of nonsense.","\"Do you remember?\" he asked again.","Ye Jian nodded solemnly. \"I definitely won’t remember it!\" At the same time, she tore off the paper with the words ’sexual bliss’ and threw it into the trash can.","After receiving the promise, Xia Jinyuan sighed softly. Then, he said right on the heels of that, \"If you mention it again, you’ll be punished on the bed!\"","\"Let’s talk about work first.\" The corners of Ye Jian’s mouth twitched slightly. She was afraid that the topic would change again, so she quickly diverted. \"I promise you that I won’t mention anything in the future. If I really offend you, you can punish me however you want.\"","Xia Jinyuan nodded in satisfaction and looked at Ye Jian deeply. There was a smile in his dark eyes that Ye Jian didn’t notice.","In that case, he would talk about work first to prevent her from thinking about it.","\"I don’t plan to look at your training plan. You can look at my training plan first.\" He pushed his portable computer in front of Ye Jian and talked about work. The man, who was full of evil thoughts just now, restrained his expression and said in a low voice, \"You need to learn to walk alone. You can’t doubt your ability just because I’m not there to give my opinion.","\"The training plan can be changed after it’s formulated. You can adjust it at any time during training in the future. As long as you’re focused and can understand every soldier’s advantages and disadvantages, their overall standard will definitely improve through targeted training.","\"There’s no need to feel too pressured. Do your best.\"","Ye Jian listened to him humbly. In front of him, she was a complete novice. Every word he said was very useful to her."]},{"number":4876,"title":"Chapter 4876: Secret Kiss","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan’s deep voice came from the room. \"I can remind you not to take the wrong path, but I won’t interfere with your matters. Sometimes, even if I discover a problem, I won’t point it out.","\"If your growth is too smooth-sailing, it won’t allow you to improve. I hope you can be tempered and develop your own style of marching, fighting, and leading soldiers, instead of just using my style all the time.","\"Look at my plan first. After that, we can talk about what you need to improve.\"","As her boyfriend, Xia Jinyuan would never dote on Ye Jian regardless of the occasion. He wouldn’t treat Ye Jian like a canary.","He would bring Ye Jian along and overcome all obstacles. He would never use his powerful wings to protect Ye Jian on the path of the special forces.","He only hoped that Ye Jian could ride the wind and soar in the sky. He wanted her to live a wonderful life that belonged to her alone.","Ye Jian looked at him seriously. She wasn’t angry at Xia Jinyuan for standing by and doing nothing.","Xia Jinyuan, who wouldn’t be getting involved, picked up a book on military theory and read it while accompanying Ye Jian. He leaned over the desk alone and revised it seriously. He quietly accompanied her without disturbing her. Although there was no communication, there was a warmth that no one could disturb between them.","An hour later, Ye Jian raised her head from her portable computer. She stretched her stiff neck and looked up at the man who had been accompanying her.","At some point in time, he had raised his slender legs and placed them on the other corner of the desk. He was resting his head on the back of the chair. His face was covered by the book in his hand, revealing only his handsome chin that was illuminated by the light.","He was indeed tired today. He was even more tired than her. After chatting with Battalion Commander Tian in the morning, she went back to the dormitory to rest. He was busy until 9:00 pm.","He didn’t manage to rest after going back to the dorm either. He seized the time to rush out the 20 male soldiers’ training plan. He finally managed to do it, but she came to look for him again. He accompanied her until now and didn’t say anything about being tired.","Looking at Xia Jinyuan who had fallen asleep, Ye Jian’s gaze became gentler. It was rare for the two of them to be alone in a room with each other. Ye Jian, who felt warm because of his company, stood up. She couldn’t help but reach out her hand and gently take away the book that covered his handsome face.","She saw the handsome face that was completely enveloped by the light. His eyebrows were narrow, his nose bridge was handsome, and his thin lips were sexy. They were so exquisite that no flaws could be found.","The night was a time where it was easy to have evil thoughts. It was a time where one’s rationality would become chaotic. It was also a time where one would be tempted to commit sins.","The night was blurry and enchanting. It also made the air thin, making one’s heart beat faster and one’s blood boil. The calmest heart started beating faster because of the handsome face that made her flutter after looking at it for a long time.","Her heart... suddenly rippled.","His handsome face was like a catalyst. Besides messing up Ye Jian’s heart, it also made her blood flow faster.","The shadow that was cast on the snow-white wall slowly bent down. The two shadows got closer and closer until... the shadows overlapped.","Her warm and soft lips kissed Xia Jinyuan’s thin lips secretly. As soon as their lips touched, Xia Jinyuan, who was sleeping, suddenly opened his eyes...","Ye Jian, who was caught doing something bad, was shocked. She quickly sat back on the bed.","The light made things appear blurry, but Ye Jian could see the heat in his eyes. It was so hot that she couldn’t help but look away."]},{"number":4877,"title":"Chapter 4877: Come, Baby","paragraphs":["\"It’s not a dream...\"","Xia Jinyuan opened his mouth. His voice was a little hoarse. It was so low that Ye Jian panicked.","He reacted quickly and retracted his long legs from the desk. At the same time, his arm was already wrapped tightly around her waist.","Ye Jian grabbed the green bedsheet. The bedsheet was so flat that it looked like it had been ironed. It was wrinkled now. Ye Jian lowered her voice and pretended to be calm as she replied, \"It’s getting late. I-I... I’ll go back to my room and see if there’s anything I need to adjust. Rest early. Good night.\"","She finished speaking in one breath without even panting.","\"Did you secretly kiss me just now?\" Xia Jinyuan approached her with a burning gaze. Ye Jian subconsciously wanted to get up and leave. She was caught secretly kissing him. It was better for her to leave first!","Ye Jian panicked and wanted to escape. Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who was tempted by the secret kiss, wouldn’t let her go. He stood up quickly and pressed her shoulders with his warm hands. Then, he pressed her down forcefully so that Ye Jian could sit back on the bed.","He looked at her with his black eyes. There was a hint of evilness in his smirk. \"It’s too late.\"","\"You came and sat on my bed again. Your actions have caused me to misunderstand. I finally calmed down, but you secretly seduced me again. Honey, I’m burning up with desire now. I need you...\"","Ye Jian moved her body uneasily. She was embarrassed and flustered. She stammered, \"I... I still have to work.\" Her words were completely weak.","\"There’s no hurry. It’s our personal time now. We can do something more meaningful.","\"You’re not in a hurry, but I am. I need the training plan by dawn.\" Ye Jian, who felt guilty for seducing him, quickly raised her hand and pushed his hand away. She was stuttering the entire time. \"What meaningful thing are you talking about? You can do it alone. I... I still have to go back to work.\"","Work? Xia Jinyuan laughed until he made a low and deep sound. She had already secretly kissed him. Would he let her go back to work?","He didn’t want to be a gentleman now. Hence, why would he let her go back to work?","No, work was an excuse. She wanted to leave after teasing him.","He moved his hand away and rubbed his fingers lightly. He took a step forward and stepped on the bed. It was a rough action, but after he did it, one could only see the dominance of a man in him.","Was Ye Jian thinking of getting up? That was impossible.","She was trapped under him. Even the tip of her nose was filled with his refreshing smell. Ye Jian started to realize that danger was approaching her at high speed.","She took a deep breath and raised her hands slightly. Her palms were facing outward as she blocked the dangerous man. \"Captain Xia, calm down. Calm down. Mind the consequences.","\"Look, it’s already 2.30 am. We need to get up at 5 am tomorrow to exercise. We only have two and a half hours to sleep. I won’t disturb your work anymore. Tomorrow, we’ll find a quiet place and... Cough, we’ll have a good discussion about life, okay?\"","Discussing life in depth was the most explicit thing Ye Jian had ever said. The meaning was clear.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t have any thoughts about it. This was an important time for her. She probably wouldn’t even have much rest time in the next half a year. Exploring life in depth wasn’t something that could be solved in a day or two. He had already thought about it. In order to make up for the years of emptiness, he wouldn’t let her go for three days and three nights.","That was why he had to bear with her!","\"We’ll talk about the future later. Let’s finish today’s work today.\" The tall figure looming over her approached with an unstoppable momentum. This time, it was not her chin that was lifted up by his fingers but her face that was held up by his hands."]},{"number":4878,"title":"Chapter 4878: Serious Consequences","paragraphs":["Keep calm?","Impossible!","Mind the consequences?","Of course, he wouldn’t do anything too deep.","The sheep took the initiative to enter his den, and it was the middle of the night, so he would be sorry to himself if he didn’t do something.","Xia Jinyuan, who had an ulterior motive tonight, got a little excited. Blood rushed to his head, and the corners of his eyes turned red.","Just as Ye Jian realized that something might really happen next, a collision sound that was so loud that it made her teeth ache was heard. The hands that were holding her face suddenly retracted...","The anxious Lieutenant Colonel Xia had miscalculated the height. He forgot that although it was a single bed, it was actually a double-decker single bed. He leaned over, and before he could kiss his girlfriend’s lips, his forehead kissed the sturdy iron bed affectionately.","It was unknown if it was because his head was too strong, but the metal bed shook when he hit it.","The room was very quiet. Ye Jian endured it for a few seconds but couldn’t hold it in anymore. She didn’t need to be pushed onto the bed by Xia Jinyuan. She pounced on the bed and buried her face in the bed. She laughed until her shoulders trembled.","Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who was seeing stars, covered his forehead that was definitely red with his right hand and slapped himself with his left hand. It wasn’t hard, but there were only two people in the room. Even if it wasn’t hard, Ye Jian could hear the crisp sound of him slapping himself.","Without a doubt, Lieutenant Colonel Xia’s slap made Ye Jian laugh again. She laughed until her body was trembling.","Why did Captain Xia always fumble the ball at critical moments?","It was the same the last time and this time!","Hahaha! It wasn’t that she didn’t want to give it to him, but her Captain Xia was really unlucky. Could this be... the sorrow of an old boy?","Xia Jinyuan hated himself so much that he wanted to commit suicide.","He could say that he was unfamiliar the first time, but what about the second time? Could he still say the same?","He was unfamiliar the first time, but he should be familiar the second time!","He didn’t care anymore! He just wanted to do something meaningful!","Xia Jinyuan grabbed her with his long arm and pressed her hands down again. Ye Jian laid down properly. Her hands were locked above her head. Ye Jian stopped laughing. Her black eyes were filled with shyness as she dodged and looked at him. \"You can’t be too presumptuous.\"","She spoke in a low voice, which was equivalent to accepting his next actions.","Actually, there wasn’t much that they could do in the military dormitory, except touching and kissing... It was meaningful enough.","It was impossible for them to be impudent. Both of them had to restrain themselves.","They couldn’t leave hickeys yet, in case they were discovered.","The two black shadows on the wall kept intertwining. They were intertwined and didn’t know how much time had passed. Ye Jian hugged her lover who was buried in her chest tightly. He was breathing heavily. She closed her eyes and endured it with a dazed expression.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t dare to be impudent. His entire body was as hot as fire. After some time, Ye Jian, who was hugging him, felt his body suddenly tense up. The tenseness lasted for a while. She heard a long groan from his throat before his tense body slowly relaxed.","Ye Jian’s face was so red that it was burning. She hugged her portable computer tightly and fled. When she returned to her dormitory, the door closed softly. She quickly leaned against the door and breathed heavily. If one looked carefully, one could see that her calves were trembling.","They weren’t too presumptuous, but... she had already entered a new world. It was an adult world. She had only come into contact with it after two lifetimes.","Her face was red, her heart was beating fast, and her limbs were trembling and weak. The sequela was very serious!"]},{"number":4879,"title":"Chapter 4879: Don’t Mess Around","paragraphs":["Ye Jian leaned against the door for at least five minutes before moving. She was so embarrassed that her face was red. She didn’t turn on the lights. This time... she went overboard. From now on, she wouldn’t have any privacy in front of him.","She pounced on the bed and covered her head with the blanket. After a long time, shy sounds came from under the blanket. She only crawled out of the blanket when she felt that she was about to be suffocated.","In less than a minute, she covered her head with the blanket again. Ye Jian didn’t know what she wanted to do.","It had to be said that Mr. Fu’s reminder wasn’t unnecessary. Halfway through, Ye Jian was afraid that they would reach the last step. Even while she was in a daze, she didn’t forget to remind Xia Jinyuan, who kept ’playing tricks’ on her, to calm down.","Xia Jinyuan, who was so steady that it made her feel uncomfortable, used his unparalleled self-control. No matter how busy his hands were on Ye Jian, he didn’t take off his pants. Ye Jian’s pants also remained on,except for her shirt... which was lifted.","Ye Jian, who had guarded the last checkpoint, popped her head out of the stuffy and hot blanket again. In the pitch-black dormitory, she widened her eyes and raised her hand to pat her face lightly. She muttered to herself, \"It’s difficult to remain calm. In the future, I definitely won’t look for Captain Xia in the middle of the night.\"","After a while, she added, \"My timing tonight was really wrong. I mustn’t enter Captain Xia’s dormitory after midnight. Remember, I can’t get into trouble...\"","Ye Jian muttered a few sentences until she yawned before closing her eyes to sleep.","On the other hand, Xia Jinyuan finally had a taste of his woman. He was just one step away from the final step. He came out of the bathroom energetically with a pair of underwear and a pair of shorts in his hand.","After drying his pants, he whistled and returned to his room. He lay on the bed. Under the light, his handsome face was filled with satisfaction. His eyes were filled with satisfaction.","Xia Jinyuan covered himself with the blanket. There was a smile at the corner of his eyes as he closed his eyes. He laid on the bed and closed his eyes, thinking about the scene for at least five minutes. He only stopped thinking about it when he felt that he was about to get turned on again.","If he didn’t stop, he wouldn’t even be able to get a minute of sleep.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t dare to think about it anymore. He sat up with the blanket in his arms and looked around. He muttered to himself, \"I need to add a chair. The desk has to be moved. It can’t be near the bed. It’s too easy to get triggered if it’s near the bed. The door can’t be locked either. If the door is locked, something will happen. If anything needs to be discussed in the future, we can’t talk about it in the room. We can talk about it as we walk in the camp.\"","After thinking through the details and confirming that there was nothing else, he turned off the desk lamp and hugged the blanket that seemed to have the faint smell of orchids from Ye Jian’s body. He finally fell asleep.","There was no need to worry about oversleeping. As long as the bugle in the camp sounded, he would definitely be able to get up immediately.","Ye Jian had the same thought.","Outside the window, the silver moon hung in the sky.","At the campsite, there was not a blade of grass on the desert. The hills that revealed the light brown ground were like huge beasts crawling. They fell asleep along with the silence of the night.","Time ticked by, and the stars in the sky started to fade. Only a few of the brightest stars dotted the sky. Night was about to pass, and a new day was coming very quickly.","In the camp, the sentinels held their steel guns tightly and looked around like hawks until dawn broke.","At 5:00 am, before the sky lit up, the bugle in the camp sounded on time. The lights in the dark camp lit up almost at the same time. Ye Jian’s and Xia Jinyuan’s rooms were lit up too."]},{"number":4880,"title":"Chapter 4880: Establishing Power","paragraphs":["The two of them, who had only slept for about an hour, did not let the intimacy in the early morning affect their training today. Their sneaky playfulness only lasted for one night. After dawn, the two of them, who had stayed up almost the entire night, quickly devoted themselves to their training.","When they went to the sports ground, the two of them met and looked at each other. They nodded politely and chose to forget what happened in the early morning.","After Ye Jian woke up, she didn’t have the time to feel embarrassed about what happened in the early morning. The responsibility she carried was heavier than Xia Jinyuan’s. She couldn’t let her personal feelings affect her training.","In order to reassure the military, she looked at Xia Jinyuan’s plan last night and made some small adjustments to the original plan for the female soldiers. The overall direction remained the same, and the training became more difficult than the male soldiers’ training.","The female soldiers who had returned to their respective dormitories last night to discuss their instructor had already completed a three-kilometer run early in the morning. When they gathered, the squad leader, Yang Zhen, gave everyone a form. The female soldiers took the form and saw the contents clearly. Everyone was surprised.","The training listed sent chills down their spines.","Ye Jian looked at the female soldiers whose expressions changed when they received the form. She stood in front with a cold facial expression and said in a deep voice, \"I’ll complete all kinds of training like you, with warm-ups in the beginning and strengthening in the end. I don’t want to hear any complaints during the training or it’ll affect the enthusiasm of the entire group.\"","The moment she opened her mouth, a cold aura rushed over. She wasn’t as friendly as when she completed the competition with them last night. The female soldiers who discussed the instructor’s temper last night felt their hearts sink.","The papers in their hands were only a few thin pages, but at this moment, they weighed thousands of kilograms.","Their instructor... had a gentle temper, but she was definitely an instructor who was not easy to talk to and had strong principles.","Their mentality changed subtly again. Unknowingly, there was fear in their eyes.","Ye Jian’s cold gaze swept past the faces of the female soldiers. Her only experience in training came from the fourth-year training outside the school. Back then, she was facing a group of university students. Now, she was facing soldiers with heavy responsibilities. Naturally, she couldn’t be as easy to talk to as when she was training outside the school.","As an instructor, she mustn’t give the female soldiers the impression that she was easy to talk to.","Ye Jian, who saw the subtle changes on the female soldiers’ faces, took a deep breath. It was impossible for her not to feel nervous. She could only use a stern and cold voice to cover it up. \"I’m sure you already know why you’re here. Although the assigned place has changed, it’s just a new place. The main point is still the same.","\"Our country hasn’t established a female soldier special combat team yet. I hope that the establishment of this special combat team will start with you.","\"We only have half a year. Half a year later, the military will conduct an assessment of the group. If you pass the assessment, the team will be established. If you don’t, you’ll be incorporated into the Vanguard Battalion.","\"I’ve seen your resumes. You all have a common goal. Now, the military has given you a chance to achieve your goal. Whether you succeed or not depends on yourselves.","\"This training plan of mine is the cornerstone to help you achieve your common goal. I hope that you can cherish this opportunity and let the military see your results half a year later.\"","\"Now, tell me, do you have any questions about this training? Can you accept it?\"","After she finished speaking, Ye Jian didn’t wait for the female soldiers to answer. She suddenly called out a name. \"Gao Xiao, do you have any questions? Can you accept it?\""]},{"number":4881,"title":"Chapter 4881: A Rare Human Heart","paragraphs":["When Gao Xiao was suddenly called out, the person who reacted the most strongly was Qiu Tong, who was standing beside her.","Gao Xiao, who was called out, was frowning. She was staring at the dense black words on the paper with her head lowered. Her scalp was numb.","When she was suddenly called out, she immediately looked up at Ye Jian. After a few seconds of silence, she pursed her lips and said loudly, \"Instructor, you said that you’ll train with us. Is that true?\"","\"Of course,\" Ye Jian replied calmly. The coldness in her eyes made Gao Xiao want to shrink her neck. \"I repeat, I will train with you. Every word I say is not casually mentioned. You don’t have to doubt the authenticity of my words. I’ll do as I say.","\"Gao Xiao, do you accept it?\"","Gao Xiao looked at the training and gritted her teeth. \"I do!\"","\"What about you?\" Ye Jian’s gaze slid past Qiu Tong’s face. She turned to the other female soldiers and asked, \"Answer me loudly!\"","\"I accept!\"","The woman’s clear voice was raised high. She used their determination to answer Ye Jian.","\"Very good. Since you’ve accepted it, use your actions to prove it to me. This is a military order. If I discover any slacking during training in the future, my punishment will be even more terrifying than the training.","\"Remember what I said today. Everything I said is true and effective until the half-year training ends!\"","Female soldiers were actually harder to lead than male soldiers. Female soldiers would think too much. Once they did so, their negative emotions would increase. Male soldiers were different. Male soldiers didn’t have so many twists and turns in their thoughts. As long as the instructor could convince them, that would be the end of it.","Female soldiers were different. The emotions of female soldiers came quickly and retreated quickly. When their emotions rose, it might affect other female soldiers who were undergoing normal training.","Ye Jian decided to be candid here and get the unpleasantness out of the way so that the female soldiers wouldn’t get angry and provoke Battalion Commander Tian, Commissar Tang, and Company Commander Zhu in the future.","Ye Jian’s words quickly reached Battalion Commander Tian’s ears. Battalion Commander Tian smiled at Commissar Tang and said, \"She has an imposing aura. It’s just that she’s still a little young. After some training, she’ll be better at doing things.\"","\"Little Ye is already very good. Back then, I didn’t have the guts to come to the camp like her. It took the old political commissar three months for me to get started.\" Commissar Tang smiled. He was still very tolerant of Ye Jian. \"She just graduated. Although she performed outstandingly in school, the military school and the military unit are different, after all. As long as she doesn’t make any mistakes, there’s nothing to be afraid of.","\"After some time, it’ll naturally be easier for her to do things and deal with problems. Just wait. In less than a week, she’ll take control of all the female soldiers.\"","Puzzled, Battalion Commander Tian smiled and asked, \"One week? Old Tang, you trust her a lot. Come, tell me, how did you come to that judgment?\"","\"Gao Xiao and Qiu Tong don’t get along. However, she only called out Gao Xiao this morning and didn’t mention Qiu Tong. Why do you think that is?\"","Why? Battalion Commander Tian waited quietly for Commissar Tang’s answer.","Political Commissar Tang knew that Battalion Commander Tian just wanted to wait for an answer. He sighed. \"It’s to tell Qiu Tong that she has her eyes on the two of them. She’s targeting them. No, I should say that they’re the focus of the training.\"","\"I’m sorry, I don’t think that’s true. She just called out a name. Maybe it just happened to be Gao Xiao? Don’t you think that it’s easy to remember the name of this female soldier?\"","Battalion Commander Tian felt that Commissar Tang was thinking too much.","When Commissar Tang heard this, he couldn’t be bothered to explain anymore. It was obvious that he didn’t look at their resumes carefully!"]},{"number":4882,"title":"Chapter 4882: Learning","paragraphs":["Why did Ye Jian single out Gao Xiao? Gao Xiao herself didn’t know it, but Qiu Tong knew it.","After the training ended in the afternoon, Qiu Tong, whose legs were as heavy as lead, went to look for Ye Jian alone. She knew that the instructor was waiting for her.","In the morning, the instructor asked all the female soldiers if they would accept her harsh training. Actually, the main point was to ask her. If not, she wouldn’t have glanced at her face.","Ye Jian knew that she didn’t want to be in the same military unit as Gao Xiao. She even wanted to use her family’s connections to see if she could leave the northwest.","Unfortunately, she hadn’t contacted her family yet. Instructor Ye was the one who noticed it first.","Ye Jian guessed that Qiu Tong would come and have a heart-to-heart talk with her. However, she didn’t expect Qiu Tong to come and look for her before the day was even over. Hence, she was worried that Qiu Tong really wanted to leave.","With Qiu Tong’s family background, it wasn’t difficult for her to be transferred from a female soldier class that had just been formed and didn’t have any results.","Looking at the female soldier who was competing with Gao Xiao, Ye Jian narrowed her eyes and asked in a low voice, \"It’s enough to be a deserter once. Do you want to escape a second time?\"","Qiu Tong, who sat down, smiled bitterly. \"Instructor Ye, I can’t get over the hurdle in my heart.\"","The reason why Qiu Tong and Gao Xiao didn’t get along was because of a two-timing man. Qiu Tong didn’t know that the elegant-looking man was also dating Gao Xiao. After agreeing to the other party’s pursuit, the two of them had only met four times.","On their fifth date, Gao Xiao, who was on leave, held a mineral water bottle in her hand and splashed it at the unsuspecting Qiu Tong.","Fortunately, both of them were wearing casual clothes on the day of their leave. Qiu Tong, whose face was splashed with water, knew the truth of the matter at that time. She was shocked and angry. She returned to the military unit and immediately applied for leave. Then, she left her original position and stayed away from Gao Xiao. She didn’t even explain.","But what could she say?","She was indeed dating that man. Although nothing else happened, she was indeed that man’s girlfriend at that time.","Ye Jian wasn’t good at solving personal feelings. However, she knew that no matter what happened, escaping wasn’t the solution.","\"Your escape made Gao Xiao misunderstand you even more. Your concession made Gao Xiao think that everything she saw was real and that you deliberately took the opportunity to take revenge for what happened when you were hospitalized that time. She replaced you in the mission you were supposed to carry out and came back with third-class honors. She thought that you were jealous and deliberately sought out her boyfriend. Even now, she still thinks so.","\"I purposely asked her the question this morning because I was worried that she would want to leave too. Gao Xiao is more emotional. I can only calm her down first before calming you down.","\"The misunderstanding between the two of you needs to be resolved. If you explain it now, I don’t think Gao Xiao will listen.","\"I want to let Gao Xiao know you again through the competition of strength between the two of you. I want her to forget about the past and be able to face you calmly.","\"When she can face you calmly, the hurdle in your heart can be overcome. Then, when you talk about the past, it won’t be filled with tension anymore. The two of you will be able to move on.\"","Ye Jian said seriously and suggested sincerely, \"Qiu Tong, if you continue to run away, you’ll miss out on your dream.","\"Stay for your own dream. In order to realize your dream, it’s not a big deal to suffer a little for the time being. No one will have a smooth journey. Everyone will encounter one or more difficult obstacles. The obstacles in your heart have been making things difficult for you for a year and a half. Do you still want to continue escaping rather than face them?\""]},{"number":4883,"title":"Chapter 4883: Unease","paragraphs":["Ye Jian couldn’t understand why she would stop moving forward and even sacrifice her dream for a bumpy path in life.","In her past life, her life was difficult. However, she still didn’t choose to give up. No matter how difficult or helpless she was, she gritted her teeth and persevered. She always felt that as long as she worked harder, everything might change. Everything would change because of her hard work.","Although she didn’t change much in her past life, in this life, she could still pat her chest and say that although she had a hard time in her past life, she never once thought of bowing down to Ye Ying.","The only person she begged was Ye Zhifan. She didn’t even do that to Sun Dongqing. At that time, she always thought that Ye Zhifan was her family, her uncle, and her elder.","She didn’t think that kneeling to an elder was anything wrong.","Her life was so difficult back then that she didn’t know if she would be able to see the sun tomorrow. She just gritted her teeth and tried to collect evidence of Ye Zhifan’s crimes. However... before she died, she didn’t see Ye Zhifan fall.","Her regrets in her past life were finally realized in this life. She persevered in two lifetimes, and her goal was finally achieved. From then on, she drew the line and was reborn in her previous life.","Ye Jian, who had been persevering, couldn’t understand why Qiu Tong would give up her dream so easily. Compared to her dream, the hurdle in her heart was nothing.","Ye Jian felt that the reason why Qiu Tong couldn’t overcome the hurdle in her heart had a lot to do with her upbringing. She came from a strict and upright family. That was why she thought that she had made a heinous mistake. Even if it was unintentional, she couldn’t forgive herself.","Qiu Tong was a female soldier with a lot of potential. It was not impossible for her to become a special forces soldier. Moreover, Qiu Tong, who graduated from high school and joined the military, was a year younger than her. The reason why she was deceived in the past was because she was young and her family protected her too well. That was why she was not guarded against a man.","Hence, Ye Jian didn’t think that Qiu Tong made a mistake.","Sometimes, it was really easy for a handsome man to coax a young lady who lived in a simple environment and had no love experience.","Qiu Tong didn’t do anything wrong, and Gao Xiao didn’t do anything wrong either. The mistake was that Qiu Tong couldn’t face Gao Xiao in the past. She couldn’t face Gao Xiao and didn’t explain anything. She left in a panic, causing the situation to become tense. After a year and a half, even though Gao Xiao wasn’t with a liar and didn’t deceive anyone, Gao Xiao still couldn’t calm down.","Qiu Tong, who was standing in front of Ye Jian, lowered her head and pursed her lips without saying anything.","This was a stubborn girl. This could be seen from the fact that she insisted on joining the military after graduating from high school and didn’t choose to go to university. It was difficult for others to change her decision.","Stubbornness was both a strength and a weakness. Seeing that she remained silent and refused to communicate, Ye Jian felt a headache.","Thinking about what Captain Xia had said in the past and how he had once faced a male soldier who was so stubborn that he didn’t know where to start, Ye Jian took a deep breath and said, \"Qiu Tong, you’re taking an important step to realize your dream now. If you give up because of a misunderstanding that can be explained clearly, I’ll look down on you.","\"I won’t say that you have to do things for the sake of your family or what not. I just want to say that for your own sake, you have to persevere and face it.\"","Qiu Tong’s fingers moved slightly, and her pursed lips tightened a little."]},{"number":4884,"title":"Chapter 4884: Was It Worth It?","paragraphs":["Qiu Tong had been suppressing her emotions. She was also suppressing the torture that this hurdle in her heart brought her.","Yes, besides humiliation, there was also moral torture.","She never thought that one day, she would be shamed and humiliated.","However, Instructor Ye was right about one thing. When she encountered a bumpy road on the path of fulfilling her dream, how could she give up on it because of this?","A misunderstanding... Could Gao Xiao accept it?","Qiu Tong was a little confused. She didn’t know how to explain it to Gao Xiao.","The truth was like that, and Gao Xiao saw it on the spot. Facts spoke louder than words... Could Gao Xiao accept it?","Hearing Ye Jian’s advice, Qiu Tong’s expression softened. Ye Jian, who had been observing carefully, was overjoyed.","The stubborn Qiu Tong was even more troublesome than Gao Xiao. Although Ye Jian was prepared to take the initiative to look for her and had even thought of a way to persuade her, she was still a little nervous.","No wonder G3 didn’t want to be a vice-captain or a political commissar at all. She didn’t want to either! She might as well be led by Captain Xia. If she had a mission, she would just carry it out. If she didn’t have a mission, she would train well. It would be so much easier!","On the first day of accepting the female soldier class, Instructor Ye was already a little ’fearful’ of such titles.","Fortunately, Qiu Tong relaxed a little, proving that what Ye Jian said was on point. Ye Jian, who was happy, continued in a low voice, \"Half a year... It’s very likely that you only have half a year to realize your dream.\"","\"If you continue wasting your time on meaningless things, I can tell you with certainty that the day you leave the Vanguard Battalion, your dream will always be a dream. It’ll be impossible to realize in your entire life.","\"I will record your every move for the next half a year. I’ll write your performance clearly in the report, including if you choose to abandon us. Then, I’ll report everything to the military","\"From now on, your personal file will be recorded. It’s impossible for you to use your family connections to facilitate things like before.","\"No matter how strong your family’s connections are, they can’t be compared to the toughness of the military leaders. Think carefully. Whether you want to continue or give up is up to you.\"","It wasn’t an exaggeration. Ye Jian had said everything she needed to say. The rest was up to Qiu Tong.","The room was very quiet. Only the sound of breathing could be heard. Qiu Tong lowered her head for a long time. There was no change in her expression.","But her eyes were filled with emotions.","Was it worth giving up her dream for a misunderstanding?","Was it worth it?","Qiu Tong, who didn’t speak much, was not as cold as she looked on the surface. She asked herself again and again in her heart, until her stubbornness of not wanting to communicate with her family and friends finally shook a little.","She was deceived by a man, which even interfered with her relationship with a comrade. This was the biggest humiliation in her life.","If... it was really like what Instructor Ye said, that the misunderstanding could be explained and the humiliation could be washed away... Qiu Tong slowly raised her head. Her tightly pursed lips finally relaxed. \"Instructor Ye, don’t you think I’m shameless?\"","Her words made Ye Jian feel relieved. She could vaguely see Qiu Tong’s worry and what she was thinking.","Qiu Tong cared a lot about other people’s opinions. That was why she asked her if she felt that she was shameless!"]},{"number":4885,"title":"Chapter 4885: Carrying The Limelight","paragraphs":["It was obvious that Qiu Tong needed someone to acknowledge her. She needed someone to help her and tell her that she wasn’t shameless!","The main reason why Qiu Tong was able to let go of her stubbornness in refusing to communicate with others was because Ye Jian told Qiu Tong that everything was just a misunderstanding. As an instructor, she believed her!","Ye Jian, who had already grasped Qiu Tong’s thoughts, replied seriously, \"If there was something wrong with your character, the military wouldn’t have approved your application. The military has investigated the misunderstanding between you and Gao Xiao. Your participation is also a chance given to you by the military.\"","Qiu Tong’s gray eyes suddenly lit up.","They believed in her character. They believed that she didn’t do it on purpose. The military believed in her. Even the company’s instructor believed in her.","Instead... it was her family. Every time something happened, her parents would ask her to reflect on herself and find her mistakes. As time passed, she developed the habit of subconsciously thinking that it was all her fault whenever something happened.","When she was splashed with water by Gao Xiao, she knew that she was wrong. Hence, she had been carefully avoiding Gao Xiao and the female soldiers in her class. She was afraid that in a new environment, that shameful matter would be exposed because of Gao Xiao.","Now, Instructor Ye told her that the military approved her application because they believed in her and Instructor Ye herself believed in her. The stubborn Qiu Tong slowly clenched her fists as tears welled up in her eyes.","\"Thank you, Instructor Ye. Thank you so much!\" Qiu Tong straightened her back with tears in her eyes. She used her military salute to express her gratitude. At this moment, she felt that even her shoulders were much more relaxed.","Qiu Tong nodded heavily. Her eyes were bright as she said seriously, \"I know what I should do. However, please give me a few days. I need to muster my courage to face Gao Xiao.","\"Don’t worry. As long as the military believes in me, I won’t give up on myself!\"","After all, this was a hurdle that she hadn’t been able to move past for a year and a half. Even if Qiu Tong heard what Ye Jian said and remembered it in her heart, she wouldn’t be able to act on the advice immediately.","She needed to think about it carefully.","Ye Jian didn’t ask her to face Gao Xiao immediately. She was already very happy with Qiu Tong’s attitude!","She thought that she would have to spend at least a week and a half to convince Qiu Tong. In the end, it took less than half an hour. Even though Ye Jian was calm, she couldn’t help but feel a little happy.","After Qiu Tong left, Ye Jian sat on the chair alone and laughed from time to time.","Everything was difficult at the start. But she had made a good start!","It meant that it would definitely be better!","Ye Jian was so happy that she didn’t realize that a slender figure had been standing at the door for a long time.","Xia Jinyuan stood at the door for a long time after Qiu Tong left. When Qiu Tong came out and met him, she even greeted him.","Looking at Ye Jian’s silly and cute actions, the smile in Xia Jinyuan’s eyes rippled gently.","It seemed that his woman had already taken care of Qiu Tong. If not, she wouldn’t be secretly happy.","Seeing that she didn’t notice him, Xia Jinyuan coughed lightly. Ye Jian, who had her back facing the door, jumped up in shock. She looked a little awkward.","\"What are you laughing at?\"","Xia Jinyuan walked in with his long legs. He knew the answer but he still asked, \"Are you very satisfied with this morning’s training?\"","\"It has nothing to do with training.\" Ye Jian smiled brightly. \"I solved a difficult problem just now. I’m happy.\"","Yes, he could tell that she was very happy."]},{"number":4886,"title":"Chapter 4886: You Can’t Disobey Military Orders","paragraphs":["This time, Xia Jinyuan didn’t close the door when he came in. He leaned against the desk and specially kept a distance. Even if someone suddenly came in, they wouldn’t be able to tell that there was anything fishy between the two of them. They were just communicating.","Xia Jinyuan smiled and asked, \"Qiu Tong?\"","Ye Jian didn’t reply immediately. She looked at him suspiciously and frowned. \"Were you standing at the door for a long time just now?\"","Xia Jinyuan smiled. \"Yes, for a while.\"","\"No wonder you hit the nail on the head.\" Ye Jian sighed. \"I wanted to hide it from you first and give you a surprise later. In the end, you found out the moment she left. I don’t feel a sense of accomplishment at all.\"","Xia Jinyuan couldn’t help but smile. When his little fox was cute like this, he really wanted to hug her and kiss her a few times.","\"I’m sorry. Next time, I’ll definitely pretend that I know nothing.\"","\"That’s not good either. If you know, so be it. How can you pretend not to know? Didn’t you come to keep an eye on me? If you pretend not to know, I’ll be able to tell.\"","\"You’re in charge of training. I’m in charge of supervising. I have to obey the mission given to me by the boss.\" Xia Jinyuan sighed with her. He made it look like he was in a difficult position. \"Military orders cannot be violated. Even if I want to hide it, I can’t.\"","Ye Jian was amused and angry when she saw him teasing her again. \"You’re talking nonsense again. Why are you looking for me? If there’s nothing else, I won’t keep you. Take an afternoon nap and continue your training in the afternoon.\"","Oh, she had learned how to chase people away. Now that she was an instructor and had a military rank, she was different. She was more confident!","Xia Jinyuan moved quickly and flicked her forehead with his slender fingers. \"You heartless girl. You needed me last night and came over in the middle of the night to harass me. Now that you don’t need me, you’re kicking me away. Your attitude is really heartbreaking.\"","He even patted his chest to tell Ye Jian how ’cold’ her heart was.","Ye Jian’s gaze turned colder. \"Are you alright? Please move away, Captain Xia. Thank you.\"","After settling Qiu Tong’s matter, Ye Jian’s tone became lighter.","Xia Jinyuan was elated when he saw this.","No one wanted to see Ye Jian leading the team for training more than him. Since yesterday, he had been laying the foundation for her future. From the looks of it, she had already achieved results.","\"Yes, but I’m not the one looking for you. The boss called and wants to have a chat with you tonight.\"","At the mention of the boss, who was Major General Yang, Ye Jian’s expression changed. Her expression turned exceptionally serious. \"What time?\"","\"Any time after eight o’clock is fine. I’m guessing he wants to ask if you’re used to it and if there are any difficulties. If there are any difficulties, you should go ahead and tell him. However, don’t expect the boss to give you any advice. It’s more reliable to rely on yourself or on me.\"","Xia Jinyuan said the last sentence especially slowly. Of course, he had to emphasize it.","Ye Jian agreed!","However, she still needed to say a few words to the boss.","Just as she was about to speak, Xia Jinyuan seemed to have guessed what she would say and said, \"Of course, you should rely on me in your personal life.\"","He almost made a huge mistake. Fortunately, he found a way to salvage the situation in time.","Xia Jinyuan could guess what Ye Jian wanted to say from her expression.","If it was more reliable to rely on herself, then she wouldn’t rely on him in the future.","Well, she was intercepted again!","Xia Jinyuan felt lucky when he saw her unfortunate expression."]},{"number":4887,"title":"Chapter 4887: Deep Reflection","paragraphs":["Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who had ’escaped from death’, immediately reflected on himself and came to the conclusion that a man must not have a cheap mouth. The consequences of having a cheap mouth were very serious!","While pursuing his wife, Lieutenant Colonel Xia’s insights were increasing day by day. In the end, he would be able to teach the younger generation how to woo their wives. It just so happened that he succeeded, and he was so proud of it in front of Ye Jian for a long time.","Ye Jian saw that he reacted so quickly. She found it to be a pity and threw the topic aside. She wasn’t an unreasonable person. As long as it wasn’t a huge mistake, Ye Jian would forget about it.","After talking about Qiu Tong, they talked about Gao Xiao.","At the mention of Gao Xiao, Ye Jian felt much more relaxed.","Gao Xiao was much easier to deal with than Qiu Tong. However, once she was provoked, she would immediately take the bait. She even dared to ask her, the instructor, whether she was really going to train with the female soldiers.","She was a straightforward person who hated evil. If they were in ancient times, she would definitely be a hero.","She didn’t have so many complicated thoughts. She was direct with everything. Ye Jian admired her blunt character.","Hence, she didn’t want Gao Xiao to be affected by a misunderstanding and target the innocent Qiu Tong.","As long as the two of them stayed in the military unit and Qiu Tong had the intention to reconcile and explain, Ye Jian would be at ease.","\"All of you female soldiers like to keep your words to yourself. We would think you really don’t care and get worried about you. Who knows that you only say you don’t care, but in fact, you feel so bad in your heart that it’s killing you.\"","After listening to Gao Xiao’s and Qiu Tong’s complicated thoughts, even a smart person like Xia Jinyuan had a headache.","What was going on?","Why couldn’t things just be said outright? Why couldn’t they just explain if there were misunderstandings? Why did they have to make things difficult for each other?","After Xia Jinyuan finished sighing, he looked at Ye Jian who was staring at him with a faint smile. Xia Jinyuan suddenly shuddered and wanted to slap himself.","He was talking nonsense. He was blind and had a cheap mouth!","\"Fortunately, you’re different from them. You say things out loud even if you’re in a conflict. Gao Xiao and Qiu Tong are so troublesome.","\"The military has foresight. If you weren’t their instructor, none of us male soldiers would be able to handle them. It’s not that we can’t handle them. It’s just that our way of dealing with them would be different from yours.\"","Xia Jinyuan started chattering away again to make up for his mistake.","Could it be that he was so angry at the 20 soldiers he trained today that his IQ had dropped?","If not, why did he keep making mistakes?","He couldn’t say anything else!","Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who became alert, gathered his thoughts. His handsome face was serious and cold as he said in a low voice, \"If it were me handling their relationship, I would’ve asked them to make things clear in person. I’d tell them not to make things difficult. If they had the time to cause trouble for others, they might as well focus on the right path.\"","After he finished speaking, a dark look flashed past Xia Jinyuan’s black eyes. He stared at Ye Jian, who was still smiling. Then, he said slowly, \"Although your method is effective, it’s too slow. I suggest you use my method.\"","This was the biggest difference between men and women.","Ye Jian retracted her smile and sighed. \"They’re different from male soldiers. I’ve thought about it for a long time. I can’t just be domineering. There’s strength in gentleness. Today, Qiu Tong’s words are proof that I’ve found the right method.","\"However, it depends on the person. Some female soldiers are stubborn, and I have to be tough with them. For example, if I show a gentle side in front of Gao Xiao, she’ll think I’m easy to bully.\""]},{"number":4888,"title":"Chapter 4888: Bluff","paragraphs":["Ever since Ye Jian got the roster of the female soldiers and looked at their resumes, combined with her observation, Ye Jian had been looking for ways to make these female soldiers obey her as soon as possible.","This was a difficulty that a commander had to go through. She was no exception.","Ye Jian’s sigh made Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who was trying his best to be serious, smile. \"You’re improving very quickly. The major general will be very happy when he finds out.\"","\"A female soldier is indeed different from a male soldier. Captain Xia, it looks like I really can’t ask you to help me come up with ideas. I’ll slowly figure it out myself. Although the results are slow, the method is correct. Your method is good, but I don’t think it’s suitable for female soldiers.\"","Xia Jinyuan came to the Xueyu unit out of nowhere. He found the weaknesses of the special forces soldiers and defeated them one by one. He wanted to let the special forces soldiers who didn’t obey him know that although he came out of nowhere, he wasn’t easy to fool.","Even though they were humiliated by Xia Jinyuan in public, the male soldiers only felt embarrassed at that time. After that, they restrained themselves and accepted him wholeheartedly.","His method was feasible for male soldiers, but not for female soldiers.","A woman was easily embarrassed. If you embarrassed her in front of everyone, she wouldn’t say anything on the spot, but she would hate you even more behind your back.","Although the female soldiers were soldiers, they were women, after all. They were meticulous and wouldn’t accept rough methods. They would find it easier to accept Ye Jian’s method of handling things that cared about each other’s reputation and made the other party feel at ease.","The stubborn Qiu Tong fell for Ye Jian’s trick.","Ye Jian looked gentle, but in fact, she had a tough method.","Looking at his lover who wasn’t moved by his persuasion, Xia Jinyuan smiled disapprovingly. \"You can let them get used to your way of handling things. As long as they get used to it, there’s nothing wrong.\"","At first, Ye Jian didn’t notice anything. However, when Xia Jinyuan said this, Ye Jian’s thoughts popped up. When she looked at him again, there was a hint of scrutiny in her eyes.","Something was wrong. Normally, Captain Xia wouldn’t be like this.","Ye Jian, who had a sharp mind, stared at the man who was leaning against the desk lazily. There was a comfortable faint smile in his dark and deep eyes. There was a hint of elegance that made people’s hearts palpitate. He looked at her without blinking. When he saw her looking over and raising her eyebrows slightly, there was an indescribable willfulness on his face.","Although he was good-looking, she mustn’t be seduced by a man. Ye Jian, who was scrutinizing him, asked with a faint smile, \"Captain Xia, are you up to no good again?\"","\"How can that be? I’m making a serious suggestion to you. As long as it’s effective, there’s no need to be so formal. Instructor Ye, don’t forget that we only have half a year.\"","Although he said it normally, his thoughts were completely different.","This was bad. The little fox was getting smarter and smarter as she grew up. She had more and more ideas too. She had strong principles. It would be difficult for him to fool her.","Regardless, he still needed to give it a shot. What if he succeeded?","If she was successfully fooled by him... Xia Jinyuan lowered his eyes slightly. The coldness in his dark eyes disappeared.","If he succeeded, she wouldn’t be able to talk to him so easily anymore. She would punish him however she wanted. She wouldn’t show mercy.","His serious reply made Ye Jian think that she might have thought too much and misunderstood. Although she still felt a little strange, Ye Jian could only put it aside for the time being and point out Xia Jinyuan’s mistakes with a serious expression."]},{"number":4889,"title":"Chapter 4889: Marriage Leave","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan saw that she was serious and directly said that he was in the wrong. The coldness in his black eyes disappeared in an instant, and the corners of his lips curled up slowly.","\"Captain Xia, you’re wrong this time. Even if you can see effects fast, it doesn’t mean the effects will last long. If you’re too domineering, the results will be superficial. It can be seen as suppression.","\"You once said that what we want is for the soldiers to be convinced. Using strong suppression to achieve a short-term effect will only deepen the resentment of the soldiers. As time passes, the hearts of the people will be scattered. Although they appear to obey, they’ll violate your orders behind your back. In the long run, you’ll be fooled by the illusion and think that the soldiers are really obeying you.","\"In the end, it’ll become self-deception. Your method is suitable for male soldiers, but it’s definitely not suitable for female soldiers.\"","After she finished speaking, Ye Jian heaved a long sigh. \"Alas, I’ll just rely on myself. Captain Xia, I have to rest. You should rest too.\"","This was the first time Xia Jinyuan was reprimanded by Ye Jian. For a moment, he felt that it was rare. The smile in his eyes was so deep. If one looked at it, one would fall for his charm.","\"I accept Instructor Ye’s criticism humbly. Rest early.\"","Before he left, he bowed gentlemanly. He gave a meaningful smile with his deep black eyes and left elegantly.","What else was there to worry about?","She was a smart and fearless woman. She was smarter than anyone thought.","Although she was inexperienced, she was very good at summarizing. She was not afraid of hardships and was willing to work hard. It was true that the leaders in charge of the military had great vision!","Yes, but he had better taste than them.","If he hadn’t discovered her long ago, the military wouldn’t have gotten such a talent!","He would mention it to his boss later and see if there were any rewards.","For example, a longer leave.","The more he thought about it, the deeper the smile on Lieutenant Colonel Xia’s handsome face.","Ye Jian didn’t see the smile on his face. She closed the door and lay on the bed. The strange feeling in her heart hadn’t disappeared. She still felt that there was something wrong with Captain Xia just now.","Forget it, she should rest.","Captain Xia had his own set of skills, and so did she. She couldn’t say that Captain Xia was in the wrong. She could only say that his methods weren’t suitable for female soldiers.","Just like what he said, she might as well rely on herself.","It was better to rely on herself!","When Grandpa Gen and Uncle Chen were alive, they always taught her that if she wanted to stand firm in the world, she could only be independent.","Only by being strong and independent could she not be destroyed no matter how strong the wind or rain was.","It could be seen that relying on oneself was much more reliable than relying on others!","The faces of her deceased relatives appeared in her mind. She thought of Grandpa Gen and Principal Chen. Then, she thought of the fact that she still hadn’t found Principal Chen’s murderer. Ye Jian closed her eyes and grabbed the blanket tightly. A vicious look flashed past her face.","She would definitely find Uncle Chen’s murderer and take revenge personally!","Definitely!","Definitely!","Ye Jian couldn’t calm down. She turned around and hugged the dark green blanket distributed by the military unit tightly. She rolled around for a few minutes before falling asleep.","After leaving, Xia Jinyuan didn’t return to the dormitory immediately. Instead, he walked toward the office.","He needed to have a chat with Major General Yang. He needed to tell him that there was no need to worry about Ye Jian. She was amazing.","It was a good thing that she had her own opinions!","There was indeed something wrong with Xia Jinyuan just now. He said that on purpose to see if Ye Jian would be led astray by him.","Reality proved that as her boyfriend, he had underestimated Ye Jian. She wouldn’t be led astray by him. She could even refute him immediately.","Major General Yang could rest assured, and so could he."]},{"number":4890,"title":"Chapter 4890: Calm Down","paragraphs":["Major General Yang, who received the call, laughed loudly before he even finished listening. He repeatedly said, \"Okay.\" It looked like the two of them had plotted everything. Lieutenant Ye was naturally extraordinary. There was no need to worry too much about her.","There was no need for that!","He could let her go and let her develop.","Xia Jinyuan immediately took the opportunity to propose a reward. He didn’t say anything else but that he wanted to take a longer marriage leave.","Marriage leave... for a longer period?","Major General Yang, who was still laughing, choked and coughed because of Xia Jinyuan’s mention of ’marriage leave’.","While he was coughing, Xia Jinyuan said leisurely, \"Don’t be agitated. It’s not a big deal.\"","How could he not be agitated?","Major General Yang held the phone tightly and coughed until his face turned red. He wanted to slap someone. \"Are you planning to get married? When did you decide this? Why isn’t there any news? Does the commander-in-chief know? Didn’t you say that after you get married, the two of you would be together? Does Little Ye not plan on joining your brigade?\"","Marriage was a huge matter to anyone, but it had a greater impact on Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian.","If the two of them really planned to get married, they would have to face the question Major General Yang asked.","\"You’ve misunderstood.\" Seeing that Major General Yang had misunderstood, Xia Jinyuan needed to explain further. \"I don’t plan to get married for the time being, but I want to get a reward in advance.\"","Major General Yang felt that there was something wrong with Xia Jinyuan’s thinking. His heart almost suffocated.","\"Do you have nothing to do all day? Marriage leave? Why don’t you say that you’re retiring? Don’t even think about it for the next five years! I’m not the one who’s saying this. The commander-in-chief said it himself. If you have any objections, please look for him.","\"You still have the cheek to ask me for marriage leave? Well, I want to transfer you back! I don’t want you to affect Little Ye!\"","Since Little Ye could solve the problem herself and didn’t need Xia Jinyuan’s guidance, Major General Yang couldn’t help but narrow his eyes.","He really had to consider transferring Xia Jinyuan back in advance.","When Xia Jinyuan heard this, he didn’t talk about the reward anymore. He cursed silently, \"A bunch of sly old foxes!\" His expression and tone changed. He said in a low voice, \"I have something urgent to deal with. I’ll hang up first.\"","Then, he added, \"Major General, don’t you know that it’s easy to invite a god but difficult to send him off?\"","With that, he hung up.","Major General Yang held the phone. He was so angry that his face turned green.","Easy to invite a god but difficult to send him off?","Hah!","Haha!","Hahaha!","’Little Six of the Xia family, if the commander-in-chief made a move, would you be able to resist?’","Xia Jinyuan hung up on Major General Yang and called the old residence at night.","He chatted with Old Master Xia and Old Madam Xia for a while. At the same time, he told the two elders that he was with their favorite granddaughter-in-law.","The old madam was so happy that she smiled. As she listened to her grandson, she covered the microphone and whispered to the old master, \"Little Six is more reliable than his father. He knows that he has to guard his wife. He even chased her to the military unit.\"","The old master, who wanted to hear what his grandson said, was happy, but...","\"You speak first. I’ll talk to him after that.\" Although he was happy, he still had to pay attention to what he needed to pay attention to. The old master was much calmer than the old madam.","The old madam didn’t think too much about it. It was good that her grandson was thoughtful.","In order to marry Ye Jian as soon as possible, Xia Jinyuan, who had made the old madam happy, had to prevent Commander Xia, who loved to drag him down, from making things difficult for him. Xia Jinyuan decided to make a move in advance and use the old madam’s power to stop Commander Xia from making things difficult for him."]},{"number":4891,"title":"Chapter 4891: Tricking Me","paragraphs":["Hence, Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who didn’t show any mercy to his father, tactfully expressed that his father would probably think of transferring him away. If he got married too late because of this, he didn’t want the old madam to worry. He and Ye Jian would definitely get married, but it might just happen later.","When the old madam heard this, in order to let her favorite grandson marry Ye Jian as soon as possible, she immediately made the decision over the phone. \"Leave it to us, your grandparents. Your father is unreasonable. We’ll teach him a lesson!\"","How dare he ruin her grandson’s plans? Hmph, he was asking for it!","It was the old master’s turn to speak. He reminded Xia Jinyuan that he had to pay attention to the impact of his actions. He couldn’t lose the big picture because of small matters. He couldn’t violate the rules either.","Xia Jinyuan remembered everything. He didn’t dare to joke about Ye Jian’s future. He wouldn’t let anyone gossip about her.","A week later, Commander Xia returned to the old residence to visit the two elders. The moment he entered the house, Old Madam Xia swung the whip that the master used to ride horses and fight in the war at Commander Xia.","Commander Xia, who took the time to come back, was shocked by the old madam’s actions. How many years had it been since she used a horse whip to hit someone? Why was she hitting him with it today?","He hadn’t done anything to anger the old madam!","Commander Xia, who was tricked by his son, was at a loss. He couldn’t figure out what mistake he had made.","Looking at the force of the whip, Old Master Xia was so frightened that he hurriedly said, \"Old lady, be careful! Don’t break your waist!\"","Then, he saw Commander Xia dodging left and right. The whip couldn’t get close to him. Old Master Xia’s expression darkened as he shouted, \"Do you want your mother to break her waist? Stand properly and let her whip you twice to vent her anger!\"","Xia Jinyuan’s uncle, who came in a few steps later, silently retracted his leg and even thoughtfully pulled his wife to the side. \"It’s rare for Mom to be angry. Let’s go later so that we won’t be implicated.\"","He wouldn’t even try to stop the fight.","The strong old madam had said a few times on the phone that she was a little free and wanted to find something to do.","Now, she had found something to do.","The eldest aunt was already used to the interactions between the brothers of the Xia family. The elders were like this, and so were the younger ones. They liked to harm their own. Of course, they could only harm their own family members. If the people outside wanted to do bad things, the brothers would work together to teach the other party a lesson!","\"Don’t just watch the show. Mom might hurt her waist or sprain her ankle. No matter how strong her body is, she can’t be compared to the young. If she’s not careful, she’ll get hurt.\"","The eldest aunt wasn’t worried about her brother-in-law. She was worried that the old madam would get hurt.","Commander Xia was worried too. Seeing that Old Master Xia had opened his mouth, Commander Xia, who was sighing, stood still and took three lashes from the old madam.","Commander Xia, whose calves were trembling, respectfully asked the old madam if she had calmed down. Then, he asked the old madam to tell him clearly so that he would know what he did wrong so that he could correct it.","Who was the old madam? She was used to all kinds of storms and had fought against countless schemes. Although Commander Xia was in a high position now, the old madam was once in a high position too. It was impossible to get anything out of her.","She snorted twice and threw the horse whip at Commander Xia, who was still wearing his military uniform and had gold stars on his shoulders. Her voice was old and authoritative as she said, \"I can hit you if I want to. Why do I need to find a reason?!\"","Such a powerful reason made Commander Xia speechless. He could only accept it!","However, Commander Xia managed to find out later. He was so angry that his heart hurt."]},{"number":4892,"title":"Chapter 4892: Special","paragraphs":["It was said that a father knew his son best.","No one knew a man better than his father.","Fortunately, Xia Jinyuan made the first move. If not, he might really have been transferred back to the military unit in advance. There was no other reason. Commander Xia felt that since Ye Jian could stand alone, Xia Jinyuan, who was sent to guide her, could come back. There was no need for him to stay.","It was like killing the donkey after the goods had been transported.","Why would Xia Jinyuan go back?","He had already said that it was easy to invite a god but difficult to send him away. He was transferred to the northwest without a word. Here, he could meet Ye Jian every day. This was a good thing, so he didn’t have any other plans.","Now that they saw that although Ye Jian was inexperienced, she was completely qualified to be an instructor, they wanted to transfer him back? He wouldn’t cooperate with them every time.","He cooperated when they transferred him here, but he would not cooperate if they wanted to transfer him back!","After the old madam’s whipping, Commander Xia calmed down and thought about it. He even chatted with Major General Yang. His intention of transferring Xia Jinyuan back gradually subsided.","Major General Yang understood why Commander Xia wanted to transfer Xia Jinyuan back. As a father, how could he enjoy setting up traps for his son?","Although Commander Xia never facilitated his only son, he wouldn’t really stand by and watch. As long as it didn’t violate principles and discipline, Commander Xia would use his own methods to silently protect his only son’s growth.","For instance, young people would more or less be a little impulsive. If the two of them made mistakes while living together, once their mistakes were exposed, even if Commander Xia wanted to protect them, countless pairs of eyes would not let Xia Jinyuan off.","\"Little Ye has been independent since a long time ago. I’m both happy and worried. If she wasn’t so smart, my Little Six would put away his frivolous thoughts and focus on guiding Little Ye as much as possible.","\"However, Little Ye is very perceptive. She doesn’t even need the higher-ups to settle the matters. She can settle the group of soldiers herself. I know what Little Six is thinking. Once Little Ye takes action, he’ll be able to relax and be happy! I want to transfer him back in advance because I’m worried that he’ll be too happy and leave something to use against me.\"","After all, they weren’t in the Xueyu unit. If they made a mistake, they would be affected.","This was why Commander Xia wanted to transfer Xia Jinyuan back in advance. It wasn’t because he didn’t believe Xia Jinyuan but because he was worried as a father.","Unexpectedly, even though Commander Xia knew that his only son knew his limits and wouldn’t do anything rash, he still couldn’t feel at ease. He would rather the two of them be separated for a short period of time than leave behind any hidden dangers.","Commander Xia was a reserved person. He didn’t like to tell others what he was thinking. He wasn’t used to telling Xia Jinyuan his worries either. He hid his fatherly love in the depths of his heart. Sometimes, Old Madam Xia felt that he was too ruthless to Xia Jinyuan.","Actually, it wasn’t the case.","This time, if Commander Xia hadn’t suddenly revealed the real reason for his plan, Major General Yang wouldn’t have known what was going on.","After a long silence, Major General Yang said, \"Commander, sometimes, it’s better for you to express yourself. Even the people around me don’t know the real reason. Little Six... probably doesn’t know either.\"","No wonder the old madam was so angry that she whipped him three times.","At least, that was what Major General Yang thought.","Commander Xia took a sip of water and replied proudly, \"No, Little Six knows.\"","Major General Yang was puzzled. Little Six knew? How did he know?","He had already complained to the old madam. If he knew, would he have complained?","Major General Yang’s expression was very suspicious. He needed Commander Xia to explain."]},{"number":4893,"title":"Chapter 4893: Strange Style","paragraphs":["Commander Xia’s office was located in a building that was filled with high-ranking generals. From the outside, it looked ordinary and inconspicuous, but inside, it was heavily guarded.","In addition to the infrared surveillance, there were also countless cameras hidden. They were not for nothing.","At this moment, the sky outside was gradually turning dark. All the matters for the day had been completed. There were no more documents sent over. No one disturbed Commander Xia, who had some personal time. He drank a glass of water to moisten his throat. Commander Xia, who was feeling comfortable, smiled and opened his mouth.","\"Firstly, he dares complain to the old madam because he’s worried that he’ll really be transferred back. Secondly, he’s angry that I don’t believe in him.\" Commander Xia smiled as he spoke. The wrinkles at the corners of his eyes were filled with comfort. \"Even the retired old master can’t interfere with the military unit’s matters. Can the old madam do that? The only thing the old madam can do is to beat me up and let me understand that she’ll beat me up if I don’t even trust my own son.\"","Major General Yang was enlightened.","He couldn’t help but laugh. \"The dynamics between you and Little Six are really different. Even though I’ve been by your side for decades, I still can’t understand everything.\"","Both parties were clearly aware of each other’s intentions, but they still wanted to pull tricks on each other. They were secretly competing with each other so much that others really thought that the father and son were at odds. They would argue whenever they met and pull tricks on each other behind their backs!","Commander Xia was very reserved and didn’t reveal the smugness in his heart. He cleared his throat and explained to his old subordinate, \"Before Little Six grew up, he did think that I was a ruthless father. As for me, I didn’t want to explain. I was so angry that he couldn’t understand me that I decided to use force.","\"Especially during his rebellious years. Sometimes, my temper was so bad that I scared myself. Later, Little Six became sensible and slowly learned to ponder the reason for my actions. That’s how I came back to my senses.","\"It’s a pity that the way we interact has already been fixed. I’m not used to suddenly taking the gentle path, let alone Little Six.","\"I dare say that if I suddenly show concern for Little Six one day, he’ll definitely think that I’m sick. He’ll even think that I’m about to die,which is why I’m expressing my love for him before it’s too late.\"","Major General Yang was speechless.","This unique and unique father-son interaction broadened Major General Yang’s horizons!","After leaving, Major General Yang wanted to verify whether Commander Xia was the only one who thought so. A month later, he contacted Xia Jinyuan again to ask about Ye Jian, pretending to talk about this matter casually.","In order not to let Xia Jinyuan notice that he was probing, Major General Yang tried to persuade the father and son to talk things through. Resolving the problem with force wouldn’t solve the problem at all. That would only make the father and son’s relationship weaker and weaker.","Major General Yang had always been persuading him like this. Xia Jinyuan didn’t suspect anything and replied straightforwardly, \"One day, if the commander suddenly expresses concern for me, I’ll think that he’s sick. Don’t think too much. The commander and I are a little different from ordinary people. You just need to know that our relationship won’t be ruined.","From then on, when Major General Yang saw the father and son glaring at each other, he would just sit at the side and watch with interest while drinking water.","When Commander-in-Chief Xia learned that Xia Jinyuan had answered as he had guessed and that his ex-wife had come to the military headquarters to see him for several days in a row, he did not get angry. He just asked the guards to politely send his ex-wife away.","Yes, Madam Xiao was here again."]},{"number":4894,"title":"Chapter 4894: Using Someone Else To Act","paragraphs":["Although Madam Xiao hadn’t appeared in front of anyone in the Xia family for some time, she had been paying attention to Xia Jinyuan.","However, the Xia family had always kept a low profile. Even if she wanted to pay attention, it was difficult for her to find out anything about Xia Jinyuan.","This time, Madam Xiao learned about Xia Jinyuan from her old best friend, Madam Li.","Madam Xiao, who had been away from the country for too long, didn’t have many good friends in the country. Even though she was Commander Xia’s ex-wife, it was impossible for her to reveal her identity to the madams of the chiefs of the military. The only one she could find out about the Xia family from was the Li family.","Madam Li and Madam Xiao had a fake friendship. Madam Xiao used Madam Li to find out about the Xia family and her only son, Xia Jinyuan.","There were no eternal enemies, only eternal interests. Madam Xiao was not stupid. She had no one to rely on after returning to the country. She would not let herself lose even a fake friend.","Even though this friend had been lying to her for decades and even instigated her to betray her marriage and abandon her husband and son to leave the country with her lover, Madam Xiao, who gradually realized the truth of the matter, did not fall out with Madam Li.","This was because she knew her limits. She knew that even if it weren’t for Madam Li, with her personality, she wouldn’t be able to maintain a marriage where she wouldn’t even be able to see her husband once a year. Even though Madam Li’s instigation had the effect of adding fuel to the fire, she would’ve made the same choice regardless.","Hence, she couldn’t push her responsibility to others. There was no need for her to fall out with her friend who had been pretending for decades.","Old Madam Xia had always said that Madam Xiao lived for herself and was a selfish person. It could be seen that Old Madam Xia was sharp and could see through Madam Xiao’s nature.","People like Madam Xiao, who wanted to leave or stay as she pleased, should just live life their own way.","Unfortunately, after returning to the country, she suddenly remembered that she still had a son. She wanted to make things up for him. She thought that it was hard to cut off bloodline, so she wanted to get close to him. However, she forgot that even though the men of the Xia family were affectionate, they wouldn’t drag their feet and acknowledge her again.","Xia Jinyuan wouldn’t do it, and neither would Commander Xia.","Madam Xiao watched as her ex-husband’s car drove away. Her makeup was so exquisite that her actual age couldn’t be seen. She stared expressionlessly at the sedan with a military license plate in front of her that was driving farther and farther away. She gripped the expensive handbag in her hand tightly.","After the car drove out of sight, Madam Xiao adjusted her breathing and calmed down a little. She took out her phone and called Madam Li.","\"Help me ask Old Li if Xia Xinhui has any meetings during this period of time.\"","As soon as Madam Xiao spoke, Madam Li, who was waiting for news at home, knew that Madam Xiao hadn’t seen Commander Xia. Her expression turned cold. Madam Li nodded and said, \"Okay, I’ll ask Old Li when he comes back. Don’t be too anxious. Maybe my daughter just randomly guessed it.\"","Du Jiayi, who was sitting at the side, lowered her voice anxiously. \"Mom, why would you say that? Ye Ying isn’t a good person. How good can Ye Jian be?!","\"I’ve really seen her with Xia Jinyuan! She was also with Cousin!\"","Madam Li quickly covered the mouthpiece to prevent the other party from hearing her. She glared at her daughter and reprimanded, \"No one will believe you! Sit down properly. I have my own plans.\"","Regardless, that wild girl... was indeed not a good person. If she really hooked up with Xia Jinyuan or Li Jinnian, it wouldn’t affect Du Jiayi at all. So, she could hook up with whoever she wanted."]},{"number":4895,"title":"Chapter 4895: Seducing","paragraphs":["Madam Li had a bad impression of Ye Ying. Even though it had been a few years, whenever Ye Ying’s name was mentioned, her heart would still feel suffocated.","As for Ye Jian, more than half of Madam Li’s opinion of her was brought about by Ye Ying. The other half... was from the first time she saw Ye Jian. She didn’t like her.","In addition, Du Jiayi would complain about Ye Jian from time to time, saying that Ye Jian had done all kinds of shameless things. Madam Li’s impression of Ye Jian became even worse. A wild girl from the mountains was flirting with all kinds of people. She wanted to climb the social ladder. She was indeed the same as her cousin, Ye Ying!","But now, even Qin Xiu was implicated. Madam Li had to be on guard even if this matter had nothing to do with Ye Jian. It was best to push that wild girl out.","If she couldn’t push Ye Jian to the Xia family, she could push her to Li Jinnian.","An orphan girl without parents and an ungrateful soul who was not liked by the elders in the family... They were very compatible!","Du Jiayi wanted to say a few more words, but Madam Li’s gaze made her shut up and sit at the side unhappily.","Madam Xiao said something, and Madam Li smiled. \"You’re too nervous. She’s just a wild child from the mountains. She has no one to rely on. The only thing she has is her identity as a military school student. Where did she get the ability to seduce young masters?","\"My nephew, Li Jinnian, doesn’t return home all year round. It’s useless for her to get to know him. As for Little Six, it’s the same. He stays in the military unit all year round and doesn’t return home. She can’t cling to him either.","\"The Qin family... is the same. So what if they know each other? The three of them won’t contact her. You don’t have to be too nervous. Don’t be frightened by Jiayi.","\"If Little Six really likes that wild girl, Old Madam Xia will definitely not approve of her. How can Old Madam Xia let her grandson marry a wild girl who has no parents and no one to rely on?","Old Madam Xia...","That was right. Since Xia Xinhui was avoiding her, she could still look for Old Madam Xia!","The old madam would definitely not allow Yuan to bring a girl back casually. It was fine if she had a clean family background and a good character, but she was... a girl who provoked outsiders.","No matter how much Yuan disliked her as a mother, she had to stop him!","When Du Jiayi heard Madam Li mention Old Madam Xia, a smile slowly appeared on her cold face.","That was right!","Why didn’t she think of the old madam of the Xia family?","A smile finally appeared on Madam Xiao’s cold face. \"That’s right. Old Madam Xia won’t allow Little Six to bring a random girl back to the old residence.","\"Tell Jiayi to relax. Ye Jian’s just a wild girl. If Qin Xiu really likes her, it’s just for a moment of novelty. As time passes, he’ll naturally forget about her. As long as Madam Qin is satisfied with her, Du Jiayi can just sit still and wait. She shouldn’t lose her cool because of someone unimportant.","\"Madam Qin doesn’t just need a simple daughter-in-law. She needs a virtuous woman who can support Qin Xiu’s career. Madam Qin has seen Jiayi’s hard work and remembered it. That’s why she keeps restraining Qin Xiu and hasn’t allowed him to bring her back casually.","\"Based on Madam Qin’s attitude, Jiayi can rest assured.\"","Both Madam Xiao and Madam Li thought so. Sometimes, Du Jiayi thought so too. However, every time she thought of Ye Jian and what Madam Qin accidentally revealed, she would panic.","She was very, very flustered. It was a kind of panic that she couldn’t get over no matter how hard she tried."]},{"number":4896,"title":"Chapter 4896: Using A Blade","paragraphs":["Now that Ye Jian was handed over to Madam Xiao to deal with, Madam Xiao would look for Old Madam Xia again. Du Jiayi, who had once again used someone else to do the dirty work, coaxed Madam Xiao until wrinkles appeared in her eyes.","Du Jiayi was good. She was good at coaxing people.","If Xia Jinyuan were her daughter, things wouldn’t have turned out like this.","Madam Xiao thought gloomily after ending the call.","Then, she remembered that her only son might be won over by a wild girl from the mountains. Madam Xiao quickly put away the sorrow in her heart and thought about finding an opportunity to look for Old Madam Xia.","She definitely couldn’t look for the old madam directly. The old madam wouldn’t be willing to see her either. She had to think of something else.","Soon, Madam Xiao’s gaze landed on the fifth son of the Xia family, Xia Yunyin, who would occasionally have scandals with celebrities and models. In order to see the old madam, Madam Xiao spent a month setting up a trap.","Xia Jinyuan wasn’t the one who suffered the most in this setup. It was Xia Yunyin, who always barely avoided trouble. It was all thanks to this setup that Xia Yunyin, who gave the entire family a headache, surprisingly calmed down.","It could be considered a blessing in disguise.","It was three months later that Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian found out about Madam Xiao’s cheap shot. At this moment, the desert was scorching in the day and cold at night.","When Ye Jian found out that Madam Xiao’s scheme caused Xia Yunyin to be sent to the hospital, she was stunned.","\"Madam Xiao’s combat power is so strong. Why didn’t I realize it in the past?\" Ye Jian was ashamed of her misjudgement. \"No wonder you blocked her back then and didn’t allow her to see me. It turns out that you and the commander know how powerful she is.\"","Xia Jinyuan glanced at his foolish future wife and knocked her forehead with his hand that was wearing a combat glove. \"What else do you think? Madam Xiao is so powerful that even the old madam is amazed by her. With your personality, she can destroy you with a flick of her finger.\"","He hadn’t said why Madam Xiao wanted to scheme against Xia Yunyin. If he said it, she would be dumbfounded.","There was no need to tell her anything bad. She just needed to know what kind of person Madam Xiao was. She was someone who would scheme against others!","Ye Jian wanted to ask why Madam Xiao went to frame Xia Yunyin. Before she could ask, Xia Jinyuan had already changed the topic. He asked when she was preparing to start the next training stage. He planned to enter the second stage the day after tomorrow.","As the two of them were talking, the squad leader of the female soldier class, Lieutenant Yang Zhen, rushed into the office anxiously. When she saw that the instructor of the male soldier class was also here, she saluted and said anxiously, \"Instructor, Gao Xiao and Qiu Tong are fighting! They’re using their daggers!\"","\"What?\" Ye Jian was shocked. She placed the military canteen on the desk and ran out. \"Where are they fighting? Is anyone watching them? Why did they fight?\"","Xia Jinyuan’s expression darkened on the spot. He said, \"Let’s go over together.\" Then, they ran together.","Yang Zhen replied hurriedly as she ran, \"It’s a small training ground. Our comrades are all here. We were afraid that something would happen to the two of them. Gao Xiao asked Qiu Tong out to compete, and Qiu Tong won. We didn’t take it to heart.","\"After that, I don’t know what Qiu Tong said, but Gao Xiao suddenly became agitated. Qiu Tong said a few more words, but I wasn’t able to hear her clearly. Wang Zi said that she heard Qiu Tong apologize to Gao Xiao, so her emotions turned agitated.","Ye Jian’s gaze turned cold. \"Who was the first to take out their dagger?\"","\"Gao Xiao was the first. We were all shocked.\" Yang Zhen’s expression was quite ugly too. As a first lieutenant, she was still a second-in-command in the past. She came for her dream and became a squad leader. In the end, she couldn’t even manage a class with 20 people. Yang Zhen blamed herself.","Ye Jian was surprised to know that Gao Xiao was the first to use her knife. Her expression was even colder than the cold wind in the middle of the night."]},{"number":4897,"title":"Chapter 4897: Heavy Punishment","paragraphs":["It was not uncommon for soldiers to quarrel in the military unit, especially among the male soldiers. They were a group of hot-blooded young people. It was normal for them to clash with each other. However, after the quarrel, they might become brothers.","Basically, when soldiers quarreled, they would at most be reprimanded and warned by the squad leaders.","Fighting was different. If it were just a few punches and small collisions, they wouldn’t cause any damage. They would just be reprimanded and grounded.","If two people really fought, all the soldiers would be severely punished because of their fight. Being grounded for a few days was a small matter. Not being allowed to sleep and carrying loads for more than ten kilometers are the consequences of fighting.","However, this time, it wasn’t just a fist fight.","Gao Xiao used her dagger!","She swung the dagger that was supposed to stab the enemy at her comrade. It was no longer as simple as fighting. It had directly become a charge for intentional injury!","If Qiu Tong was injured, Gao Xiao would be punished according to the military rules, be given a demerit, and be confined. These would be stains for the rest of her life!","Ye Jian ran extremely fast. Yang Zhen, who had good stamina, only ran for less than 300 meters before she couldn’t keep up with Ye Jian’s speed.","Looking at the two figures in front of her who were running as fast as lightning, Yang Zhen started to worry for Gao Xiao and Qiu Tong.","In the small sports ground, the female soldiers took the opportunity to snatch the dagger in Gao Xiao’s hand. One of the deputy squad leaders knew that Gao Xiao had caused a huge disaster. She was so angry that she punched Gao Xiao’s stomach. She shouted angrily, \"Gao Xiao! Do you not want to live anymore? How dare you use a dagger?!\"","Gao Xiao, who had her upper body grabbed by another female soldier and couldn’t move her arms, forcefully pushed away the deputy squad leader’s fist. Her abdomen was hurting. She smiled coldly and snorted. \"It’s just a spar. You’re thinking too much!\"","\"You’re still being stubborn!\" The face of the deputy squad leader was ashen. She wanted to punch her again. \"The instructor will be here soon. You should think about how to explain to the instructor!\"","Explain what? Pfft!","Gao Xiao turned her head and glared coldly at Qiu Tong, who was being persuaded by the two female soldiers. She sneered, \"Qiu Tong, do you think we were sparring just now?\"","\"Really? Do you really want to spar?\"","A voice as cold as ice came from behind. Instantly, the atmosphere in the venue froze. The air pressure suddenly increased. The tension in the air was so thick as if it could be cut with a knife. It pressed down on the female soldiers until they couldn’t breathe.","All the female soldiers, including Gao Xiao, froze. They turned around in unison and saw their instructor Ye and the male soldier, Instructor Xia, standing behind them.","The two of them made a good-looking pair. They stood like celestial beings in a painting, their expressions dark and cold. Their gazes swept over like a storm. When the female soldiers met their gazes, their hearts trembled.","Gao Xiao, whose body was stiff, whispered to her comrade who was still hugging her, \"Hurry up and let go!\"","\"Line up!\"","One of the deputy squad leaders shouted in a low voice. The female soldiers immediately moved. Gao Xiao was released because of this. She covered her abdomen that was hurting from the deputy squad leader’s beating and quickly lined up.","The squad leader, Yang Zhen, hadn’t run over. The deputy squad leaders were in charge of organizing the team.","The 19 female soldiers kept quiet out of fear. They were so frightened by the cold expressions of the two instructors that they didn’t dare to breathe loudly.","They were afraid that the mess today would be beyond fixing!","\"Who has the dagger?\" Ye Jian opened her mouth. Every word was as cold as a sword that could hurt people. The female soldiers’ shoulders tightened.","After interacting with her for three and a half months, they had seen how strict Instructor Ye was. They didn’t dare to make any cheap shots in front of her. Today, Gao Xiao and Qiu Tong sparred because they wanted to improve their abilities. Who knew that... Gao Xiao would suddenly go crazy?","一分割线一","姑娘们,青云的颈椎又犯病了,痛到脑袋都晕晕沉沉,还反胃...,咬牙更一章,我得爬床睡去了.","今晚别等,只有一更."]},{"number":4898,"title":"Chapter 4898: Lesson","paragraphs":["After the dagger was snatched away from Gao Xiao by a soldier, she immediately gave it to the deputy squad leader. When the deputy squad leader heard Ye Jian asking who had the dagger without asking why Gao Xiao and Qiu Tong had fought, her heart dropped. She gave Gao Xiao a look and handed the dagger to Ye Jian.","\"Report, the dagger is in my hand.\"","The deputy squad leader handed over the dagger. When she saw Ye Jian’s expression at a closer distance, she felt a chill in her bones. It was as if she had stepped into a cold lake. It was so cold that her teeth were trembling.","Oh no, oh no. Instructor Ye was extremely angry. They would definitely be severely punished.","Taking the dagger, Ye Jian pointed with the tip of the dagger and laughed. Her eyes were clear and stern. \"Gao Xiao, step out.\"","The female soldiers in the line couldn’t help but tighten their stomachs. Their backs straightened, and their facial expressions became more solemn.","\"Yes!\" Gao Xiao stepped out.","Ye Jian glanced at Gao Xiao and said, \"Come here.\"","The female soldiers glanced at Gao Xiao from the corner of their eyes. The uneasiness in their hearts grew.","This was bad!","Gao Xiao would definitely be in trouble. Instructor Ye wouldn’t let her off so easily.","Gao Xiao’s eyes flickered slightly as she pursed her lips. She hesitated when she took the first step. When she saw that Ye Jian’s gaze became even more vicious because of her hesitation, she took a deep breath and walked over firmly.","She knew that she made a mistake, but she didn’t regret it!","No matter what kind of heavy punishment she would face, she would accept it. She had no objections.","With every step she took, she would smile and tell herself that she didn’t regret it. When she was about one meter away from Ye Jian, a black shadow suddenly shot toward her with a vicious aura.","The female soldiers in the line only saw their instructor waving her arm gently. The black electro-plated combat dagger in her hand then turned into a black shadow that flew toward Gao Xiao...","The moment it was thrown out, the female soldiers’ pupils constricted. They were afraid that the dagger would stab Gao Xiao.","Gao Xiao reacted quickly too. She immediately halted her steps and stood on the spot in a daze. Then, she slowly lowered her head...","The combat dagger that was still in her hand a few minutes ago was now deeply embedded in the yellow sand.","\"Do you like to use daggers?\"","Not far away, a cold voice made Gao Xiao’s fingers tremble. Gao Xiao slowly raised her head. The second wave of fear had finally arrived.","\"Pick it up. Let me see how powerful you are!\" Ye Jian unbuttoned her camouflage cotton jacket. Then, she pulled down the zipper. Seeing that Gao Xiao didn’t move, she told Gao Xiao to pick up the dagger again with a cold expression, \"Pick up the dagger!\"","Every word was filled with a danger that made Qiu Tong’s and the others’ hearts tremble.Why did Instructor Ye ask Gao Xiao to pick up the dagger again?","Gao Xiao didn’t know either, but she had to pick it up.","Xia Jinyuan was the only one who knew what Ye Jian would do. His handsome face was cold as he reminded her in a low voice, \"Just scare her. Don’t really make her bleed.\"","\"Yeah.\"","Ye Jian, who was furious, only replied with a single word. Xia Jinyuan was worried that her anger would be detrimental to her health, so he reminded her from behind, \"Just teach her a lesson. Don’t be so angry.\"","Ye Jian said, \"Don’t worry. I’ll control it. I’ll take care of it. Go ahead.\" She paused for a moment and added, \"Don’t alarm the higher-ups. I’ll take care of it.\"","She wanted Xia Jinyuan to leave.","Xia Jinyuan thought for a moment. He saw that Ye Jian’s emotions weren’t fluctuating much and knew that she had always been calm when dealing with things. He nodded. \"Okay, look for me if you need anything.\"","The instructor needed to teach his soldiers a lesson. As the instructor of the male soldier class, it was indeed inconvenient for him to stay and watch."]},{"number":4899,"title":"Chapter 4899: So Cold","paragraphs":["After Xia Jinyuan left, Ye Jian, who had a cold expression on her face, walked toward Gao Xiao, who was bending down to pick up the dagger. She was only more than a meter away, and Ye Jian closed in on the distance in a few steps. The female soldiers held their breaths.","What did the instructor want to do?","Qiu Tong bit her lower lip. Just as she was about to step out, the deputy squad leader immediately shouted, \"Qiu Tong, stand properly! Can’t you see that the instructor is in a fit of anger?\"","Before the squad leader, Yang Zhen, appeared, the two deputy squad leaders had to restrain the soldiers in the class.","Yang Zhen also wanted to rush over as soon as possible, but she was stopped by Company Commander Zhu. He asked her what was going on and why she was so anxious. He even asked if something had happened to her class, which was why she was in a hurry to look for Instructor Ye.","Two comrades had pounced on each other. Yang Zhen didn’t dare to tell Company Commander Zhu about such a huge matter. Also, she didn’t want Company Commander Zhu to know.","Company Commander Zhu, who knew that Ye Jian managed the female soldier class well, didn’t suspect anything. He asked a few questions before letting Yang Zhen leave.","After he turned around and left, Yang Zhen started running quickly. She ran so fast that dust appeared under her feet. Company Commander Zhu turned around again and looked at the soldier beside him for a few seconds. He said in a tone as if he expected better from someone, \"Look at the female soldiers. Then, look at you. Comparisons are infuriating! She can run faster than you! From now on, the soldiers will run three kilometers with weights every day!\"","The female soldiers were improving day by day. The company commander was happy but also depressed. He didn’t feel that the male soldiers were improving!","Yang Zhen, who was heading to the sports ground, didn’t know that she had unintentionally increased the training for the male soldiers. When she met Xia Jinyuan, she could only nod hurriedly and run.","When she arrived at the sports ground, Yang Zhen, who was a few meters away, saw two figures fighting among the yellow dust. She ran until her vision turned black...","They were still fighting! They hadn’t stopped!","Where was Instructor Ye?","Why didn’t she stop them?","What were the female soldiers doing standing at the side?","Yang Zhen was so angry that blood rushed to her head. She ran until her legs were like fire and wind wheels. After running for one or two meters, Yang Zhen suddenly realized that something was wrong.","If Gao Xiao and Qiu Tong were still fighting... it was impossible for the female soldiers to stand in line and watch.","In that case, the two people fighting now might not be Gao Xiao or Qiu Tong.","Could it be that... one of them was Instructor Ye?","At the thought of this, Yang Zhen heaved a sigh of relief. As long as Gao Xiao and Qiu Tong weren’t fighting, everything was fine.","The female soldiers who were standing at the side couldn’t bear to look anymore. When Gao Xiao was thrown over Ye Jian’s shoulder for the third time, Qiu Tong had already looked away.","Instructor Ye said that since Gao Xiao had the ability to swing a dagger, she must have some skills. Why not let her, the instructor, experience it too?","Gao Xiao held the dagger in her hands, but Instructor Ye snatched it with her bare hands.","After snatching the dagger, Instructor Ye threw Gao Xiao once. By now... it was unknown whether Gao Xiao had fallen six or seven times.","How long had it been? Three to five minutes!","She fell twice in a minute. Even though she was the one falling, they all felt the pain.","Previously, a few of them spent a lot of effort to snatch the dagger from Gao Xiao’s hand. As for Instructor Ye, she didn’t need to put in much effort at all. Every time, she would snatch the dagger easily!","Just like now!","She directly kicked Gao Xiao’s right kneecap. Gao Xiao was in so much pain that she made a muffled sound. One of her knees kicked heavily into the sand. Even though she was wearing thick clothes, it was still painful to fall to her knees like this!","Gao Xiao, who was kicked by Ye Jian until she knelt on one knee, turned a little pale. She wanted to resist, but Ye Jian pulled her right hand that was holding the blade straight and twisted it toward her back. The pain of her shoulder joint twisting made Gao Xiao unable to control herself again. She let out a painful scream."]},{"number":4900,"title":"Chapter 4900: No Mercy!","paragraphs":["This wasn’t the end!","Ye Jian twisted her right wrist again. Gao Xiao screamed twice in pain. How could she still hold the dagger? The dagger in her hand fell to the ground for the sixth time. Right on the heels of that, Ye Jian kicked her in the back. She fell forward and landed on the ground. Her entire body was covered in dust. She was in a sorry state.","The female soldiers closed their eyes lightly. Their eyelids trembled.","Would Gao Xiao be able to take the beatings and kicks?","Ye Jian picked up the dagger that was covered in dust. As she walked, she used her fingers to wipe the dust off the dagger. She walked to Gao Xiao, who had yet to get up, and threw the dagger in front of her again. She lowered her eyes and said coldly, \"Stand up and continue!\"","The female soldiers lowered their eyes. Continue?","Would Instructor Ye cripple... Gao Xiao?","\"Don’t you like to use knives and guns? Don’t you think that you’re very capable? Don’t you think that you can pull out your dagger and hurt people with it? Why? Can’t you stand up? Is this all you can do?\"","Her cold voice was filled with sarcasm. Not to mention Gao Xiao, even the female soldiers in the line couldn’t hold it in anymore.","If Gao Xiao was really capable, she wouldn’t be reprimanded like this.","Instructor Ye was telling Gao Xiao that since she didn’t have the ability, she shouldn’t embarrass herself!","Gao Xiao, who was dizzy from all the falls and feeling a little nauseous, pushed her upper body up with her hands. She looked at the dagger that was thrown in front of her. Her face was pale as she raised her head. Her lips moved slightly, but before she could say anything, Ye Jian, who was looking at her coldly, said, \"I don’t want to hear any explanations from you now. Stand up and continue!\"","\"I’ll call out to three. If you don’t stand up, I’ll order all the female soldiers to pick up their daggers and swing them at you, their comrade!\"","\"One...\"","Gao Xiao was shocked. \"Instructor!\"","\"Two!\"","Gao Xiao got up. She knew that Ye Jian wasn’t joking. She would really do that!","\"Three!\"","Gao Xiao, who had stood up, grabbed her dagger tightly and screamed. She raised her dagger and pounced on Ye Jian again.","The moment she moved, her stomach churned and a wave of sourness rushed into her throat.","Ye Jian, who dodged, turned a blind eye to her discomfort. Didn’t Gao Xiao want to use the dagger? Then she would let Gao Xiao have it her way!","She actually used the dagger meant to kill enemies to attack her comrade who fought alongside her!Ye Jian would never show mercy!","Ye Jian saw the killing intent in her eyes. The coldness in her eyes intensified. The first crime was to stab her comrade with a dagger. The second crime was to show her knife without the ability to swing it!","Today, she would teach Gao Xiao a lesson that she would never forget!","Ye Jian grabbed Gao Xiao’s wrist with one hand and used her other hand to form a palm. She slashed at Gao Xiao’s wrist forcefully. She tripped Gao Xiao’s right leg and used the side of her knee to hit her knee to prevent Gao Xiao from raising her leg to kick her.","Gao Xiao, who had lost all resistance in her hands and legs, felt intense pain again. Her wrist hurt so much that her entire hand trembled uncontrollably. The intense pain in her wrist was still spreading throughout her entire body. Right on the heels of that, her right knee hurt again. The instant exhaustion made her kneel on one knee again...","In her panic, Gao Xiao wanted to use her hands to support herself. Unfortunately, Ye Jian didn’t give her a chance. She raised her leg and used her calf as a force point to hit Gao Xiao’s back.","\"Pfft...\"","Gao Xiao, who had suffered a heavy blow to her back, grunted. Her palm brushed against the gravel, and a burning pain came from her palm. She fell to the ground, and a layer of dust rose around her body."]}]);
